Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.57,0:00:16.57,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fs16\blur20\fad(200,200)\pos(195.6,234.533)}使用AI工具翻译，如有不准确的地方请在弹幕或评论区指正，谢谢！\N！！真的有人看不到这行字！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:21.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur20\fad(200,200)\pos(195.6,234.533)}翻译质量权威评价：原来25年就有小拉即用机翻糊弄人了
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,以下是资深玩家熟知的我的世界冷知识 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Here are things veteran players know about Minecraft.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.72,0:00:06.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你在Alpha和Beta时代玩过这款游戏 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:03.72,0:00:06.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you played Minecraft in the Alpha and Beta days,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.78,0:00:12.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,一定会记得针叶林生物群系中的云杉树曾经会掉落橡木木板 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:06.78,0:00:08.67,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you'll definitely remember when the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.67,0:00:12.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,spruce trees in Tiger Biomes would give you oak wooden planks.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.78,0:00:15.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当时游戏里只有橡木这一种木板类型 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.78,0:00:15.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Since oak was the only plank type at the time,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.52,0:00:18.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以云杉和白桦树也都只能产出橡木板 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:15.52,0:00:18.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the spruce and birch trees just gave you oak planks as well,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.86,0:00:20.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,现在回想起来确实挺奇怪的 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.86,0:00:20.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which was kinda weird looking back.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.98,0:00:24.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 如果你记得所有树木都只掉落橡木板的年代 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:20.98,0:00:24.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But yeah, if you remember every tree type giving you oak planks,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.38,0:00:26.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是骨灰级玩家 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:24.38,0:00:26.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you're definitely a veteran player.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.64,0:00:32.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不知是不是我的错觉 看到这个老版的2D门贴图简直回忆暴击？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:26.64,0:00:29.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Is it just me, or does looking at this old 2D door 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.82,0:00:32.07,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,sprite give me a huge amount of nostalgia?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.44,0:00:36.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说真的 Alpha和Beta版本里关于门的一切都让人瞬间穿越 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:32.44,0:00:36.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I dunno man, everything about doors in Alpha and Beta are a huge throwback,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.92,0:00:39.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而那个老版门的贴图更是时代的眼泪
Dialogue: 2,0:00:36.92,0:00:39.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and the old door sprite is no exception.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.36,0:00:44.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我们都知道现在我的世界中的水会根据生物群系改变色调
Dialogue: 2,0:00:39.36,0:00:42.05,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So we all know that water in Minecraft today 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.05,0:00:44.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,changes colour shade depending on the biome.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.80,0:00:46.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但如果你是我的世界老玩家 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:44.80,0:00:46.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But if you're a Minecraft veteran,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.52,0:00:51.22,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你记忆中的水应该只有这种饱和度极高的亮蓝色
Dialogue: 2,0:00:46.52,0:00:51.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the only water you'll remember is the vibrant blue water that looks like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.36,0:00:54.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,光是看着这水就让我怀念到不行 这正常吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:51.36,0:00:54.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Is it weird that I'm getting so much nostalgia just looking at this water?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.92,0:00:56.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,让我想起那段更纯粹的时光
Dialogue: 2,0:00:54.92,0:00:56.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Reminds me of a simpler time,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.58,0:00:59.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你玩过我的世界Alpha或Beta版本
Dialogue: 2,0:00:56.58,0:00:59.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you were a Minecraft Alpha or Beta player,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.58,0:01:04.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你肯定记得 黏土块曾经是最难找到的方块之一
Dialogue: 2,0:00:59.58,0:01:01.15,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you'll definitely remember when
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.15,0:01:04.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,clay was once one of the hardest blocks to find.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.24,0:01:07.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 那时候黏土可比钻石还稀罕 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:04.24,0:01:07.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, with clay being rarer than diamonds at the time,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.66,0:01:09.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,发现这种方块时简直让人兴奋不已
Dialogue: 2,0:01:07.66,0:01:09.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,coming across this block was exciting,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.84,0:01:11.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但同时也挺扫兴的
Dialogue: 2,0:01:09.84,0:01:11.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but also kinda underwhelming
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.60,0:01:14.75,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为当时唯一能做的  就是把它合成砖块
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.60,0:01:14.75,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,as the only thing you could do with it was craft bricks.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.78,0:01:18.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过话说回来  考虑到那时候的建筑方块少得可怜
Dialogue: 2,0:01:14.78,0:01:18.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Then again, considering how little building blocks we had back then,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.40,0:01:21.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我们确实没什么可挑的  也实在没法抱怨
Dialogue: 2,0:01:18.40,0:01:21.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,we weren't really spoilt for choice and couldn't really complain,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.40,0:01:22.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说实话吧 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:21.40,0:01:22.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,let's be real.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.20,0:01:23.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说到砖块
Dialogue: 2,0:01:22.20,0:01:23.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,And speaking of bricks,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.44,0:01:27.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你们还记得Alpha和Beta时期  砖块的那个老材质
Dialogue: 2,0:01:23.44,0:01:27.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,if you guys remember the old texture for bricks from the Alpha and Beta days,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.76,0:01:29.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是个骨灰级老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.76,0:01:29.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you're definitely a veteran player.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.88,0:01:33.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我是说 那时候玩家们对砖块的评价可真是两极分化
Dialogue: 2,0:01:29.88,0:01:33.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, players at the time had such a divided opinion on bricks,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.10,0:01:34.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,有人夸它是绝佳建材
Dialogue: 2,0:01:33.10,0:01:34.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,with some saying it was great for building,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.18,0:01:37.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而另一些人则嫌它丑得要命
Dialogue: 2,0:01:35.18,0:01:37.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,whilst others said it was straight up ugly.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.40,0:01:38.67,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Alpha和Beta版本里
Dialogue: 2,0:01:37.40,0:01:38.67,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Alpha and Beta,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.67,0:01:42.63,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,护甲的防护值完全取决于耐久度
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.67,0:01:42.63,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the protection of your armour was entirely based on durability.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.66,0:01:49.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这意味着严重破损的钻石甲  防护效果还不如崭新的皮甲
Dialogue: 2,0:01:42.66,0:01:45.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This meant a badly damaged diamond armour would provide
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.96,0:01:49.03,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,less protection than a fully durable piece of leather armour,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.18,0:01:51.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这简直就...什么鬼设定？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.18,0:01:51.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is just that... what is this?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.20,0:01:52.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个机制蠢到离谱
Dialogue: 2,0:01:51.20,0:01:52.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This was such a silly feature,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.94,0:01:53.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,要是你还记得这个细节
Dialogue: 2,0:01:52.94,0:01:53.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and if you remember this,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.98,0:01:56.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是MC元老级玩家
Dialogue: 2,0:01:53.98,0:01:56.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.44,0:01:57.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛曾经强得变态
Dialogue: 2,0:01:56.44,0:01:57.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Spiders used to be OP.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.38,0:02:03.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为在1.8版本之前  蜘蛛能隔着墙壁追踪玩家
Dialogue: 2,0:01:58.38,0:02:03.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This was because spiders before 1.8 could track and see players through walls.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.64,0:02:09.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当年下矿洞时总被突然扑脸的蜘蛛  吓得灵魂出窍
Dialogue: 2,0:02:03.64,0:02:07.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This was terrifying as I'd be caving in the Beta days
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.00,0:02:09.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and spiders would just jump scare me out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.10,0:02:13.71,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个机制还导致蜘蛛总爱趴在天花板上
Dialogue: 2,0:02:10.10,0:02:13.71,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This feature also caused spiders to always be on ceilings
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.71,0:02:16.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为它们会从墙的另一侧爬上来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.71,0:02:16.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,due to them climbing up the wall on the other side.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.38,0:02:20.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,有时候蜘蛛就会从头顶  突然掉到你头上
Dialogue: 2,0:02:16.38,0:02:20.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This would then sometimes cause the spiders to drop on your head from above,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.34,0:02:21.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这简直恐怖加倍
Dialogue: 2,0:02:20.34,0:02:21.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which was even more terrifying.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.12,0:02:27.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,, 你们还记得以前史莱姆有多难找吗
Dialogue: 2,0:02:22.12,0:02:24.15,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, do you guys remember 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.15,0:02:27.17,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,when slimes in the old days were really hard to find?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.34,0:02:29.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那时候还没有沼泽群系
Dialogue: 2,0:02:27.34,0:02:29.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Since swamp biomes didn't exist at the time,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.78,0:02:33.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,想找到史莱姆  只能往洞穴最深处钻
Dialogue: 2,0:02:29.78,0:02:33.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the only way you could find slimes was deep within cave systems,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.52,0:02:35.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而且就算这样也难得一见
Dialogue: 2,0:02:33.52,0:02:35.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and even this was a rare encounter.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.88,0:02:42.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但当年判断找到史莱姆  全靠听它们标志性的经典音效
Dialogue: 2,0:02:35.88,0:02:38.65,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But the main way you'd know if you found slimes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.65,0:02:42.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,was by hearing those iconic distinct old sounds for the slimes.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.98,0:02:44.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,听听看...
Dialogue: 2,0:02:42.98,0:02:44.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Take a listen...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.00,0:02:51.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说真的 如果你还记得这些老版史莱姆音效 
Dialogue: 2,0:02:49.00,0:02:51.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Seriously, if you remember these old slime sounds,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.56,0:02:52.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是骨灰级老玩家  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:51.56,0:02:52.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a veteran player.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.96,0:02:54.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这些音效年代太久远了  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:52.96,0:02:54.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,These are so old.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.24,0:02:56.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在早期版本中  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:54.24,0:02:56.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.56,0:02:59.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,甘蔗原本叫做芦苇  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:56.56,0:02:59.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,sugarcane was originally called reeds.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.48,0:03:01.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你还记得芦苇这个叫法  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:59.48,0:03:01.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now if you remember when it was called reeds,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.66,0:03:06.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你铁定是老玩家 因为这称呼12年前就改了  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:01.66,0:03:03.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you're definitely a veteran player
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.48,0:03:06.83,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,because sugarcane was called this over 12 years ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.96,0:03:09.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,众所周知粉红羊在游戏中很罕见  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:06.96,0:03:09.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So we all know that pink sheep are a rare find in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.14,0:03:12.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但我们对它们的样子并不陌生  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:10.14,0:03:12.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but we're still familiar with how they look.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.26,0:03:15.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过如果你玩过远古版本  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:12.26,0:03:15.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, if you played Minecraft in the olden days,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.44,0:03:20.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,一定会记得当年粉红羊的毛色  其实是更浅的粉色
Dialogue: 2,0:03:15.44,0:03:17.87,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you'll definitely remember when the pink sheep
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.87,0:03:20.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,had a much lighter shade of pink for their wall.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.94,0:03:21.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,回看这些老物
Dialogue: 2,0:03:20.94,0:03:21.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Looking back at them,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.86,0:03:25.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,对比现今鲜艳的粉红羊  当年的配色确实显得有点怪异
Dialogue: 2,0:03:21.86,0:03:25.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they honestly look kinda strange compared to the vibrant pink sheep we have now.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.08,0:03:27.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但如果你是老玩家的话
Dialogue: 2,0:03:26.08,0:03:27.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But yeah, if you're a veteran player,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.98,0:03:29.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你八成还记得这些老版本的样子
Dialogue: 2,0:03:27.98,0:03:29.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'll probably remember these.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.64,0:03:32.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你玩过Alpha或Beta时期的我的世界
Dialogue: 2,0:03:29.64,0:03:32.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you played Minecraft in the alpha or beta days,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.72,0:03:36.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那会儿你们多半都把家安在山里或洞穴中
Dialogue: 2,0:03:32.72,0:03:36.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then most of you likely built your base within a mountain or a cave.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.06,0:03:39.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这是因为当时游戏中的方块种类还不多
Dialogue: 2,0:03:37.06,0:03:39.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This was due to Minecraft not having many blocks yet,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.08,0:03:41.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以玩家们只有两种选择
Dialogue: 2,0:03:40.08,0:03:41.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,so players had two choices.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.86,0:03:47.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,要么造个和其他人一样  方方正正的简陋木屋
Dialogue: 2,0:03:41.86,0:03:45.07,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,They could either build the same blocky ugly wooden house
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.07,0:03:47.75,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that looked the same as every other blocky wooden house,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.88,0:03:53.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,要么就造个与beta地形完美融合  依山而建的漂亮基地
Dialogue: 2,0:03:47.88,0:03:50.37,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,or they could build a lovely mountain base
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.37,0:03:53.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that blended in beautifully with the beta terrain.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.30,0:03:55.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你当年造的是木屋还是山体基地？
Dialogue: 2,0:03:53.30,0:03:55.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Did you build a wooden house or a mountain base?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.96,0:03:57.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在评论区告诉我吧 
Dialogue: 2,0:03:55.96,0:03:57.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Let me know in the comments.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.18,0:03:59.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界的早期版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:03:57.18,0:03:59.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.56,0:04:04.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,Alpha和Beta时期的船  既糟糕透顶又令人惊叹
Dialogue: 2,0:03:59.56,0:04:04.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,boats in the alpha and beta days were terrible but also amazing at the same time.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.84,0:04:09.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这是因为在Minecraftbeta中  船曾是速度最快的交通工具
Dialogue: 2,0:04:04.84,0:04:09.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This was because boats were used as the fastest way to travel in Minecraft beta.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.88,0:04:14.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,具体操作就是在相邻方块上  并排放置多艘船
Dialogue: 2,0:04:09.88,0:04:14.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This was done by placing a bunch of boats on their own blocks next to each other,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.32,0:04:17.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当时人们称之为“船桥”
Dialogue: 2,0:04:14.32,0:04:17.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,forming what was called a boat bridge at the time.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.12,0:04:23.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,于是你只需坐在船里  一边前进一边右键点击其他船只  就能快速穿越这座“船桥”
Dialogue: 2,0:04:17.12,0:04:20.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You could then travel by sitting in a boat and right-clicking on
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.74,0:04:23.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the other boats as you progressed across the bridge.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.58,0:04:27.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以如果你还记得  这种坐船飙车的骚操作
Dialogue: 2,0:04:23.58,0:04:27.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, if you remember this extremely fast way to travel in a boat,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.20,0:04:29.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是个骨灰级老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:04:27.20,0:04:29.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a veteran player.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.16,0:04:32.22,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你玩过Beta 1.8版本的我的世界
Dialogue: 2,0:04:29.16,0:04:32.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you played Minecraft in version beta 1.8,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.28,0:04:37.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你可能还记得  当时游戏里所有方块的物品栏贴图都错乱了
Dialogue: 2,0:04:32.28,0:04:34.97,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you might remember when every block in the game
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.97,0:04:37.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,had messed up inventory textures.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.48,0:04:41.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这是因为所有方块贴图的光照效果都消失了
Dialogue: 2,0:04:37.48,0:04:41.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This was because the lighting effects on all the block textures were missing,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.04,0:04:46.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以每个方块基本都没有阴影效果  看起来简直糟糕透顶
Dialogue: 2,0:04:42.04,0:04:46.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,so every block basically had no shading which looked absolutely terrible.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.04,0:04:48.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但没错 如果你还记得这个 
Dialogue: 2,0:04:47.04,0:04:48.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But yeah, if you remember this,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.80,0:04:51.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是个资深玩家  要么就是我们俩都挺奇葩的
Dialogue: 2,0:04:48.80,0:04:51.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you're definitely a veteran player or we're both just weird,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.00,0:04:52.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为说实话 
Dialogue: 2,0:04:52.00,0:04:52.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,because let's be real,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.04,0:04:54.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,根本没人注意到这个细节
Dialogue: 2,0:04:53.04,0:04:54.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,hardly anyone noticed this.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.88,0:05:01.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得以前  创建世界只要一两秒的日子吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:54.88,0:04:57.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, do you guys remember back to a time
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.84,0:05:01.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,where Minecraft worlds only took like 1-2 seconds to create?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.16,0:05:05.22,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那真是个美好的时代啊  因为现在的我的世界里
Dialogue: 2,0:05:02.16,0:05:05.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Man, that was a beautiful time because nowadays in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.52,0:05:07.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,生成一个世界要等上十年那么久
Dialogue: 2,0:05:05.52,0:05:07.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,worlds take like 10 years to create.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.84,0:05:09.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我是说 我理解现在游戏里加了这么多内容
Dialogue: 2,0:05:07.84,0:05:09.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, I get there's a lot of features in the game now,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.06,0:05:13.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但我还是会怀念beta时期  那时候世界生成得多快啊
Dialogue: 2,0:05:10.06,0:05:13.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but I just think back to beta and how quickly a world would create.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.50,0:05:17.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我以前真是身在福中不知福  现在生成世界简直慢得要命
Dialogue: 2,0:05:13.50,0:05:17.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Boy, oh boy, did I take this for granted because it just takes forever now.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.84,0:05:18.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我依然深爱着我的世界
Dialogue: 2,0:05:17.84,0:05:18.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I still love your Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.08,0:05:19.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,别担心
Dialogue: 2,0:05:19.08,0:05:19.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,don't worry.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.70,0:05:25.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得以前游戏里  箱子被放置时永远朝西的年代吗
Dialogue: 2,0:05:19.70,0:05:22.11,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember when chests in the game
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.11,0:05:25.77,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,would only face the west direction when they were placed by the player?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.90,0:05:26.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为我还记得 
Dialogue: 2,0:05:25.90,0:05:26.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Because I do.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.98,0:05:33.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这设计太烦人了  因为那时候玩家唯一能解决的办法  就是造个双箱或者...
Dialogue: 2,0:05:26.98,0:05:30.29,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Man, was it so annoying because the only way players could fix
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.29,0:05:33.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,this back in the day was by creating a double chest or
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.12,0:05:35.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,把单箱贴着墙放
Dialogue: 2,0:05:33.12,0:05:35.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,placing the single chest against a wall.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.46,0:05:38.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过话说回来 要是你还记得箱子永远朝同一个方向的日子 
Dialogue: 2,0:05:35.46,0:05:38.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But yeah, if you remember the chest always facing the same way,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.62,0:05:40.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是个老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:05:38.62,0:05:40.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you're definitely a veteran player.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.92,0:05:47.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,相信很多我的世界老玩家都记得  在beta探索洞穴时听到的这个声音
Dialogue: 2,0:05:40.92,0:05:43.85,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm sure a lot of you Minecraft veterans remember
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.85,0:05:47.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,exploring a cave in the beta days and hearing this sound.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.96,0:05:51.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,或是这个声音 
Dialogue: 2,0:05:49.96,0:05:51.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Or this sound.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.06,0:05:57.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,又或者是这个声音
Dialogue: 2,0:05:55.06,0:05:57.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Or even this sound.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.10,0:06:05.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,洞穴音效绝对是我的世界里最瘆人的元素之一
Dialogue: 2,0:06:02.10,0:06:05.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Man, the cave sounds are definitely one of the creepiest things about Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.24,0:06:10.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但在空无一人的洞穴里听到这些声音
Dialogue: 2,0:06:06.24,0:06:10.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but there was something even scarier about hearing these cave sounds in an empty,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.28,0:06:12.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,孤零零的beta洞穴里  这些音效简直让人毛骨悚然
Dialogue: 2,0:06:10.28,0:06:12.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,isolating alpha or beta version.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.12,0:06:14.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你是个我的世界老玩家 
Dialogue: 2,0:06:13.12,0:06:14.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you're a Minecraft veteran,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.50,0:06:18.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你肯定懂我在说什么  因为alpha和beta真的超恐怖
Dialogue: 2,0:06:14.50,0:06:16.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you'll definitely know what I'm talking about
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.22,0:06:18.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,because alpha and beta was scary,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.48,0:06:24.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得官网上那个免费的《我的世界经典版》吗
Dialogue: 2,0:06:18.48,0:06:21.51,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, do you guys remember the free version of
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.51,0:06:24.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Minecraft Classic that you could play on the Minecraft website?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.00,0:06:26.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这简直太棒了
Dialogue: 2,0:06:25.00,0:06:26.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This was awesome, man.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.52,0:06:32.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这为买不起正版的玩家  提供了体验基础建造功能的机会
Dialogue: 2,0:06:26.52,0:06:29.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It was a great way for players who couldn't afford Minecraft to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.76,0:06:32.43,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,try out the basic building aspect of the game.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.66,0:06:36.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,又或者 你当年可能也是那些玩盗版我的世界的玩家之一
Dialogue: 2,0:06:32.66,0:06:34.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Or, you know, you could have been one of those players
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.42,0:06:36.15,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that just cracked Minecraft back then.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.44,0:06:40.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但没错 如果你还记得能在官网上玩《我的世界经典版》
Dialogue: 2,0:06:36.44,0:06:40.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But yeah, if you remember being able to play Minecraft Classic on the website,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.78,0:06:42.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是个骨灰级老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:06:40.78,0:06:42.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you're definitely a veteran player.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.08,0:06:50.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得以前我的世界里  被动生物会不断自动生成  就算你已经...
Dialogue: 2,0:06:43.08,0:06:46.43,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember back to a time where passive mobs
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.43,0:06:50.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,would constantly spawn in your Minecraft world even after you've
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.50,0:06:52.22,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,生成过附近区块后  被动生物仍会不断刷新？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:50.50,0:06:52.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,generated the nearby chunks?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.62,0:06:56.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在如今的我的世界中 一旦被动生物在某个区块内生成 
Dialogue: 2,0:06:52.62,0:06:56.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft today, once a passive mob spawns within a specific chunk,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.84,0:06:59.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那个区块就再也不会生成新的动物了
Dialogue: 2,0:06:56.84,0:06:59.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,no more animals will be able to spawn within that chunk.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.26,0:07:05.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这会导致你的世界里出现很多再也无法生成新动物的“死亡区域”
Dialogue: 2,0:07:00.26,0:07:03.15,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This leads to a lot of dead areas in your world
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.15,0:07:05.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that won't be able to spawn any new animals,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:05.72,0:07:07.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这确实挺让人头疼的 
Dialogue: 2,0:07:05.72,0:07:07.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which can be kind of annoying.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.36,0:07:11.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这就是为什么在Alpha和Beta版本中  被动生物会源源不断地刷新  
Dialogue: 2,0:07:07.36,0:07:11.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This is why passive mobs in Alpha and Beta would always be spawning,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.62,0:07:15.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为那时候区块内的被动生物生成数量  根本没有上限
Dialogue: 2,0:07:11.62,0:07:15.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,because there was no cap on how many passive mobs could spawn within a chunk.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.54,0:07:16.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以啊 要是你还记得这些 
Dialogue: 2,0:07:15.54,0:07:16.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, if you remember this,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.00,0:07:19.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是个老玩家了 
Dialogue: 2,0:07:17.00,0:07:19.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you're definitely a veteran player.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.42,0:07:21.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界早期版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:07:19.42,0:07:21.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.68,0:07:24.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玩家可以通过击打门  来开关它们
Dialogue: 2,0:07:21.68,0:07:24.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,players were able to open and close doors by punching them.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.06,0:07:26.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而在如今的我的世界中
Dialogue: 2,0:07:25.06,0:07:26.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Whereas in Minecraft today,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.42,0:07:27.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,击打门只会
Dialogue: 2,0:07:26.42,0:07:27.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,punching a door does,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:27.84,0:07:28.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,毫无反应
Dialogue: 2,0:07:27.84,0:07:28.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,well, nothing.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.60,0:07:30.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你用拳头砸门来开门 
Dialogue: 2,0:07:28.60,0:07:30.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you opened a door by punching it,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.68,0:07:32.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是个老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:07:30.68,0:07:32.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a veteran player.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.80,0:07:33.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界的某个时期
Dialogue: 2,0:07:32.80,0:07:33.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,At one point in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.34,0:07:36.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,水曾经有点危险
Dialogue: 2,0:07:34.34,0:07:36.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,water was a bit dangerous.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.14,0:07:42.22,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这是因为当水只有一格高时  玩家会受到伤害甚至死亡
Dialogue: 2,0:07:36.14,0:07:38.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This was because players could take damage
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.92,0:07:42.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and die if the water was only one block high.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.36,0:07:45.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你曾是当年那些  在水中丧命的玩家之一
Dialogue: 2,0:07:42.36,0:07:45.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now, if you were one of those players that died in water back in the day,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.32,0:07:46.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,请在评论区告诉我
Dialogue: 2,0:07:45.32,0:07:46.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,let me know in the comments,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.46,0:07:47.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为我能体会那种感受
Dialogue: 2,0:07:46.46,0:07:47.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,because I know how it feels.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.98,0:07:50.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我的世界里的苦力怕  曾经要恐怖得多
Dialogue: 2,0:07:47.98,0:07:50.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Creepers in Minecraft used to be a lot scarier.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.26,0:07:53.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这是因为当它们即将爆炸时
Dialogue: 2,0:07:51.26,0:07:53.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This was because when they were about to explode,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.40,0:07:57.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们会做出诡异的侧移动作  直扑玩家然后爆炸
Dialogue: 2,0:07:53.40,0:07:55.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they would do this weird thing where they would
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.02,0:07:57.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,strafe towards the player and then explode,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.60,0:07:58.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,简直让人毛骨悚然
Dialogue: 2,0:07:57.60,0:07:58.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which was just terrifying.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.22,0:08:01.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如今在我的世界中   当苦力怕爆炸时
Dialogue: 2,0:07:59.22,0:08:01.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft today, when creepers explode,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.20,0:08:03.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们只会站在原地  平静地接受命运
Dialogue: 2,0:08:01.20,0:08:03.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they just sort of stand there and accept their fate.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.66,0:08:05.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以 如果你还记得  苦力怕当年的移动方式
Dialogue: 2,0:08:03.66,0:08:05.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, if you remember the old creeper movement,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.92,0:08:07.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对算得上是我的世界老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:08:05.92,0:08:07.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.96,0:08:13.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你们还记得末影龙的血条  显示的是“Boss生命值”而非“末影龙”
Dialogue: 2,0:08:07.96,0:08:11.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you guys remember when the ender dragon health bar
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.00,0:08:13.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,said boss health instead of ender dragon,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.40,0:08:15.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你玩我的世界可真是年头够久了
Dialogue: 2,0:08:13.40,0:08:15.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you have been playing Minecraft for a long,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.88,0:08:16.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,骨灰级玩家
Dialogue: 2,0:08:15.88,0:08:16.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,long time.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.02,0:08:19.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你玩过Alpha和Beta版本  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:17.02,0:08:19.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you played Minecraft in the alpha and beta days,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.98,0:08:23.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,就会记得下界曾经多么鸡肋  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:19.98,0:08:23.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you will remember how useless the nether was.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.28,0:08:23.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,真不是开玩笑  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:23.28,0:08:23.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm not joking.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.22,0:08:26.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当时只能收集萤石  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:24.22,0:08:26.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,All you could do was collect glowstone,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.34,0:08:28.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,被恶魂火球轰炸 再收集萤石  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:26.34,0:08:28.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,get shot by ghasts, collect more glowstone,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.82,0:08:30.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,然后继续被恶魂轰炸  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:28.82,0:08:30.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and then get shot by more ghasts.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.54,0:08:31.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,既没有下界要塞  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:30.54,0:08:31.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,There were no nether fortresses,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.94,0:08:33.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,也没有烈焰人 凋零骷髅  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:31.94,0:08:33.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,no blazers, no wither skeletons,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.06,0:08:34.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,更别提猪灵了
Dialogue: 2,0:08:34.06,0:08:34.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,no piglins.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.96,0:08:35.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,懂的都懂  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:34.96,0:08:35.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I think you get the point.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.04,0:08:37.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那时候简直无聊透顶  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:36.04,0:08:37.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It was just boring.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.56,0:08:42.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,还记得当年能通过切换工具来卡耐久度吗？  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:37.56,0:08:40.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember when you could switch your tools
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.06,0:08:42.15,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,while breaking a block to save on durability?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.40,0:08:43.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我可是记忆犹新  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:42.40,0:08:43.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Because I do.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.50,0:08:50.59,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,比如用钻石镐挖石头时 秒切木镐就能省钻石镐耐久  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:43.50,0:08:46.97,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,For example, you could be breaking some stone with your diamond pick
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.97,0:08:50.59,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and quickly switch to the wooden pick to save durability on your diamond one.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.60,0:08:52.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,虽然效率不咋地  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:50.60,0:08:52.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It probably wasn't that efficient,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.22,0:08:54.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但就是有种蜜汁操作感  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:52.22,0:08:54.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but it was just a cool thing to do,I guess.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.38,0:08:57.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,要是你见过骷髅这样拿弓的姿势  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:54.38,0:08:57.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you remember when skeletons held their bows like this,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.84,0:08:59.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,绝对是元老级玩家  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:57.84,0:08:59.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are an old school player.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.02,0:09:03.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,难怪当年的骷髅准头稀烂
Dialogue: 2,0:09:00.02,0:09:03.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's no wonder skeletons had terrible aim back in the day.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.06,0:09:04.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,连弓都拿反了  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:03.06,0:09:04.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,They're not even holding the bow properly.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.16,0:09:06.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,早年间村庄里  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:05.16,0:09:06.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.18,0:09:11.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,会随机生成这种铁匠铺建筑 它们可是宝藏  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:07.18,0:09:11.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,villagers had a chance to generate with this iconic blacksmith structure.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.44,0:09:15.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为全村只有这里的箱子  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:11.44,0:09:14.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,These were awesome, as they were the only structure
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.00,0:09:15.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in a village to contain a chest,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.80,0:09:20.55,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,能开出钻石黑曜石之类的神装  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:15.80,0:09:17.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and sometimes the loot was just insane,
Dialogue: 2,0:09:18.00,0:09:20.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,as you'd find things such as diamonds or obsidian.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.86,0:09:25.41,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以记得铁匠铺的 都是骨灰级玩家
Dialogue: 2,0:09:20.86,0:09:23.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, if you remember these blacksmith structures,
Dialogue: 2,0:09:23.46,0:09:25.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a veteran player.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.64,0:09:28.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,Alpha版本玩家肯定记得
Dialogue: 2,0:09:25.64,0:09:28.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you played Minecraft in the alpha days of the game,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.34,0:09:33.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当年平滑石台阶居然要用圆石合成  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:28.34,0:09:31.51,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you'll definitely remember when smooth stone slabs
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.51,0:09:33.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,were crafted by using three cobblestone.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.18,0:09:35.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,虽然毫无逻辑  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:34.18,0:09:35.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It definitely didn't make sense,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.00,0:09:38.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但Alpha版离谱设定还少吗  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:36.00,0:09:38.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but hey, a lot of things didn't make sense in alpha,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.28,0:09:39.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,继续往下说  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:38.28,0:09:39.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,so let's move on.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.40,0:09:42.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,老玩家最深的怨念绝对是  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:39.40,0:09:42.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you were a Minecraft player in the alpha and beta days,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.70,0:09:48.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,庄稼总被怪物踩烂  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:42.70,0:09:45.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you will definitely know the pain of your farms
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.64,0:09:48.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,constantly being destroyed by mobs.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.24,0:09:52.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那时候怪物走过农田 作物就直接报废  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:48.24,0:09:52.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This was because even if you just walked over a it would get destroyed,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.84,0:09:54.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,气到吐血
Dialogue: 2,0:09:52.84,0:09:54.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and it was so annoying,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.64,0:10:00.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,Alpha到Beta前期还有个坑 栅栏门根本不存在  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:54.64,0:09:57.69,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Another thing about farms in alpha and most of beta
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.69,0:10:00.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that was pretty lame is that fence gates didn't exist.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.28,0:10:04.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,想保护农田只能围栅栏
Dialogue: 2,0:10:01.28,0:10:04.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This meant if you were to place fences around your farm,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.22,0:10:07.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,进出还得装木门
Dialogue: 2,0:10:04.22,0:10:07.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the only way to safely get in and out was by placing a door,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.06,0:10:10.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,丑到不忍直视
Dialogue: 2,0:10:08.06,0:10:10.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and I have to say it looked very ugly,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.20,0:10:12.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,老玩家都懂
Dialogue: 2,0:10:10.20,0:10:12.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and I'm sure some of you remember this.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.20,0:10:15.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,早期版本的玩家知道
Dialogue: 2,0:10:12.20,0:10:15.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you played Minecraft in alpha and most of beta,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.44,0:10:18.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,钓鱼竿的材质  
Dialogue: 2,0:10:15.44,0:10:18.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you might remember when the fishing rod texture,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.40,0:10:21.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,早期和木棍完全一样  
Dialogue: 2,0:10:18.40,0:10:21.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,when casted, looked identical to the stick texture.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.08,0:10:23.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不信你看  
Dialogue: 2,0:10:22.08,0:10:23.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, just look at this.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.38,0:10:26.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,根本就是绑了鱼线的木棍
Dialogue: 2,0:10:23.38,0:10:26.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It's literally just a stick with a fishing line attached to it.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.66,0:10:28.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这造型也太诡异了吧
Dialogue: 2,0:10:26.66,0:10:28.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It looks so weird, man.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.30,0:10:31.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你玩过Beta 1.8版本
Dialogue: 2,0:10:28.30,0:10:31.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you played Minecraft when version beta 1.8 was released,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.08,0:10:37.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你一定记得末影人刚加入时  整个社区有多疯狂
Dialogue: 2,0:10:32.08,0:10:34.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you will definitely remember how a hype to the community
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.96,0:10:37.25,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,was when the enderman was first added.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.54,0:10:43.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说真的 当你第一次不小心和末影人对视  结果它突然闪现到你身边时
Dialogue: 2,0:10:37.54,0:10:40.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, seriously, the first time you accidentally
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.38,0:10:43.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,looked at an enderman and had them randomly teleport next to you,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.78,0:10:45.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那感觉简直毛骨悚然
Dialogue: 2,0:10:43.78,0:10:45.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it was just terrifying,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.70,0:10:47.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,谁都没料到会这样
Dialogue: 2,0:10:45.70,0:10:47.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,No one really expected it.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.12,0:10:48.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说到末影人
Dialogue: 2,0:10:47.12,0:10:48.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Speaking of the enderman,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.66,0:10:50.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当初刚宣布要加入这个生物时
Dialogue: 2,0:10:48.66,0:10:50.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,when it was first announced to be added,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.58,0:10:52.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,有人制作了它的同人视频
Dialogue: 2,0:10:50.58,0:10:52.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,someone made a fan-made video of it,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.86,0:10:54.22,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而如果你是老玩家的话
Dialogue: 2,0:10:52.86,0:10:54.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and if you're a veteran player,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.38,0:10:55.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你可能还记得这个视频
Dialogue: 2,0:10:54.38,0:10:55.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you might remember it.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.76,0:10:56.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看这个
Dialogue: 2,0:10:55.76,0:10:56.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.07,0:11:15.87,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我记得第一次看这个视频时  真的把我吓得不轻
Dialogue: 2,0:11:12.07,0:11:15.87,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I remember this video scaring me so much when I first watched it,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.15,0:11:18.15,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你玩我的世界够久的话
Dialogue: 2,0:11:16.15,0:11:18.15,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you've been playing Minecraft long enough,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.17,0:11:21.17,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你就会明白那种痛苦  打开一个多年前创建的世界
Dialogue: 2,0:11:18.17,0:11:21.17,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you will know the pain of loading up an old world that you made in,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.27,0:11:26.21,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,比如2013年的存档  看到你的宠物狗  还在原地等待你归来
Dialogue: 2,0:11:21.27,0:11:26.21,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,let's say, 2013, and seeing your pet dogs just waiting there for your return.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.41,0:11:29.69,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我的世界里的狗  真是你能拥有的最忠诚伙伴
Dialogue: 2,0:11:26.41,0:11:29.69,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Minecraft dogs really are the most loyal pets you could ever have.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.79,0:11:30.89,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,对不起 我不该离开的
Dialogue: 2,0:11:29.79,0:11:30.89,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I ever left,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.31,0:11:33.75,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,话说回来 这朵黄色小花  
Dialogue: 2,0:11:31.31,0:11:33.75,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Anyways, moving on, the yellow flower.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.99,0:11:35.51,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我知道你们有些人还记得它  
Dialogue: 2,0:11:33.99,0:11:35.51,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I know some of you remember this,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.57,0:11:36.95,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你还记得的话  
Dialogue: 2,0:11:35.57,0:11:36.95,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and if you do remember it,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.01,0:11:42.41,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,就会知道当年装饰房子  只有这种花和玫瑰两种选择  
Dialogue: 2,0:11:37.01,0:11:39.27,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'll know this flower and the rose were
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.27,0:11:42.41,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the only two flowers to decorate your house back in the day.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.59,0:11:45.55,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 那时候玩家  只能用有限的材料凑合  
Dialogue: 2,0:11:42.59,0:11:45.55,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, players had to work with what they had back then.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.61,0:11:47.25,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我们真的没什么装饰可选  
Dialogue: 2,0:11:45.61,0:11:47.25,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,We couldn't really decorate with much.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.39,0:11:50.37,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你还记得火药  曾经叫“硫磺”的日子  
Dialogue: 2,0:11:47.39,0:11:50.37,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you remember when gunpowder was called sulfur,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:50.61,0:11:51.49,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那么恭喜你  
Dialogue: 2,0:11:50.61,0:11:51.49,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then congratulations,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:51.97,0:11:55.01,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你就是我的世界玩家中的  元老级人物了
Dialogue: 2,0:11:51.97,0:11:55.01,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you are one of the veteran players of the Minecraft community.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:55.19,0:12:01.95,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,让我对旧版我的世界特别怀念的一点是模组和
Dialogue: 2,0:11:55.19,0:11:59.01,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,One thing that makes me really nostalgic about old versions of Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.01,0:12:01.95,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,is when the menu screen used to say mods and
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.95,0:12:02.91,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,材质包 
Dialogue: 2,0:12:01.95,0:12:02.91,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,texture packs.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:03.11,0:12:05.03,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我不知道 这确实是个奇怪的细节 
Dialogue: 2,0:12:03.11,0:12:05.03,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I don't know, it's a weird thing to point out,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.11,0:12:08.19,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但我觉得只有老玩家  才能真正体会这种情怀
Dialogue: 2,0:12:05.11,0:12:08.19,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but I think it's something only a veteran player can really appreciate.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.45,0:12:09.43,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,材质包可太酷了
Dialogue: 2,0:12:08.45,0:12:09.43,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Texture packs were cool,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.81,0:12:16.37,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得以前我的世界的背景音乐 在退出到主菜单时会继续播放吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:12:09.81,0:12:12.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember when the Minecraft music
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.52,0:12:16.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,would continue to play when you saved and quit to the title screen?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.47,0:12:17.39,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为我还记得
Dialogue: 2,0:12:16.47,0:12:17.39,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Because I do.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.65,0:12:18.73,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如今在我的世界里
Dialogue: 2,0:12:17.65,0:12:18.73,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Nowadays in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.73,0:12:22.55,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果正在播放背景音乐  而你暂停游戏  或切换游戏模式时
Dialogue: 2,0:12:18.73,0:12:22.55,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,if a song is playing and you pause the game or change your game mode,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.65,0:12:24.21,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,音乐就会戛然而止
Dialogue: 2,0:12:22.65,0:12:24.21,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the music just stops playing,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.35,0:12:25.77,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这一点我其实不太喜欢
Dialogue: 2,0:12:24.35,0:12:25.77,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which I'm not really a fan of.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.89,0:12:32.81,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不知道怎么说  退出游戏时还能听着C418的舒缓音乐  这种感觉真的很棒
Dialogue: 2,0:12:25.89,0:12:28.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I don't know, it was just nice to quit out of your world
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.46,0:12:32.81,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and still have a relaxing C418 song playing in the background.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:41.64,0:12:43.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你认得这张截图 
Dialogue: 2,0:12:41.64,0:12:43.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you recognise this screenshot,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:44.00,0:12:45.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你一定是位老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:12:44.00,0:12:45.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a veteran player.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.12,0:12:52.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 这张我的世界截图  正是所有关于Herobrine的传闻  和玩家理论的起源
Dialogue: 2,0:12:46.12,0:12:49.33,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, this is the Minecraft screenshot that started
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.33,0:12:52.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,all the rumours and fan theories of Herobrine.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:52.56,0:12:53.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这张截图是真的吗
Dialogue: 2,0:12:52.56,0:12:53.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Is this screenshot real?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.88,0:12:55.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,也许我们永远无法知晓
Dialogue: 2,0:12:53.88,0:12:55.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I guess we'll never know.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.18,0:12:57.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你玩过Alpha版本的我的世界
Dialogue: 2,0:12:55.18,0:12:57.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you played Minecraft in the Alpha days,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.72,0:13:02.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你可能还记得  那时候太阳是从北方升起  在南方落下的
Dialogue: 2,0:12:57.72,0:12:59.05,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you might remember when
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.05,0:13:02.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the sun used to rise in the North and set in the South,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:02.84,0:13:04.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而在如今的游戏里  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:02.84,0:13:04.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,whereas in Minecraft today,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.30,0:13:07.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,和现实生活中一样  太阳都是东升西落  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:04.30,0:13:07.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and in real life, it rises in the East and sets in the West.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:07.96,0:13:10.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,四个字：“Notch神庙”
Dialogue: 2,0:13:07.96,0:13:10.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Four words, the Temple of Notch.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.10,0:13:11.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你还记得这张经典地图  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:10.10,0:13:11.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you remember this awesome map,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.58,0:13:13.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是我的世界元老级玩家  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:11.58,0:13:13.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.80,0:13:14.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看这个  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:13.80,0:13:14.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.68,0:13:25.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你在狗狗刚加入游戏时就玩过  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:22.68,0:13:25.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you played Minecraft when dogs were first added,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.74,0:13:29.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,可能还记得它们当时  即使在和平模式下也会攻击玩家  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:25.74,0:13:27.03,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you might remember when
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.03,0:13:29.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they were able to attack and kill you in peaceful mode.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.88,0:13:33.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 老玩家们  和平模式对我们来说可不太平  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:29.88,0:13:33.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right guys, peaceful mode wasn't so peaceful for us veteran players,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.92,0:13:36.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过谁让我们先招惹狼群呢  这纯属活该
Dialogue: 2,0:13:33.92,0:13:36.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but we deserved it if we attacked a wolf anyway,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.42,0:13:37.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,谁在乎呢？  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:36.42,0:13:37.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,so who really cares?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.84,0:13:39.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界远古版本里  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:37.84,0:13:39.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.94,0:13:41.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当你在存档中死亡时  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:39.94,0:13:41.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,when you died in your world,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:41.48,0:13:45.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,屏幕上会显示“游戏结束”  而非现在的“你死了”
Dialogue: 2,0:13:41.48,0:13:45.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the death screen would say Game Over instead of You Died.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.56,0:13:49.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我觉得“你死了”这个提示  更适合被蠢萌苦力怕炸飞的场景  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:45.56,0:13:47.77,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I guess the game saying You Died is a lot more
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.77,0:13:49.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,fitting for when a stupid creeper blows you up,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:49.92,0:13:50.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为游戏  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:49.92,0:13:50.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,because yes Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.28,0:13:52.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你说得对  我确实死了  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:51.28,0:13:52.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you're right, I did die.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.00,0:13:54.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我的灵魂已经死了一小半  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:53.00,0:13:54.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I died a little inside.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:54.58,0:13:55.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,好了 接着说  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:54.58,0:13:55.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Anyways, moving on.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.88,0:13:57.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说到游戏结束画面
Dialogue: 2,0:13:55.88,0:13:57.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Speaking of the Game Over screen,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.56,0:14:01.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得分数显示为&E0的时候吗？  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:57.56,0:14:01.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,do you guys remember when the score number would say &E0,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.78,0:14:02.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我可记得  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:01.78,0:14:02.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,because I do.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.72,0:14:04.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当年根本没人知道这数字啥意思  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:02.72,0:14:04.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Literally no one knew what it meant back in the day,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.00,0:14:06.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它就那么孤零零挂着  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:05.00,0:14:06.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,so it was just sort of there,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:06.48,0:14:07.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但如果你还记得这个细节  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:06.48,0:14:07.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but yeah, if you remember it,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.90,0:14:09.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是骨灰级玩家  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:07.90,0:14:09.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you're definitely a veteran player.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:09.72,0:14:14.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,要是你们还记得我的世界beta早期  能用桶给鱿鱼挤奶的日子  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:09.72,0:14:12.11,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you guys remember when you could milk squids 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.11,0:14:14.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,with a bucket in the early beta days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.86,0:14:16.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你更是元老级玩家  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:14.86,0:14:16.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a veteran player,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.76,0:14:18.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为这个特性存在时间极短  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:16.76,0:14:18.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,because this feature wasn't around for very long,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.76,0:14:20.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但在它存在的版本里
Dialogue: 2,0:14:18.76,0:14:20.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but when it was in the game,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.14,0:14:22.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那会儿既诡异又带感  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:20.14,0:14:22.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it was kind of weird,but kind of cool
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.77,0:14:25.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,老版僵尸村民的贴图  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:22.77,0:14:25.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The old zombie villager texture.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.36,0:14:26.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我知道你们有些人肯定记得  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:25.36,0:14:26.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I know some of you remember this,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.98,0:14:28.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,要是你还能想起这个  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:26.98,0:14:28.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and if you do remember it,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.24,0:14:30.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,老兄 你就是MC元老级玩家  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:28.24,0:14:30.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you my friend are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.92,0:14:32.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在MC远古时期  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:30.92,0:14:32.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.14,0:14:34.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,alpha和beta年代  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:33.14,0:14:34.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in the alpha and beta days,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.10,0:14:40.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,游戏里只有这个标志性的方形月亮  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:35.10,0:14:37.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the only moon that existed in the game
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.70,0:14:40.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,was the OG square moon that looks like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.18,0:14:45.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如今的MC有各种月相轮换  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:41.18,0:14:43.49,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft today, there are many different
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.49,0:14:45.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,moon phases that can appear at night,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.46,0:14:46.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但如果你见过这个方块月亮
Dialogue: 2,0:14:45.46,0:14:46.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but if you're a veteran player,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.04,0:14:49.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你记忆中的月亮肯定只有这一款
Dialogue: 2,0:14:47.04,0:14:49.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,this is the only moon you'll remember seeing.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.54,0:14:54.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你能认出这个出生点  那你绝对是MC骨灰级玩家
Dialogue: 2,0:14:49.54,0:14:54.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You are definitely a Minecraft veteran if you recognize this spawn point.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.88,0:15:02.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 你现在看到的这张地图  就是史上首个生存游戏地图  它的创作者正是
Dialogue: 2,0:14:54.88,0:14:59.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, this Minecraft map you see on screen is the first known
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.22,0:15:02.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,original survival games map that was created by
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.06,0:15:04.01,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,正是大名鼎鼎的Varayda 
Dialogue: 2,0:15:02.06,0:15:04.01,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,none other than Varayda.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.06,0:15:09.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,Varayda不仅创作了这张经典的生存游戏地图   还打造了众多其他经典地图 
Dialogue: 2,0:15:04.06,0:15:09.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Not only did Varayda create this iconic SG map along with many other maps,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.52,0:15:14.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,他更是生存游戏模式的开山鼻祖
Dialogue: 2,0:15:09.52,0:15:14.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,he was also the original creator of the survival games game mode itself.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.98,0:15:21.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,传奇人物开创了至今仍风靡的游戏模式  还打造了至今仍被奉为经典的SG1地图
Dialogue: 2,0:15:14.98,0:15:18.19,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,What a legend man creates a game mode that is still being played
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.19,0:15:21.91,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,to this day and created SG1 which we still recognize to
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.92,0:15:22.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,今时今日
Dialogue: 2,0:15:21.92,0:15:22.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,this day.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.66,0:15:25.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说到SG1这张地图
Dialogue: 2,0:15:22.66,0:15:25.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,While we're on the topic of the SG1 map,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.10,0:15:30.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你可能还记得2012年那场  风靡全球的MC生存游戏赛事
Dialogue: 2,0:15:25.10,0:15:28.47,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you may also remember the popular Minecraft survival
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.47,0:15:30.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,games event that took place in 2012.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.38,0:15:35.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这场赛事云集了AntVenom等  知名MC主播
Dialogue: 2,0:15:31.38,0:15:35.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This event featured popular Minecraft YouTubers such as AntVenom,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.42,0:15:42.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,CaptainSparklez等一众大神  他们就在Varayda亲手打造的这张地图上  展开生死对决
Dialogue: 2,0:15:35.42,0:15:38.65,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,CaptainSparklez and many more where they would fight to the death
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.65,0:15:42.07,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in survival games on the very map Varayda had created.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.42,0:15:46.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,剧透警告：如果你还没看过  这场12年前的经典赛事
Dialogue: 2,0:15:42.42,0:15:46.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,And spoiler alert if you haven't seen the event 12 years later,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.30,0:15:47.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,AntVenom最终夺得了冠军
Dialogue: 2,0:15:46.30,0:15:47.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,AntVenom was the winner.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.94,0:15:55.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你还记得2013年玩过The Hive和MCSG这些服务器  那你绝对是骨灰级老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:15:47.94,0:15:51.01,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You are definitely a veteran player if you remember
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.01,0:15:55.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,playing servers such as The Hive and MCSG back in 2013.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:55.86,0:16:02.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这些服务器当年红极一时  拥有SG4等标志性生存游戏地图  地图造型如图所示
Dialogue: 2,0:15:55.86,0:15:58.85,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,These servers were massive and featured iconic
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.85,0:16:02.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,survival games maps such as SG4 which looked like this,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.70,0:16:07.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,微风岛的地图长这样  而SG7的地图则是这般模样
Dialogue: 2,0:16:02.70,0:16:07.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Breeze Island which looked like this and SG7 which looked like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.82,0:16:10.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但要说最经典的  还得是SG4这张地图
Dialogue: 2,0:16:07.82,0:16:10.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But man, SG4 stood out the most.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.56,0:16:17.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我们都记得在机库触发岩浆陷阱惨死  或是打开那个会给你缓慢效果的宝箱
Dialogue: 2,0:16:10.56,0:16:13.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,We all remember activating that lava trap in the hangar and
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.90,0:16:17.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,dying or opening that chest that would give you that slow
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.10,0:16:20.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在蛛网中缓缓下坠  最终落入岩浆的绝望时刻
Dialogue: 2,0:16:17.10,0:16:20.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,impending doom by sinking through cobwebs into lava.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:20.92,0:16:26.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界早期版本中  游戏里并没有饥饿值设定  这意味着玩家会自动恢复生命值
Dialogue: 2,0:16:20.92,0:16:24.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft there used to be no hunger bar
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.76,0:16:26.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in the game which meant players regenerated their
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.98,0:16:28.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,只需吃东西就能自动回血
Dialogue: 2,0:16:26.98,0:16:28.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,hearts by just simply eating food.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.32,0:16:33.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那时候的游戏机制简单得多  还记得这些细节的  绝对是元老级玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:16:29.32,0:16:31.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It was a lot simpler back then and if you remember this
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.82,0:16:33.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a veteran player.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.56,0:16:34.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界的某个时期 
Dialogue: 2,0:16:33.56,0:16:34.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,At one point in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.20,0:16:40.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那时候的弓箭简直强得离谱  因为你可以疯狂连射  像机关枪一样连续发射箭矢
Dialogue: 2,0:16:35.20,0:16:37.99,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,bows were quite overpowered because you could shoot
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.99,0:16:40.93,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,them ridiculously fast and spam click arrows.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.06,0:16:41.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那简直太疯狂了
Dialogue: 2,0:16:41.06,0:16:41.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It was insane.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.16,0:16:47.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我特别记得我的世界早期版本里  食物还不能堆叠的日子
Dialogue: 2,0:16:42.16,0:16:47.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,One thing I especially remember in the old days of Minecraft is when food didn't stack.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.78,0:16:49.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这绝对是游戏里最烦人的设定之一
Dialogue: 2,0:16:47.78,0:16:49.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It was one of the most annoying things in the game.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:50.04,0:16:55.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,记得以前背包塞满生（改正：熟）猪排的日子  简直让人抓狂
Dialogue: 2,0:16:50.04,0:16:55.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I would remember having a full inventory of raw pork chops and it was just so annoying.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:55.60,0:16:57.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你还记得这个开门声
Dialogue: 2,0:16:55.60,0:16:57.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you remember this door sound,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.50,0:16:59.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你是个我的世界老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:16:57.50,0:16:59.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you are a veteran Minecraft player.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:04.69,0:17:07.15,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我太怀念这个声音了
Dialogue: 2,0:17:04.69,0:17:07.15,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I miss this sound so much man.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.25,0:17:14.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我还记得我的世界早期版本里  只要徒手打羊  就能直接掉落羊毛
Dialogue: 2,0:17:07.25,0:17:10.29,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Another feature I remember in the old days of Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.29,0:17:14.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,is that you could simply just punch a sheep and it would drop wool.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.59,0:17:17.05,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,根本不需要剪刀之类的工具  徒手就能薅羊毛
Dialogue: 2,0:17:14.59,0:17:17.05,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Nope, you didn't have to use shears or anything like that.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.31,0:17:19.55,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,直接上手揍羊就能掉羊毛
Dialogue: 2,0:17:17.31,0:17:19.55,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You could just punch it and it would drop wool.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.85,0:17:20.73,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这设定简直离谱
Dialogue: 2,0:17:19.85,0:17:20.73,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It was ridiculous.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:21.25,0:17:29.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得beta 1.8版本之前吗  按F键就能切换渲染距离和雾效
Dialogue: 2,0:17:21.25,0:17:25.17,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember before version beta 1.8 when you could toggle
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.17,0:17:29.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,your render distance and fog by pressing the F key on your keyboard?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.19,0:17:34.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说实话这个功能取消时我很不爽  因为当时我那台破电脑  全靠这个功能才能流畅运行
Dialogue: 2,0:17:29.19,0:17:31.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I was quite annoyed when they got rid of it to be honest
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.38,0:17:34.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,because I found it quite useful as my PC back then was terrible.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.07,0:17:43.07,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得我的世界里  栅栏不会连接到实心方块的年代吗  我可记得清清楚楚 那时候简直太让人抓狂了
Dialogue: 2,0:17:35.07,0:17:38.77,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, do you guys remember in Minecraft when fences
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.77,0:17:43.07,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,didn't connect to solid blocks because I do and it was very frustrating.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.11,0:17:52.15,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,栅栏还有个特别烦人的设定  它们曾经是完整方块  绕着走的时候简直特别麻烦
Dialogue: 2,0:17:43.11,0:17:48.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Another thing that was really annoying about fences is that they used to be a full block
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.26,0:17:52.15,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,making walking around them just really tedious and annoying.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.21,0:17:59.03,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,根本不用是老玩家  肯定都记得这个  ——就是那个古老的受伤音效
Dialogue: 2,0:17:52.21,0:17:55.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I don't think you even need to be an old school Minecraft player
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.82,0:17:59.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,to remember this and that is the old hurt sound.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.17,0:18:02.03,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我相信看视频的各位  肯定都记得这个
Dialogue: 2,0:17:59.17,0:18:02.03,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm sure all of you watching this video remember this.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.03,0:18:02.89,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,听听看 
Dialogue: 2,0:18:02.03,0:18:02.89,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Take a listen.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:07.29,0:18:11.21,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,时至今日想起这个功能被移除  我依然感到无比惋惜
Dialogue: 2,0:18:07.29,0:18:11.21,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It still makes me so sad to this day that they even removed this.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.29,0:18:12.77,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我超爱这个音效的
Dialogue: 2,0:18:11.29,0:18:12.77,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I loved it so much.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.89,0:18:19.39,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你还记得这个圆石纹理  那你绝对是我的世界老玩家  因为它要么让人爱不释手
Dialogue: 2,0:18:12.89,0:18:17.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you remember this cobblestone texture then you are an old school
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.02,0:18:19.39,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Minecraft player because it was either loved or
Dialogue: 1,0:18:19.39,0:18:20.65,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,要么被玩家们深恶痛绝
Dialogue: 2,0:18:19.39,0:18:20.65,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,hated by the community.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.01,0:18:27.89,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,还记得当年苔石可是游戏里最稀有的方块之一  因为那时候还没有合成配方
Dialogue: 2,0:18:21.01,0:18:23.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I remember back to a time when mossy cobblestone
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.86,0:18:27.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,was one of the rarest blocks in the game as it didn't have a crafting
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.89,0:18:32.89,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而苔石只能从地牢里获取  那时候地牢可是稀罕得很
Dialogue: 2,0:18:27.89,0:18:32.89,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,recipe and could only be obtained from dungeons which were really hard to come by.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.01,0:18:35.79,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得我的世界当初没有疾跑功能的日子吗
Dialogue: 2,0:18:33.01,0:18:35.79,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember when sprinting was not in Minecraft?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:36.19,0:18:42.83,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 在Beta 1.8版本更新前  游戏里根本没有疾跑功能  那时候要从A点跑到B点
Dialogue: 2,0:18:36.19,0:18:39.29,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, before the beta 1.8 update sprinting
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.29,0:18:42.83,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,was not in the game which meant getting from point A to point B in
Dialogue: 1,0:18:42.83,0:18:46.55,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,游戏世界简直度日如年  跑图过程痛苦不堪
Dialogue: 2,0:18:42.83,0:18:46.55,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,your Minecraft world took a lot longer and it was a lot more painful.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.81,0:18:52.77,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得我的世界里睡觉的特色吗？ 当时在床上睡觉时  有概率会触发...
Dialogue: 2,0:18:46.81,0:18:50.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, do you guys remember that feature in Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.20,0:18:52.77,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,where when you slept in a bed there was a chance for either a
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.77,0:18:57.77,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,僵尸或骷髅会在你睡觉时突然惊醒你  然后对你发起攻击？
Dialogue: 2,0:18:52.77,0:18:57.77,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,zombie or a skeleton to wake you up as you tried to sleep and they would begin to attack you?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.03,0:19:00.71,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不知道这算烦人的设定  还是超酷的彩蛋
Dialogue: 2,0:18:58.03,0:19:00.71,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I don't know if it was an annoying feature or a cool feature,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.85,0:19:02.01,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,真让人难以抉择
Dialogue: 2,0:19:00.85,0:19:02.01,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I really can't decide.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.11,0:19:08.49,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得以前按键盘上的F3键  就能显示生物实体编号的日子吗
Dialogue: 2,0:19:02.11,0:19:05.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember when you could press the F3 key on your keyboard 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.94,0:19:08.49,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and it would show the entity numbers of mobs
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.49,0:19:12.03,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这意味着你基本上可以作弊来寻找洞穴系统？
Dialogue: 2,0:19:08.49,0:19:12.03,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,meaning you could essentially cheat to find cave systems?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.33,0:19:19.05,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你还记得旧版创造模式物品栏  那时候所有物品都只是简单罗列在列表中  而不是
Dialogue: 2,0:19:12.33,0:19:15.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you remember the old creative mode inventory when
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:19.05,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it was just a list of all of the items in the game instead of
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.05,0:19:23.43,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,按物品类别分页显示的话  那你绝对是MC元老级玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:19:19.05,0:19:23.43,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,having tabs for specific items then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.57,0:19:27.73,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我记得那个旧版创造模式物品栏  翻找物品简直让人抓狂
Dialogue: 2,0:19:23.57,0:19:27.73,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I remember this old creative mode inventory and it was really annoying to navigate through.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.87,0:19:29.33,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,新版界面确实好用多了
Dialogue: 2,0:19:27.87,0:19:29.33,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I really prefer the new one.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.43,0:19:34.87,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,还记得当年我的世界里  猪是唯一会掉落食物的动物吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:19:29.43,0:19:31.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember back to a time where pigs
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.68,0:19:34.87,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,were the only animal in Minecraft that would drop food?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.27,0:19:41.59,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,羊 牛和鸡都不会掉落食物  说实话这设定挺让人崩溃的  找食物变得特别困难
Dialogue: 2,0:19:35.27,0:19:37.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Sheep, cows and chickens didn't drop any food
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.64,0:19:41.59,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which was kind of frustrating to be honest and it made finding food quite difficult.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.65,0:19:48.11,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,相信很多老玩家都记得  当年箱子还是个完整方块  看起来是这样的
Dialogue: 2,0:19:41.65,0:19:44.43,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm sure a lot of you old school players will remember
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.43,0:19:48.11,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,when the chest was a full block and looked like this and the fact
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.11,0:19:50.81,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而且那时候箱子还没有开关动画呢 
Dialogue: 2,0:19:48.11,0:19:50.81,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that it didn't have an open and closing animation.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.43,0:19:53.57,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那时候的箱子可简单多了 
Dialogue: 2,0:19:51.43,0:19:53.57,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Chests were a lot more simple back in the day.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:53.69,0:19:58.75,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得以前怪物没那么聪明  连绕墙走都不会的时候吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:19:53.69,0:19:58.75,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember when mobs weren't as smart and they couldn't walk around walls for example?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.07,0:20:04.63,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那时候苦力怕会在墙后突然蹦出来  简直能把人吓出心脏病
Dialogue: 2,0:19:59.07,0:20:01.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This basically meant that creepers would just jump scare you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.94,0:20:04.63,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,when you would walk past the wall and it was terrifying.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:05.09,0:20:10.43,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,苦力怕还会隔着玻璃窗直勾勾盯着你
Dialogue: 2,0:20:05.09,0:20:07.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Creepers would also do this thing where they would just
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.46,0:20:10.43,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,stare at you from outside through your glass window in your
Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.43,0:20:13.49,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,房子 那模样简直太瘆人了
Dialogue: 2,0:20:10.43,0:20:13.49,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,house and it scared me so much man they look so creepy.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.95,0:20:19.89,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说到苦力怕 如果你还记得老版爆炸音效  那你绝对是我的世界元老级玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:20:13.95,0:20:16.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Speaking of creepers once again if you remember
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.66,0:20:19.89,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the old explosion sound then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.21,0:20:20.93,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,听听看 
Dialogue: 2,0:20:20.21,0:20:20.93,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Take a listen.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.97,0:20:31.53,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我敢肯定很多老玩家都记得  以前没法把两个箱子并排放置  变成大箱子的功能
Dialogue: 2,0:20:24.97,0:20:29.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,One old feature that I'm sure a lot of old school players will remember is
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.10,0:20:31.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that you couldn't place double chests next to
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.53,0:20:33.79,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这设定简直烦死人了  
Dialogue: 2,0:20:31.53,0:20:33.79,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,each other which was just so annoying.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.01,0:20:36.29,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,明明房子布局都规划得超完美  
Dialogue: 2,0:20:34.01,0:20:36.29,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You would lay out your house in this really good way,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.61,0:20:39.63,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,想放两个大箱子却死活放不了  
Dialogue: 2,0:20:36.61,0:20:39.63,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'd want to place two double chests and it just wouldn't let you.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.71,0:20:41.35,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,太让人抓狂了伙计  
Dialogue: 2,0:20:39.71,0:20:41.35,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It was just so frustrating man.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.53,0:20:48.37,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,现在每次更新主界面都会换新背景  
Dialogue: 2,0:20:41.53,0:20:44.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You know how with every Minecraft update that comes out
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.00,0:20:48.37,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,now there is a new background on the title screen to match the update theme?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.41,0:20:51.19,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但在老版本里可没这回事  
Dialogue: 2,0:20:48.41,0:20:51.19,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Well in the old version to Minecraft this wasn't a thing,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.31,0:20:56.35,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,主界面永远只有泥土背景  每次看到都让我怀念到爆  
Dialogue: 2,0:20:51.31,0:20:56.35,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you just had a dirt background on the title screen and it makes me nostalgic every time I see it.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.41,0:21:02.07,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,还有个关于主界面的回忆  就是以前MC的logo完全不同  
Dialogue: 2,0:20:56.41,0:20:59.55,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Another thing I remember about the title screen of Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.55,0:21:02.07,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,is when the Minecraft logo was different.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.25,0:21:06.47,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,还记得那个用圆石材质拼出来的logo吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:21:02.25,0:21:06.47,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you remember when the logo was just made out of what looks to be the cobblestone texture?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.67,0:21:09.97,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为我记得清清楚楚  说实话那设计还挺酷的
Dialogue: 2,0:21:06.67,0:21:09.97,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Because I do and I thought it looked kind of cool to be honest.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.17,0:21:17.85,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,要是你还记得梯子之间能留一格空隙攀爬  那你绝对是MC骨灰级玩家
Dialogue: 2,0:21:10.17,0:21:13.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You are definitely a Minecraft veteran if you remember
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.56,0:21:17.85,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the feature of climbing up ladders with a one block gap between each ladder.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.91,0:21:22.99,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个技巧能省下不少梯子材料  但后来官方还是移除了这个特性
Dialogue: 2,0:21:17.91,0:21:20.27,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It kind of meant that you could save quite a few ladders
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.27,0:21:22.99,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,with this trick but they eventually removed this feature.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.25,0:21:29.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你还记得Minecraft里的这个特性  那你绝对是元老级玩家  
Dialogue: 2,0:21:23.25,0:21:26.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you remember this feature in Minecraft then you are an old school
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.54,0:21:29.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,player and that feature is when the lighting would
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.20,0:21:36.29,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,光照会分阶段逐渐变暗  那个渐变过程简直恐怖到爆  眼睁睁看着光线一点点暗下来
Dialogue: 2,0:21:29.20,0:21:32.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,change in stages when it was getting dark and oh my god 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.68,0:21:36.29,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it looked so scary just gradually watching the light change.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.39,0:21:39.33,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得栅栏的老合成配方吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:21:36.39,0:21:39.33,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember the old crafting recipe for fences?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.43,0:21:41.19,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为直到现在我还在用这个配方
Dialogue: 2,0:21:39.43,0:21:41.19,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Because I still do it to this day.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.37,0:21:45.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如今在Minecraft中  栅栏的合成配方是两根木棍加四块木板  
Dialogue: 2,0:21:41.37,0:21:45.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So in Minecraft today fences are crafted with two sticks and four planks
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.30,0:21:48.87,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但老版本要用六根木棍来合成
Dialogue: 2,0:21:45.30,0:21:48.87,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but in older versions of Minecraft they were crafted with six sticks.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.91,0:21:51.17,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但我至今还在用这个老配方
Dialogue: 2,0:21:48.91,0:21:51.17,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But I still do this crafting recipe to this day.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.25,0:21:52.63,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个画面在我脑海里挥之不去
Dialogue: 2,0:21:51.25,0:21:52.63,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I just can't get it out of my head.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.71,0:21:55.17,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,每次合成栅栏时  我总会搞错配方
Dialogue: 2,0:21:52.71,0:21:55.17,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I always get the recipe wrong when trying to craft fences.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.39,0:22:01.35,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你知道在我的世界里  按两下键盘F5键  就能看到自己皮肤的正脸吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:21:55.39,0:21:58.41,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You know how in Minecraft where if you press F5
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.41,0:22:01.35,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,twice on your keyboard you can see the front facing part of your skin?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.43,0:22:02.49,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个功能简直帅炸了
Dialogue: 2,0:22:01.43,0:22:02.49,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It's a really cool feature.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.75,0:22:06.19,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但在老版本的我的世界里  这个功能可做不到
Dialogue: 2,0:22:02.75,0:22:06.19,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Well in the old versions of Minecraft you couldn't do this.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.29,0:22:12.27,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你只能按一次F5  看到自己皮肤的后背  说实话这太让人沮丧了  因为我超想
Dialogue: 2,0:22:06.29,0:22:09.29,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You could only press F5 once and see the back of your skin
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.29,0:22:12.27,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which was really depressing to be honest because I wanted to
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.27,0:22:15.53,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,完整看到自己皮肤的全貌  却总是看不到
Dialogue: 2,0:22:12.27,0:22:15.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,see what my skin looked like in full form but I couldn't.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.57,0:22:19.65,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得以前  我的世界只能存五个存档的时候吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:22:15.57,0:22:19.65,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember when you could only have five Minecraft worlds?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.05,0:22:24.53,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那时候每个存档都得精打细算  毕竟只有五个存档位啊
Dialogue: 2,0:22:20.05,0:22:24.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It really meant that you had to make each world count because there were only five world slots.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.77,0:22:28.01,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在创造模式和指令功能加入我的世界之前
Dialogue: 2,0:22:24.77,0:22:28.01,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Before creative mode and commands were even a thing in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.35,0:22:35.05,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那时候的玩家只能依赖模组  比如单机指令模组和“太多物品”模组  这些工具能让你刷出各种物品
Dialogue: 2,0:22:28.35,0:22:31.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,players back in the day had rely on mods such as single player
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.66,0:22:35.05,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,commands and too many items which allowed you to spawn in
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.05,0:22:37.93,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,还能到处飞行  诸如此类的功能
Dialogue: 2,0:22:35.05,0:22:37.93,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,items and fly around and things like that.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.17,0:22:42.17,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如今在我的世界里能轻松做到的事当年不用模组根本实现不了
Dialogue: 2,0:22:38.17,0:22:42.17,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Things you could do in Minecraft today but you couldn't back then without the use of mods.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.35,0:22:45.89,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,还记得我的世界里 连床都没有的远古时代吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:22:42.35,0:22:45.89,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember back to a simpler time when beds were not in Minecraft?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.15,0:22:47.13,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为我还记得
Dialogue: 2,0:22:46.15,0:22:47.13,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Because I do.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.47,0:22:53.29,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在游戏的Alpha版本时期  床根本不存在  这意味着你只能硬熬过夜晚
Dialogue: 2,0:22:47.47,0:22:50.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the alpha versions of the game beds did not exist
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.24,0:22:53.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which meant you had to sort of wait out the night cycle making
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.29,0:22:55.95,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在生存模式里  难度直接翻倍
Dialogue: 2,0:22:53.29,0:22:55.95,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,surviving in your world just a lot more challenging.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.27,0:23:02.87,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你在Alpha时代玩过我的世界 应该还记得物品栏快捷键原本是I键
Dialogue: 2,0:22:56.27,0:22:59.09,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you played Minecraft in the alpha days of the game
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.09,0:23:02.87,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you'll probably remember that the inventory key used to be I
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.87,0:23:04.29,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而不是现在的E键
Dialogue: 2,0:23:02.87,0:23:04.29,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,instead of E.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.71,0:23:09.49,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,听说现在还有人坚持用I键打开物品栏  因为实在改不掉这个老习惯了
Dialogue: 2,0:23:04.71,0:23:09.49,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I hear that some people still use I as their inventory key today because they're so used to it.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.59,0:23:11.21,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我个人习惯用E键
Dialogue: 2,0:23:09.59,0:23:11.21,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Me personally, I use E.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.41,0:23:13.41,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,老版本的砂砾材质
Dialogue: 2,0:23:11.41,0:23:13.41,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The old gravel texture.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.87,0:23:15.57,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我知道你们中有些人还记得
Dialogue: 2,0:23:13.87,0:23:15.57,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I know some of you remember it.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.61,0:23:18.65,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不知为何在我的世界早期版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:23:15.61,0:23:18.65,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,For some reason back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.93,0:23:20.59,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,僵尸会掉落羽毛
Dialogue: 2,0:23:18.93,0:23:20.59,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,zombies dropped feathers.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:20.83,0:23:24.19,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我敢肯定有人还记得这个设定  说实话这确实有点奇怪
Dialogue: 2,0:23:20.83,0:23:24.19,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm sure some of you remember this and it was just a little bit weird to be honest.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.29,0:23:27.49,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我记得当年为了做箭  专门去杀僵尸收集羽毛
Dialogue: 2,0:23:24.29,0:23:27.49,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I remember going to kill zombies for feathers just so I could make arrows.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.81,0:23:35.59,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我敢肯定很多我的世界老玩家都记得  Alpha和Beta版本时期的地形生成
Dialogue: 2,0:23:27.81,0:23:31.45,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, I'm sure a lot of you Minecraft veterans will remember
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.45,0:23:35.59,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the world generation of the alpha and beta days of Minecraft.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.65,0:23:37.41,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那地形简直疯狂到离谱
Dialogue: 2,0:23:35.65,0:23:37.41,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It looked absolutely insane.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:37.55,0:23:40.57,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,有些生成的山地地形简直
Dialogue: 2,0:23:37.55,0:23:40.57,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Some of the mountainous terrain you would get was just,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:40.83,0:23:41.79,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,简直震撼到难以置信
Dialogue: 2,0:23:40.83,0:23:41.79,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it was mind-blowing.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:41.95,0:23:43.03,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看看这  就看看这个
Dialogue: 2,0:23:41.95,0:23:43.03,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Just, just look at it.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:43.13,0:23:49.15,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你还记得看Yogscast最早的生存实况系列  那你绝对是我的世界元老级玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:23:43.13,0:23:49.15,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you remember watching the Yogscast original survival series then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:49.55,0:23:50.37,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看看这个
Dialogue: 2,0:23:49.55,0:23:50.37,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:50.37,0:23:51.77,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,万岁！我的世界
Dialogue: 2,0:23:50.37,0:23:51.77,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Hooray, Minecraft.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:52.41,0:23:57.21,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我们新建了一个服务器  准备教大家怎么玩我的世界
Dialogue: 2,0:23:52.41,0:23:57.21,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,We've created a new server and we're gonna show people how to play Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:57.51,0:23:59.11,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如何度过第一个夜晚
Dialogue: 2,0:23:57.51,0:23:59.11,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,how to survive the first night.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:59.19,0:23:59.61,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,美极了
Dialogue: 2,0:23:59.19,0:23:59.61,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Beautiful.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:59.63,0:24:01.73,MC-CN,,0,0,0,, 这雪下得也太大了
Dialogue: 2,0:23:59.63,0:24:01.73,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, it's terribly snowy.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:01.79,0:24:02.87,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这到底发生什么了？
Dialogue: 2,0:24:01.79,0:24:02.87,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,What on earth happened here?
Dialogue: 1,0:24:03.41,0:24:04.81,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这游戏太美了
Dialogue: 2,0:24:03.41,0:24:04.81,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This game is beautiful.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:05.07,0:24:05.71,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,确实
Dialogue: 2,0:24:05.07,0:24:05.71,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:05.99,0:24:07.55,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,由一个人独立制作完成
Dialogue: 2,0:24:05.99,0:24:07.55,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Made by a single man.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:07.69,0:24:08.03,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,是的 
Dialogue: 2,0:24:07.69,0:24:08.03,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:09.93,0:24:12.25,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这就是了 这就是游戏 
Dialogue: 2,0:24:09.93,0:24:12.25,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So this is it, this is the game.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:12.83,0:24:14.19,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我的世界
Dialogue: 2,0:24:12.83,0:24:14.19,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Minecraft.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:18.51,0:24:20.65,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,黑暗中只剩我们俩 
Dialogue: 2,0:24:18.51,0:24:20.65,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It's just us in the dark.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:20.97,0:24:23.31,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,啊 这勾起了太多回忆了 伙计 
Dialogue: 2,0:24:20.97,0:24:23.31,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Oh, it brings back so many memories man.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:23.49,0:24:30.97,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你以为在我的世界中30级附魔已经够贵的话 那你可要重新考虑了 因为最初的附魔系统
Dialogue: 2,0:24:23.49,0:24:28.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you thought max enchanting at 30 levels costs a lot in Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.14,0:24:30.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then think again because when enchanting was first
Dialogue: 1,0:24:30.98,0:24:36.17,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,刚加入时 工具和盔甲的最高附魔需要50级经验值 简直离谱 
Dialogue: 2,0:24:30.98,0:24:36.17,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,added, max enchanting on tools and armor cost 50 levels which was insane.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:36.45,0:24:41.27,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不仅如此 在尚未加入青金石作为附魔消耗品之前 
Dialogue: 2,0:24:36.45,0:24:41.27,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,On top of that, before the feature of having to use lapis to enchant was added,
Dialogue: 1,0:24:41.51,0:24:49.43,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,30级附魔会直接耗尽你所有的经验值 而不是像现在这样仅消耗3级经验
Dialogue: 2,0:24:41.51,0:24:46.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,enchanting tools or armor at level 30 would take all of your XP
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.44,0:24:49.43,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,for that one tool instead of taking three levels which
Dialogue: 1,0:24:49.43,0:24:50.71,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,简直丧心病狂
Dialogue: 2,0:24:49.43,0:24:50.71,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,was just insane.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:50.85,0:24:55.07,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,辛辛苦苦刷了那么久的经验  就为了给一件装备附魔
Dialogue: 2,0:24:50.85,0:24:55.07,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You would spend so long grinding for those levels just to use it on one item.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:55.37,0:25:03.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,老玩家们还会记得另一个附魔特性  那就是你根本看不到即将获得的附魔效果
Dialogue: 2,0:24:55.37,0:24:59.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Another enchanting feature that old school players will remember
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.34,0:25:03.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,is that you couldn't see what enchantment you were going to get at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:03.79,0:25:10.39,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如今在我的世界里  你会看到物品可能获得的附魔效果之一  但在旧版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:25:03.79,0:25:06.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft today, you get shown one of the possible
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.96,0:25:10.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,enchantments you will get on an item but in older versions of
Dialogue: 1,0:25:10.39,0:25:15.33,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我的世界早期版本中  你只能赌运气  附魔完才能看到效果  简直...
Dialogue: 2,0:25:10.39,0:25:15.33,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Minecraft, you had to just risk it and see what you would get which was just... oh my god,
Dialogue: 1,0:25:15.35,0:25:16.47,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这设定简直让人抓狂
Dialogue: 2,0:25:15.35,0:25:16.47,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it was so frustrating.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:16.81,0:25:22.67,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我记得以前有个版本  徒手打一下就能引爆TNT
Dialogue: 2,0:25:16.81,0:25:20.51,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I remember a time where you could activate and ignite TNT
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.51,0:25:22.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,by just simply punching it with your hand.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:22.75,0:25:26.07,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,根本不需要打火石就能引爆TNT  简直酷毙了
Dialogue: 2,0:25:22.75,0:25:26.07,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You didn't need flint and steel at all which was pretty awesome,
Dialogue: 1,0:25:26.19,0:25:26.81,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,老实说 
Dialogue: 2,0:25:26.19,0:25:26.81,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,not gonna lie.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:26.99,0:25:29.79,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你还记得那个臭名昭著的我的世界种子 
Dialogue: 2,0:25:26.99,0:25:29.79,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you remember the infamous Minecraft seed,
Dialogue: 1,0:25:30.03,0:25:32.57,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你还记得“冰川”这个著名种子  那你绝对是我的世界元老级玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:25:30.03,0:25:32.57,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Glacier, then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:32.77,0:25:39.53,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个种子在我的世界beta时期  能生成令人叹为观止的地形景观
Dialogue: 2,0:25:32.77,0:25:35.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It was basically a seed in the beta days of Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.94,0:25:39.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that just gave you this awe-inspiring world generation.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:39.59,0:25:41.27,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,视觉效果简直惊艳到爆
Dialogue: 2,0:25:39.59,0:25:41.27,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It looked absolutely fantastic.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:41.47,0:25:42.25,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看看这效果
Dialogue: 2,0:25:41.47,0:25:42.25,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Just look at it.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:42.47,0:25:47.65,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说真的 你应该回退到beta 1.7.3版本  亲自试试这个种子  因为真的
Dialogue: 2,0:25:42.47,0:25:47.65,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You should honestly go back to beta 1.7.3 and try out this seed because seriously,
Dialogue: 1,0:25:47.79,0:25:50.29,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你绝对会被这惊艳的地形震撼到
Dialogue: 2,0:25:47.79,0:25:50.29,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you will be blown away at how amazing it looks.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:50.49,0:25:56.69,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如今在我的世界里  我们有“进度”系统  其实就是完成游戏中的各种小任务
Dialogue: 2,0:25:50.49,0:25:53.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft today, we have these things called advancements
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.56,0:25:56.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,where you basically complete little tasks in Minecraft but
Dialogue: 1,0:25:56.69,0:25:59.69,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得游戏里曾经有成就系统的时候吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:25:56.69,0:25:59.69,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,do you guys remember when achievements were in the game?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:59.99,0:26:05.55,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们和附魔非常相似  但又有那么一点点不同  这些成就永远让我记忆犹新
Dialogue: 2,0:25:59.99,0:26:01.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,They were very similar to enchantments
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.80,0:26:05.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but they were just a little bit different and I will always remember these.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:05.67,0:26:09.53,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在beta 1.8版本之前  当饥饿值系统还未加入我的世界时
Dialogue: 2,0:26:05.67,0:26:09.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Before beta 1.8, when the hunger bar was added into Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:26:09.83,0:26:14.91,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,游戏里根本没有进食动画  所以当你吃烤猪排时
Dialogue: 2,0:26:09.83,0:26:14.91,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,there was no eating animation in the game so when you would consume a cooked pork chop,
Dialogue: 1,0:26:15.23,0:26:17.49,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你只需要右键点击  食物瞬间就被吃掉了
Dialogue: 2,0:26:15.23,0:26:17.49,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'd simply just right click on it and boom,
Dialogue: 1,0:26:17.67,0:26:18.33,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,瞬间消失不见
Dialogue: 2,0:26:17.67,0:26:18.33,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it would be gone.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:18.45,0:26:20.81,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,连“吧唧吧唧”的咀嚼声都没有
Dialogue: 2,0:26:18.45,0:26:20.81,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,There would be no nom nom nomming on the item.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:21.27,0:26:23.59,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你只需右键一点  它就凭空消失了
Dialogue: 2,0:26:21.27,0:26:23.59,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It would just disappear when you'd right click on it.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:23.63,0:26:27.65,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你在生物群系加入前玩过我的世界Alpha版
Dialogue: 2,0:26:23.63,0:26:27.65,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you played Minecraft Alpha before biomes were added into the game,
Dialogue: 1,0:26:27.73,0:26:30.85,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你一定记得  那时的我的世界地图  看起来是这样的
Dialogue: 2,0:26:27.73,0:26:30.85,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you will remember when Minecraft worlds looked like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:30.89,0:26:36.67,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,世界只有一种草地  那种特别鲜艳的翠绿色  说实话这让你的
Dialogue: 2,0:26:30.89,0:26:34.57,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,There was just one type of grass and it was this really bright green
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.57,0:26:36.67,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,looking grass and I have to say it made your
Dialogue: 1,0:26:36.67,0:26:39.45,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我的世界地图显得格外明亮  却别具一格
Dialogue: 2,0:26:36.67,0:26:39.45,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Minecraft worlds look very bright but very unique.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:39.71,0:26:40.91,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得这个吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:26:39.71,0:26:40.91,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember this?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:40.97,0:26:43.23,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当你或朋友在我的世界中死亡时
Dialogue: 2,0:26:40.97,0:26:43.23,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,When you or your friend died in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:26:43.53,0:26:49.65,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,他们的尸体会直接消失  而不是播放死亡动画  看起来有点诡异
Dialogue: 2,0:26:43.53,0:26:46.05,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,their body would just disappear and die 
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.05,0:26:49.65,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,instead of having a death animation which looked a bit weird,
Dialogue: 1,0:26:49.75,0:26:50.39,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说实话 
Dialogue: 2,0:26:49.75,0:26:50.39,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,not gonna lie.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:50.49,0:26:57.69,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,还记得Beta 1.8版本刚加入村庄建筑时吗？ 那时候村庄里  连一个村民都没有  
Dialogue: 2,0:26:50.49,0:26:54.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you remember when village structures were added in beta 1.8
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.76,0:26:57.69,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but no villagers were added to spawn yet making the
Dialogue: 1,0:26:57.69,0:27:00.87,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,整个村庄显得阴森诡异  空荡荡的毫无生气？
Dialogue: 2,0:26:57.69,0:27:00.87,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,village itself very creepy and sort of empty?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:00.87,0:27:05.81,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,记得当时遇到村庄  里面却空无一人  
Dialogue: 2,0:27:00.87,0:27:03.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I remember playing the game and just encountering a village
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.96,0:27:05.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but there was just there was just nothing there.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:05.91,0:27:07.67,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那种感觉  真的特别诡异  
Dialogue: 2,0:27:05.91,0:27:07.67,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It was just really weird to be around it.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:07.75,0:27:14.05,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,还有件事  以前破坏工作台和熔炉  简直慢得要命  
Dialogue: 2,0:27:07.75,0:27:10.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, another thing I remember is when mining
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.60,0:27:14.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the crafting table and the furnace took absolutely ages.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:14.31,0:27:16.07,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,即使用斧头砍工作台  
Dialogue: 2,0:27:14.31,0:27:16.07,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You could use an axe on a crafting table,
Dialogue: 1,0:27:16.39,0:27:17.41,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,照样要花一辈子时间  
Dialogue: 2,0:27:16.39,0:27:17.41,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it would still take forever.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:17.81,0:27:19.17,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,钻石镐挖熔炉？  
Dialogue: 2,0:27:17.81,0:27:19.17,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Use a diamond pick on a furnace,
Dialogue: 1,0:27:19.35,0:27:20.99,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,照样慢得让人抓狂  
Dialogue: 2,0:27:19.35,0:27:20.99,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it would still take forever.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:21.27,0:27:27.69,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个改动可能连新手都记得  你们还记得以前可以狂点鼠标挥剑吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:27:21.27,0:27:24.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You probably don't even need to be a Minecraft veteran to remember
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.48,0:27:27.69,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,this but do you remember when you could spam click your sword?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:27.85,0:27:31.93,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我敢肯定很多人记得  这个改动当时可惹恼了不少玩家
Dialogue: 2,0:27:27.85,0:27:31.93,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm sure a lot of you do and a lot of people got mad when this was changed.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:32.07,0:27:32.95,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们当时也是其中一员吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:27:32.07,0:27:32.95,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Were you guys one of them?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:33.19,0:27:34.51,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在评论区告诉我吧
Dialogue: 2,0:27:33.19,0:27:34.51,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Let me know in the comments below.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:34.65,0:27:41.03,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我相信有些老玩家还记得  以前MC里的火势蔓延速度快得离谱
Dialogue: 2,0:27:34.65,0:27:37.15,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm sure some of you remember back to a time
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.15,0:27:41.03,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,where fire in Minecraft used to spread insanely fast.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:41.17,0:27:43.29,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以如果你在游戏里点了火
Dialogue: 2,0:27:41.17,0:27:43.29,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So if you started a fire in your world,
Dialogue: 1,0:27:43.53,0:27:45.35,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那绝对会酿成大祸
Dialogue: 2,0:27:43.53,0:27:45.35,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it was going to be very devastating.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:45.77,0:27:52.93,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你还记得能用剑格挡 而不是用盾牌挡伤害的年代，那你绝对是我的世界的老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:27:45.77,0:27:49.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You are indeed a Minecraft veteran if you remember when you could
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.34,0:27:52.93,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,block with your sword instead of blocking with your shield.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:52.97,0:27:55.15,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界的早期版本中 
Dialogue: 2,0:27:52.97,0:27:55.15,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:27:55.59,0:27:57.25,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,物品如楼梯 
Dialogue: 2,0:27:55.59,0:27:57.25,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,items such as stairs,
Dialogue: 1,0:27:57.53,0:27:59.07,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,栅栏 压力板
Dialogue: 2,0:27:57.53,0:27:59.07,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,fences, pressure plates,
Dialogue: 1,0:27:59.29,0:28:04.63,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,仙人掌等物品扔在地上时  看起来体积大得夸张
Dialogue: 2,0:27:59.29,0:28:04.63,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,cacti and other blocks looked absolutely huge when thrown on the ground.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:04.77,0:28:06.19,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看看这比例
Dialogue: 2,0:28:04.77,0:28:06.19,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean just look at them.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:06.31,0:28:08.15,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,相信老玩家都记得这个经典bug
Dialogue: 2,0:28:06.31,0:28:08.15,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm sure some of you remember this bug,
Dialogue: 1,0:28:08.23,0:28:12.33,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这画面太滑稽了  能记得这个的  绝对是MC老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:28:08.23,0:28:12.33,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it looked so funny and if you do remember it then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:12.55,0:28:17.53,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,还记得当年MC的洞穴  全是清一色的石头吗
Dialogue: 2,0:28:12.55,0:28:17.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember when caves in Minecraft were only made out of stone?
Dialogue: 1,0:28:17.73,0:28:19.93,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那时可找不到花岗岩 
Dialogue: 2,0:28:17.73,0:28:19.93,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't find blocks such as granite,
Dialogue: 1,0:28:20.17,0:28:22.81,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,闪长岩或安山岩  与石头混在一起的情况
Dialogue: 2,0:28:20.17,0:28:22.81,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,diorite or andesite blending in with the stone.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:22.89,0:28:26.67,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那时的洞穴只有单一的石块  看起来简单纯粹得多
Dialogue: 2,0:28:22.89,0:28:26.67,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You'd only find stone which made the caves look a lot more simple back then.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:26.77,0:28:29.47,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界的Alpha和Beta版本时期
Dialogue: 2,0:28:26.77,0:28:29.47,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In the alpha and beta days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:28:29.47,0:28:33.91,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,僵尸猪人死后  会直接掉落熟猪排
Dialogue: 2,0:28:29.47,0:28:33.91,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the zombie pigmen used to drop cooked porkchop upon death,
Dialogue: 1,0:28:33.97,0:28:37.27,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这使它们成为游戏中最强大的食物来源之一
Dialogue: 2,0:28:33.97,0:28:37.27,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,making them one of the strongest food sources in Minecraft.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:37.55,0:28:38.73,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你还记得这些细节
Dialogue: 2,0:28:37.55,0:28:38.73,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,And if you remember this,
Dialogue: 1,0:28:38.81,0:28:40.73,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是MC骨灰级玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:28:38.81,0:28:40.73,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:40.99,0:28:42.97,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,老版岩浆贴图
Dialogue: 2,0:28:40.99,0:28:42.97,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The old lava texture.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:43.29,0:28:49.69,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我知道你们有些人还记得  如果你认得出这个贴图  那你就是MC老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:28:43.29,0:28:45.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I know some of you remember this and if you do remember this
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.42,0:28:49.69,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,texture then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:49.95,0:28:56.97,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你曾是几年前那群  在创造模式里用钻石块  盖房子的MC玩家之一
Dialogue: 2,0:28:49.95,0:28:53.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you were one of those Minecraft players a few years
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.14,0:28:56.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,back that made your house out of diamond blocks in creative mode,
Dialogue: 1,0:28:57.13,0:28:59.13,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你就是MC元老级玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:28:57.13,0:28:59.13,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:59.29,0:29:01.97,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那时候这么做的人可太多了
Dialogue: 2,0:28:59.29,0:29:01.97,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I just remember a lot of people doing that back in the day.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:02.15,0:29:02.95,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你当年也是其中一员吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:29:02.15,0:29:02.95,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Were you one of them?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:03.11,0:29:04.15,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在评论区告诉我吧
Dialogue: 2,0:29:03.11,0:29:04.15,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Let me know in the comments.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:04.51,0:29:11.21,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你还记得这个场景  那你绝对是MC老玩家了  那就是当你遇到这些巨型天坑的时候
Dialogue: 2,0:29:04.51,0:29:08.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You are definitely a Minecraft veteran if you remember
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.02,0:29:11.21,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,this and that is when you would come across these massive holes
Dialogue: 1,0:29:11.21,0:29:16.83,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在《我的世界》世界里  这些被称为区块错误的巨大缺口  它们看起来就像这样
Dialogue: 2,0:29:11.21,0:29:16.83,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in your Minecraft world which are otherwise known as chunk errors and they'd look like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:17.03,0:29:23.75,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你在游戏的Alpha版本时期玩过我的世界  那你一定记得这有多烦人  那就是——
Dialogue: 2,0:29:17.03,0:29:20.77,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, if you played Minecraft in the alpha days of the game
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.77,0:29:23.75,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you remember how annoying this was and that was
Dialogue: 1,0:29:23.75,0:29:27.07,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当年树叶被砍后不会消失的版本
Dialogue: 2,0:29:23.75,0:29:27.07,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,when leaves didn't decay after you broke a tree.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:27.29,0:29:28.63,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这简直让人抓狂
Dialogue: 2,0:29:27.29,0:29:28.63,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It was so frustrating.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:29.05,0:29:34.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你知道的 你正砍着树呢  突然发现所有树叶都还飘在空中  
Dialogue: 2,0:29:29.05,0:29:32.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You know, you'd just be chopping down a bunch of trees in your world
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.10,0:29:34.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and then you'd notice that all the leaves from that tree
Dialogue: 1,0:29:34.90,0:29:39.61,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,除非你亲手打掉  否则它们永远不会消失
Dialogue: 2,0:29:34.90,0:29:39.61,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,aren't disappearing because they wouldn't decay unless you manually broke them yourself.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:39.73,0:29:41.69,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界早期版本中 
Dialogue: 2,0:29:39.73,0:29:41.69,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:29:42.09,0:29:46.85,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,曾几何时  传说中的附魔金苹果  居然还有合成配方
Dialogue: 2,0:29:42.09,0:29:46.85,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,there was a time where the infamous enchanted golden apple had a crafting recipe.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:47.25,0:29:54.21,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 附魔金苹果（又称Notch苹果）  当年可以用8个金块和1个苹果合成
Dialogue: 2,0:29:47.25,0:29:50.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, the enchanted golden apple or the notch apple
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.80,0:29:54.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,could be crafted with eight gold blocks and one apple which
Dialogue: 1,0:29:54.21,0:29:59.29,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,有人认为这过于破坏平衡  因为这种金苹果赋予玩家的效果实在太强了
Dialogue: 2,0:29:54.21,0:29:59.29,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,some considered to be quite overpowered due to the effects of the apple giving the player.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:59.51,0:30:07.03,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这直接导致附魔金苹果的合成配方  在2015年的1.9战斗更新中被移除了
Dialogue: 2,0:29:59.51,0:30:03.31,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This resulted in the crafting recipe for the enchanted golden apple
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.31,0:30:07.03,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,to be removed in the 1.9 combat update in 2015.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:07.55,0:30:13.85,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你仍然能在我的世界中找到附魔金苹果  但它们极其稀有  仅能在——
Dialogue: 2,0:30:07.55,0:30:11.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You can still find enchanted golden apples in your Minecraft world
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.10,0:30:13.85,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but they are extremely rare and can only be found in
Dialogue: 1,0:30:13.85,0:30:16.75,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,地牢和废弃矿井等结构中寻获
Dialogue: 2,0:30:13.85,0:30:16.75,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,structures such as dungeons and mineshafts.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:16.83,0:30:17.89,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但话虽如此
Dialogue: 2,0:30:16.83,0:30:17.89,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But with all that said,
Dialogue: 1,0:30:17.89,0:30:20.69,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你还记得Notch苹果的合成配方
Dialogue: 2,0:30:17.89,0:30:20.69,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,if you remember the crafting recipe for the notch apple,
Dialogue: 1,0:30:20.87,0:30:22.75,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是我的世界的老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:30:20.87,0:30:22.75,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:23.11,0:30:30.13,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得创造模式刚在beta1.8加入时  怪物还能攻击玩家吗
Dialogue: 2,0:30:23.11,0:30:25.95,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, do you guys remember when creative mode
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.95,0:30:30.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,was first added in beta 1.8 and mobs could attack you?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:30.21,0:30:32.13,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,简直烦死人了
Dialogue: 2,0:30:30.21,0:30:32.13,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It was the most annoying thing ever.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:32.29,0:30:34.43,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我在创造模式里盖房子的时候
Dialogue: 2,0:30:32.29,0:30:34.43,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'd be building my house in creative mode,
Dialogue: 1,0:30:34.71,0:30:35.61,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,正悠闲地盖着房子
Dialogue: 2,0:30:34.71,0:30:35.61,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you know, peacefully,
Dialogue: 1,0:30:36.05,0:30:38.35,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,突然一只苦力怕走过来  直接把房子炸飞了
Dialogue: 2,0:30:36.05,0:30:38.35,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and a creeper would just come up to me and blow it up.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:38.51,0:30:42.53,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得以前我的世界里不能调节亮度的时候吗
Dialogue: 2,0:30:38.51,0:30:42.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember when you couldn't toggle your brightness in Minecraft?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:42.79,0:30:43.71,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我可记得清清楚楚 
Dialogue: 2,0:30:42.79,0:30:43.71,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Because I do.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:43.83,0:30:48.93,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这导致当年的洞穴系统  黑得根本看不清路
Dialogue: 2,0:30:43.83,0:30:48.93,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This resulted in cave systems back in the day being extremely hard to see in.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:49.03,0:30:50.31,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你没有带火把
Dialogue: 2,0:30:49.03,0:30:50.31,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you didn't have any torches,
Dialogue: 1,0:30:50.67,0:30:53.15,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你在洞穴里就完全看不见东西
Dialogue: 2,0:30:50.67,0:30:53.15,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you were not able to see anything in caves.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:53.35,0:30:54.47,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如今在我的世界里
Dialogue: 2,0:30:53.35,0:30:54.47,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Nowadays in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:30:54.77,0:31:01.51,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,现在你甚至可以把亮度调到最高  不带火把也能在洞穴里勉强看清路
Dialogue: 2,0:30:54.77,0:30:57.41,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you could literally have your brightness on full
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.41,0:31:01.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and explore a cave and sort of see without even having a torch.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:01.61,0:31:02.57,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这简直太离谱了 
Dialogue: 2,0:31:01.61,0:31:02.57,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It's kind of crazy.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:02.83,0:31:09.99,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得以前在我的世界里  会在地表生成地牢的时期吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:31:02.83,0:31:06.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember back to a time when you would find
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.02,0:31:09.99,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,dungeons generated on the surface in your Minecraft world?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:10.05,0:31:11.05,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我可记得清清楚楚
Dialogue: 2,0:31:10.05,0:31:11.05,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Because I do.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:11.17,0:31:13.49,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你正漫步在沙漠生物群系中 
Dialogue: 2,0:31:11.17,0:31:13.49,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You'd just be walking around in a desert bio,
Dialogue: 1,0:31:13.49,0:31:14.85,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,自顾自地走着
Dialogue: 2,0:31:13.49,0:31:14.85,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,minding your own business,
Dialogue: 1,0:31:15.07,0:31:20.45,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,突然就会发现一个方形大坑  
Dialogue: 2,0:31:15.07,0:31:20.45,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and suddenly you'd come across this big square hole with either an exposed dungeon in it,
Dialogue: 1,0:31:20.53,0:31:24.91,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,或者一个被沙子掩埋的地牢  需要你动手挖掘才能显露出来
Dialogue: 2,0:31:20.53,0:31:24.91,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,or a dungeon that's just covered in some sand and would require you to dig it out.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:25.03,0:31:30.23,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我还记得刷怪笼和两个箱子上  总会压着一层沙子
Dialogue: 2,0:31:25.03,0:31:30.23,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I also remember the spawner and the two chests having a sand block on top of them,
Dialogue: 1,0:31:30.29,0:31:34.45,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,清理地牢时  沙块的存在让你一眼就能锁定它们的位置
Dialogue: 2,0:31:30.29,0:31:34.45,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,making you know exactly where they were when clearing out the dungeon.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:34.73,0:31:39.97,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,还记得那时候曲奇饼是我的世界里最难获取的食物之一
Dialogue: 2,0:31:34.73,0:31:39.97,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I remember back to a time when cookies were one of the hardest foods to obtain in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:31:40.31,0:31:41.83,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我来告诉你原因
Dialogue: 2,0:31:40.31,0:31:41.83,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and I will tell you why.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:41.83,0:31:46.11,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界中  曲奇饼是用小麦和可可豆合成的
Dialogue: 2,0:31:41.83,0:31:46.11,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So cookies in Minecraft are crafted with wheat and cocoa beans,
Dialogue: 1,0:31:46.29,0:31:51.61,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但在beta时期  可可豆只能在地牢的箱子里找到
Dialogue: 2,0:31:46.29,0:31:51.61,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but cocoa beans in the beta days of Minecraft could only be found in dungeon chests.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:51.77,0:31:53.85,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 除此之外别无他法
Dialogue: 2,0:31:51.77,0:31:53.85,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, you couldn't find them any other way,
Dialogue: 1,0:31:54.15,0:31:56.13,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这使得它们极其难以获取
Dialogue: 2,0:31:54.15,0:31:56.13,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,making them extremely hard to find.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:56.35,0:32:02.45,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,直到1.3版本更新后  可可果才被添加到丛林树上自然生成
Dialogue: 2,0:31:56.35,0:32:02.45,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It wasn't until version release 1.3 where cocoa pods were added to spawn on jungle trees,
Dialogue: 1,0:32:02.63,0:32:04.95,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,可可豆的获取才变得稍微容易些
Dialogue: 2,0:32:02.63,0:32:04.95,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,making cocoa beans a bit easier to find,
Dialogue: 1,0:32:05.25,0:32:07.33,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,曲奇饼的制作也才变得稍微容易些
Dialogue: 2,0:32:05.25,0:32:07.33,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and cookies a bit easier to craft.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:07.47,0:32:11.53,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过说真的 如果你还记得  beta时期曲奇饼有多稀有的话
Dialogue: 2,0:32:07.47,0:32:11.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But yeah, if you remember how rare cookies were in the beta days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:32:11.75,0:32:13.71,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是我的世界的老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:32:11.75,0:32:13.71,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:14.03,0:32:15.87,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界beta时期
Dialogue: 2,0:32:14.03,0:32:15.87,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In the beta days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:32:16.31,0:32:26.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,骨粉曾经极其强力  比如用在树木或小麦田上  能瞬间催熟作物  
Dialogue: 2,0:32:16.31,0:32:21.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,bone meal was extremely overpowered as using it on trees or wheat farms
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.90,0:32:26.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,for example would grow them instantly instead of growing it in stages.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:26.75,0:32:34.91,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这导致骨粉在1.5版本被大幅削弱  现在使用时必须分阶段生长  比如树木需要逐步培育
Dialogue: 2,0:32:26.75,0:32:31.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This resulted in bone meal being significantly nerfed in version 1.5
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.64,0:32:34.91,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,as you now have to grow the tree for example in stages.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:34.95,0:32:38.79,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过说真的 如果你还记得  当年骨粉能瞬间催熟树木的日子
Dialogue: 2,0:32:34.95,0:32:38.79,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But yeah, if you remember the old bone meal where it instantly grew a tree,
Dialogue: 1,0:32:39.13,0:32:40.91,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是我的世界的老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:32:39.13,0:32:40.91,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:41.13,0:32:42.99,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界开发历程中
Dialogue: 2,0:32:41.13,0:32:42.99,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,At one point in Minecraft's development,
Dialogue: 1,0:32:43.25,0:32:50.71,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,游戏里曾有个奇葩漏洞  木台阶只能用镐子破坏  
Dialogue: 2,0:32:43.25,0:32:47.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,there was a bug that existed in the game where wooden slabs
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.02,0:32:50.71,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,could only be broken if they were broken by a pickaxe.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:50.77,0:32:52.45,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 斧头根本不管用 
Dialogue: 2,0:32:50.77,0:32:52.45,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, axes didn't work,
Dialogue: 1,0:32:52.71,0:32:54.19,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你甚至不能用拳头或其他工具破坏
Dialogue: 2,0:32:52.71,0:32:54.19,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you couldn't use your fists or anything,
Dialogue: 1,0:32:54.63,0:32:57.13,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,必须用镐子才能破坏  这设定简直离谱  
Dialogue: 2,0:32:54.63,0:32:57.13,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you had to use a pickaxe and it was very strange.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:57.21,0:32:58.19,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你还记得这个细节  
Dialogue: 2,0:32:57.21,0:32:58.19,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,And if you remember this,
Dialogue: 1,0:32:58.45,0:33:00.23,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是我的世界骨灰级玩家  
Dialogue: 2,0:32:58.45,0:33:00.23,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:00.53,0:33:03.67,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,接下来这个特性听起来很随机  
Dialogue: 2,0:33:00.53,0:33:03.67,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This next feature is going to sound really random,
Dialogue: 1,0:33:03.95,0:33:11.13,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但如果你记得村民刚加入游戏时  头顶还挂着“Testificate”的标签  
Dialogue: 2,0:33:03.95,0:33:08.41,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but if you remember when the villager had the testificate name tag 
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.41,0:33:11.13,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,above their head when they were first added into the game, 
Dialogue: 1,0:33:11.13,0:33:17.65,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你就是元老级玩家了  因为这个设定要追溯到2011年的beta1.9版本  
Dialogue: 2,0:33:11.13,0:33:17.65,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran because they were added all the way back in beta 1.9 in 2011,
Dialogue: 1,0:33:18.09,0:33:20.37,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,距今已经非常久远了  
Dialogue: 2,0:33:18.09,0:33:20.37,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which was a really long time ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:20.49,0:33:22.01,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 如果你记得这个特性  
Dialogue: 2,0:33:20.49,0:33:22.01,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, if you remember this feature,
Dialogue: 1,0:33:22.11,0:33:23.91,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你就是远古版本玩家  
Dialogue: 2,0:33:22.11,0:33:23.91,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are an old school player.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:24.03,0:33:34.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,大家还记得吗 有段时期  在我的世界里找到钻石就算通关了  因为找到钻石后  游戏就基本没其他内容了
Dialogue: 2,0:33:24.03,0:33:28.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember back to a time when finding diamonds in Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.92,0:33:34.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,was considered to be the end game as there wasn't really much to do after finding them
Dialogue: 1,0:33:34.15,0:33:40.63,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 我们说的是那个年代  工具还没有附魔系统  废弃矿井之类的
Dialogue: 2,0:33:34.15,0:33:38.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, we are talking back to a time when there wasn't enchanting
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.38,0:33:40.63,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,for your tools and there wasn't any abandoned
Dialogue: 1,0:33:40.63,0:33:45.13,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,矿井可以探索  甚至还没有末影龙可以挑战
Dialogue: 2,0:33:40.63,0:33:45.13,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,mineshafts to explore and there even wasn't the ender dragon to fight.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:45.37,0:33:49.13,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那时候你能做的  就只有挖矿找钻石  或者盖房子
Dialogue: 2,0:33:45.37,0:33:49.13,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,All you could really do was go mining to find diamonds or build.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:49.39,0:33:50.83,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那时候的游戏非常简单
Dialogue: 2,0:33:49.39,0:33:50.83,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It was very simple back then,
Dialogue: 1,0:33:51.01,0:33:52.03,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但那份纯粹却弥足珍贵
Dialogue: 2,0:33:51.01,0:33:52.03,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but it was very beautiful.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:52.31,0:33:55.37,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我可能是极少数  还记得这些的玩家之一
Dialogue: 2,0:33:52.31,0:33:55.37,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I might be one of the only players that remembers this,
Dialogue: 1,0:33:55.47,0:34:02.83,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但你们还记得吗  老版本我的世界里  夜晚的星星看起来完全不同
Dialogue: 2,0:33:55.47,0:33:58.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but do you guys remember when the stars that appear at night
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.76,0:34:02.83,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in Minecraft looked different in the old versions of Minecraft
Dialogue: 1,0:34:02.85,0:34:06.55,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这就是老版本我的世界里星星的模样
Dialogue: 2,0:34:02.85,0:34:06.55,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So here is how the stars look in the old versions of Minecraft.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:06.83,0:34:12.87,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如你所见 那时的星星比如今版本  要硕大得多 因为早年游戏里的星体
Dialogue: 2,0:34:06.83,0:34:10.37,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,And as you can see, they are absolutely massive compared to
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.37,0:34:12.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,how the stars look today because the stars in Minecraft
Dialogue: 1,0:34:12.88,0:34:17.45,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如今游戏里的星星  看起来更贴近现实  尺寸略小 亮度也更高
Dialogue: 2,0:34:12.88,0:34:17.45,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,today look a bit more realistic and slightly smaller and a bit brighter.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:17.71,0:34:19.31,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但没错 如果你还记得这些
Dialogue: 2,0:34:17.71,0:34:19.31,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But yeah, if you remember this,
Dialogue: 1,0:34:19.41,0:34:21.17,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是我的世界的老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:34:19.41,0:34:21.17,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:21.43,0:34:29.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得那个更简单的年代吗  那时候我的世界里  还没有合成配方书来帮你制作物品
Dialogue: 2,0:34:21.43,0:34:26.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember back to a simpler time when there wasn't a recipe book
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.42,0:34:29.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in Minecraft to help you craft items in the game
Dialogue: 1,0:34:29.61,0:34:30.65,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为我还记得 
Dialogue: 2,0:34:29.61,0:34:30.65,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Because I do.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:30.75,0:34:36.21,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我记得当初不知道合成配方时  不得不去网上搜索的感觉  因为游戏里没有指引真的很烦人
Dialogue: 2,0:34:30.75,0:34:34.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I remember not knowing how to craft something and it really bothered me
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.16,0:34:36.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that I had to just google it because you didn't
Dialogue: 1,0:34:36.22,0:34:37.27,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在游戏里根本找不到任何提示
Dialogue: 2,0:34:36.22,0:34:37.27,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,get any help in the game.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:37.37,0:34:42.03,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,必须自己摸索合成配方  说实话我还挺怀念这种挑战的
Dialogue: 2,0:34:37.37,0:34:39.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You had to figure out how to craft things for yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.90,0:34:42.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and I kind of liked that challenge to be honest.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:42.25,0:34:47.63,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,创造模式于2011年  在我的世界Beta 1.8版本中加入游戏
Dialogue: 2,0:34:42.25,0:34:47.63,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Creative mode was added into Minecraft in version beta 1.8 in 2011.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:48.19,0:34:51.45,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Beta 1.8版本中  当你创建创造模式世界时
Dialogue: 2,0:34:48.19,0:34:51.45,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In beta 1.8 when you made a creative world,
Dialogue: 1,0:34:51.59,0:34:54.93,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你的快捷栏里总会自动装满各种方块
Dialogue: 2,0:34:51.59,0:34:54.93,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you would always spawn with a bunch of blocks in your hotbar,
Dialogue: 1,0:34:55.07,0:34:59.21,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说实话这让我挺烦的  因为我总是要把它们换成其他物品
Dialogue: 2,0:34:55.07,0:34:56.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which I found kind of annoying to be honest 
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.90,0:34:59.21,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,because I'd always just swap them out for different items.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:59.33,0:35:00.45,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你还记得这些 
Dialogue: 2,0:34:59.33,0:35:00.45,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now if you remember this,
Dialogue: 1,0:35:00.57,0:35:02.53,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你就是我的世界老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:35:00.57,0:35:02.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:02.71,0:35:10.65,MC-CN,,0,0,0,, 你们还记得吗  以前我的世界里的建筑高度上限  只有128格？
Dialogue: 2,0:35:02.71,0:35:06.75,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, do you guys remember back to a time when the max
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.75,0:35:10.65,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,build height in Minecraft was 128 blocks?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:10.77,0:35:11.63,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为我还记得 
Dialogue: 2,0:35:10.77,0:35:11.63,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Because I do.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:11.73,0:35:16.65,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我记得以前造到建筑高度上限时  看着云层与自己平齐
Dialogue: 2,0:35:11.73,0:35:14.17,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I remember building up to the build height back in the day
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.17,0:35:16.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and seeing the clouds being level with me,
Dialogue: 1,0:35:16.75,0:35:17.91,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那种感觉真的很奇怪
Dialogue: 2,0:35:16.75,0:35:17.91,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which was really weird.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:18.05,0:35:21.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,现在我的世界里的建筑高度上限  已经提升到了256格（现为319）
Dialogue: 2,0:35:18.05,0:35:21.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now the build height in Minecraft is 256,
Dialogue: 1,0:35:21.35,0:35:24.15,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以现在的上限  是过去的两倍了
Dialogue: 2,0:35:21.35,0:35:24.15,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,so it's double what it was back in the day.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:24.31,0:35:26.61,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,可能只有我还记得这件事了
Dialogue: 2,0:35:24.31,0:35:26.61,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I might be the only one who remembers this,
Dialogue: 1,0:35:26.75,0:35:29.57,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但你们还记得吗  在我的世界旧版本里
Dialogue: 2,0:35:26.75,0:35:29.57,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but do you guys remember in the old versions of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:35:29.87,0:35:31.69,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,具体来说 在Alpha和Beta版本时期
Dialogue: 2,0:35:29.87,0:35:31.69,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,more specifically alpha and beta,
Dialogue: 1,0:35:31.85,0:35:34.81,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那时候动物们总是蹦蹦跳跳的？
Dialogue: 2,0:35:31.85,0:35:34.81,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,when the animals would just jump around a lot more?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:34.89,0:35:35.69,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我也不知道为什么
Dialogue: 2,0:35:34.89,0:35:35.69,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I don't know what it was.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:35.77,0:35:37.63,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,比如你看到一只羊
Dialogue: 2,0:35:35.77,0:35:37.63,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You'd just be seeing a sheep for example,
Dialogue: 1,0:35:37.93,0:35:39.49,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,到处蹦蹦跳跳的
Dialogue: 2,0:35:37.93,0:35:39.49,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,just jumping all over the place.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:39.55,0:35:40.31,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们就只会这样蹦蹦跳跳
Dialogue: 2,0:35:39.55,0:35:40.31,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's all they do.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:40.41,0:35:43.27,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们就只会到处蹦跶  直到被你宰掉
Dialogue: 2,0:35:40.41,0:35:43.27,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,They just jump around until you killed them I guess.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:43.43,0:35:50.91,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,只有我的世界的老玩家才会记得  那就是现在游戏里牛排的材质
Dialogue: 2,0:35:43.43,0:35:47.27,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You will only remember this if you are a Minecraft veteran
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.27,0:35:50.91,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and that is when the texture for the steak in Minecraft today
Dialogue: 1,0:35:50.91,0:35:57.17,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,最初是属于早期版本中  烤猪排的材质
Dialogue: 2,0:35:50.91,0:35:57.17,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,originally belonged to the cooked pork chop for the pig in the earlier days of Minecraft.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:57.77,0:36:00.53,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错伙计们 在Beta 1.8版本之前 
Dialogue: 2,0:35:57.77,0:36:00.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right guys, before beta 1.8,
Dialogue: 1,0:36:00.65,0:36:03.53,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,猪是唯一会掉落肉类的动物 
Dialogue: 2,0:36:00.65,0:36:03.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the pig was the only animal that dropped meat,
Dialogue: 1,0:36:03.65,0:36:09.05,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这意味着当时烤猪排用的就是这个材质  后来当牛也能掉落食物时
Dialogue: 2,0:36:03.65,0:36:06.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which meant they used this texture for the cooked pork
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.46,0:36:09.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,chop and when the cow was given a food drop,
Dialogue: 1,0:36:09.23,0:36:13.53,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个材质就被转移给了牛排  而猪排则换上了新的烤制材质
Dialogue: 2,0:36:09.23,0:36:13.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they got the texture instead and the pig got a new cooked pork chop texture,
Dialogue: 1,0:36:13.75,0:36:15.31,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当然 现在猪排的材质变成了这样
Dialogue: 2,0:36:13.75,0:36:15.31,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which of course looks like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:15.31,0:36:17.73,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你还记得这个我的世界启动器
Dialogue: 2,0:36:15.31,0:36:17.73,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you remember this Minecraft launcher,
Dialogue: 1,0:36:18.31,0:36:20.43,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,或者这个我的世界启动器
Dialogue: 2,0:36:18.31,0:36:20.43,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,or this Minecraft launcher,
Dialogue: 1,0:36:20.85,0:36:22.91,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,或是这个我的世界启动器  
Dialogue: 2,0:36:20.85,0:36:22.91,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,or this Minecraft launcher,
Dialogue: 1,0:36:23.09,0:36:26.37,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那么恭喜你  因为你是个真正的MC老玩家  
Dialogue: 2,0:36:23.09,0:36:26.37,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then congratulations because you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:26.67,0:36:33.53,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得吗  在以前的版本中  工作台其实并不叫“工作台”？
Dialogue: 2,0:36:26.67,0:36:30.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember back to a time when the crafting table
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.40,0:36:33.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,wasn't actually called the crafting table in Minecraft？
Dialogue: 1,0:36:33.97,0:36:38.25,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 它当时被称为“合成台” 如果你还记得这个细节  
Dialogue: 2,0:36:33.97,0:36:38.25,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Nope, instead it was actually called the workbench and if you remember this,
Dialogue: 1,0:36:38.35,0:36:40.19,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是个MC元老级玩家  
Dialogue: 2,0:36:38.35,0:36:40.19,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:40.19,0:36:42.55,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界的早期版本中  
Dialogue: 2,0:36:40.19,0:36:42.55,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:36:42.91,0:36:45.45,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,也就是Alpha和Beta测试阶段  
Dialogue: 2,0:36:42.91,0:36:45.45,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in the alpha and beta days of the game,
Dialogue: 1,0:36:45.65,0:36:49.37,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,游戏里的剑伤害值要高得多  
Dialogue: 2,0:36:45.65,0:36:49.37,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,swords in Minecraft used to be a lot more powerful.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:49.77,0:36:51.29,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,比如钻石剑  
Dialogue: 2,0:36:49.77,0:36:51.29,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,A diamond sword for example,
Dialogue: 1,0:36:51.51,0:36:55.81,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Alpha和Beta版本时期  能对敌人造成5颗心的伤害
Dialogue: 2,0:36:51.51,0:36:55.81,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in alpha and beta, used to deal 5 hearts of damage to enemies,
Dialogue: 1,0:36:55.99,0:36:58.97,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,两下就能干掉一只苦力怕  
Dialogue: 2,0:36:55.99,0:36:58.97,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,meaning you could kill a creeper in just 2 hits,
Dialogue: 1,0:36:59.07,0:37:00.53,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这简直强得离谱  
Dialogue: 2,0:36:59.07,0:37:00.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which was pretty overpowered.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:00.77,0:37:03.15,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但在Beta 1.9版本更新时  
Dialogue: 2,0:37:00.77,0:37:03.15,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, in the beta 1.9 update,
Dialogue: 1,0:37:03.33,0:37:05.15,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,游戏加入了附魔系统  
Dialogue: 2,0:37:03.33,0:37:05.15,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,enchanting was added into the game,
Dialogue: 1,0:37:05.23,0:37:07.27,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因此不得不削弱剑的伤害  
Dialogue: 2,0:37:05.23,0:37:07.27,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which meant sword damage had to be reduced,
Dialogue: 1,0:37:07.27,0:37:12.95,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,钻石剑的伤害  从5颗心降到了3.5颗心  
Dialogue: 2,0:37:07.27,0:37:12.95,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,meaning a diamond sword's damage went from 5 hearts of damage to 3.5 hearts of damage.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:13.11,0:37:14.75,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们知道现在我的世界里  
Dialogue: 2,0:37:13.11,0:37:14.75,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You know how in Minecraft today,
Dialogue: 1,0:37:14.91,0:37:17.87,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,金苹果是用金锭合成的对吧？  
Dialogue: 2,0:37:14.91,0:37:17.87,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,golden apples are crafted by using gold ingots?
Dialogue: 1,0:37:18.03,0:37:20.35,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但以前可不是这样制作的  
Dialogue: 2,0:37:18.03,0:37:20.35,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Well, it wasn't always crafted this way.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:20.47,0:37:23.29,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 在游戏早期版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:37:20.47,0:37:23.29,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right guys, back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:37:23.61,0:37:29.73,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,金苹果的配方是8个金粒加1个苹果  而非现在的8个金锭加1个苹果
Dialogue: 2,0:37:23.61,0:37:29.73,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,golden apples were crafted with 8 gold nuggets and 1 apple instead of 8 gold ingots and 1 apple,
Dialogue: 1,0:37:29.91,0:37:30.79,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你还记得这个配方
Dialogue: 2,0:37:29.91,0:37:30.79,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and if you remember this,
Dialogue: 1,0:37:30.85,0:37:32.49,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你就是我的世界的老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:37:30.85,0:37:32.49,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:32.75,0:37:36.51,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你玩过我的世界的Alpha和Beta版本
Dialogue: 2,0:37:32.75,0:37:36.51,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you played Minecraft in the alpha and beta stages of the game,
Dialogue: 1,0:37:36.61,0:37:40.59,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你一定记得  拆毁楼梯时那个烦人的漏洞  
Dialogue: 2,0:37:36.61,0:37:40.59,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you will remember a very annoying bug when you destroyed stairs.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:40.91,0:37:42.47,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以在Alpha和Beta版本时期
Dialogue: 2,0:37:40.91,0:37:42.47,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So in alpha and beta,
Dialogue: 1,0:37:42.67,0:37:48.89,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,破坏木制楼梯或圆石楼梯时 实际上不会在打碎后将其返还给你
Dialogue: 2,0:37:42.67,0:37:46.07,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,destroying a wooden stair or a cobblestone stair
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.07,0:37:48.89,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,wouldn't actually give you the stair back when you broke it.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:49.01,0:37:50.85,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不 你根本不会拿回楼梯 
Dialogue: 2,0:37:49.01,0:37:50.85,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Nope, instead of getting the stair back,
Dialogue: 1,0:37:50.93,0:37:54.69,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你只会得到制作楼梯时使用的原始方块
Dialogue: 2,0:37:50.93,0:37:54.69,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,all you would get is one of the blocks you used to create that stair.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:54.85,0:37:56.41,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以如果我拆掉一个木楼梯
Dialogue: 2,0:37:54.85,0:37:56.41,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So if I destroyed a wooden stair,
Dialogue: 1,0:37:56.73,0:37:58.89,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我只会拿回1块木板  这简直让人抓狂
Dialogue: 2,0:37:56.73,0:37:58.89,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'd only get 1 wooden plank back and I was just like,
Dialogue: 1,0:37:59.09,0:38:00.29,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢你的分享 
Dialogue: 2,0:37:59.09,0:38:00.29,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,alright, thanks for that.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:00.29,0:38:07.55,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如今你在我的世界里遇到的村庄  大多会有这种样式的草径小路
Dialogue: 2,0:38:00.29,0:38:03.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Most villages that you come across in Minecraft today
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.52,0:38:07.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,will probably have these grass pathways that look like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:07.75,0:38:10.47,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过 如果你几年前玩过我的世界
Dialogue: 2,0:38:07.75,0:38:10.47,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, if you played Minecraft a few years ago,
Dialogue: 1,0:38:10.61,0:38:17.33,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你或许还记得  那时的村庄小路  是用砂砾铺成的  而非现在的草径  
Dialogue: 2,0:38:10.61,0:38:12.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you will probably remember that the villages
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.78,0:38:17.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,were made out of gravel pathways instead of grass pathways and the gravel
Dialogue: 1,0:38:17.33,0:38:19.03,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,小路看起来是这样的
Dialogue: 2,0:38:17.33,0:38:19.03,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,pathways looked like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:19.23,0:38:21.99,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但如果你还记得村庄里的砂砾小路 
Dialogue: 2,0:38:19.23,0:38:21.99,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But yeah, if you remember the gravel paths in villages,
Dialogue: 1,0:38:22.17,0:38:23.93,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是我的世界的老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:38:22.17,0:38:23.93,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:24.23,0:38:25.31,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你更喜欢哪一种呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:38:24.23,0:38:25.31,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Which one do you prefer?
Dialogue: 1,0:38:25.61,0:38:26.61,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,草径还是砂砾路？
Dialogue: 2,0:38:25.61,0:38:26.61,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Grass or gravel?
Dialogue: 1,0:38:26.87,0:38:28.09,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在评论区告诉我吧
Dialogue: 2,0:38:26.87,0:38:28.09,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Let me know in the comments.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:28.31,0:38:36.11,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得以前物品栏里的  木楼梯和圆石楼梯  纹理长这样吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:38:28.31,0:38:31.63,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember when the texture for wooden stairs
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.63,0:38:36.11,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and cobblestone stairs in the inventory looked like this?
Dialogue: 1,0:38:36.23,0:38:38.07,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这到底是什么鬼？
Dialogue: 2,0:38:36.23,0:38:38.07,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,What on earth is this?
Dialogue: 1,0:38:38.23,0:38:40.03,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这压根就不像楼梯的样子 
Dialogue: 2,0:38:38.23,0:38:40.03,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,They don't even look like stairs.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:40.17,0:38:41.21,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,总之 我们继续往下看 
Dialogue: 2,0:38:40.17,0:38:41.21,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Anyways, moving on.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:41.31,0:38:48.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得以前不能按住Shift键  快速转移物品到箱子的年代吗
Dialogue: 2,0:38:41.31,0:38:44.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember back to a time when you couldn't shift-click
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.98,0:38:48.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,items when transporting them from your inventory into a chest?
Dialogue: 1,0:38:48.85,0:38:49.77,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我可是记忆犹新呢
Dialogue: 2,0:38:48.85,0:38:49.77,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Because I do.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:49.89,0:38:52.25,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,比如 你想转移钻石的时候
Dialogue: 2,0:38:49.89,0:38:52.25,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,For example, if you wanted to move your diamonds,
Dialogue: 1,0:38:52.51,0:38:54.27,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,要把钻石 木头和食物  一股脑儿挪进箱子
Dialogue: 2,0:38:52.51,0:38:54.27,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,wood and food over to a chest,
Dialogue: 1,0:38:54.37,0:38:56.95,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那时候你只能慢慢拖拽物品到箱子里  
Dialogue: 2,0:38:54.37,0:38:56.95,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'd just have to slowly drag them over to the chest,
Dialogue: 1,0:38:57.03,0:38:58.51,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,整个过程耗时又费力  
Dialogue: 2,0:38:57.03,0:38:58.51,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which took a very long time.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:58.65,0:39:00.77,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但这就是当年的游戏机制  
Dialogue: 2,0:38:58.65,0:39:00.77,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But that's just how things were back then.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:00.83,0:39:02.01,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那时候一切都更简单纯粹  
Dialogue: 2,0:39:00.83,0:39:02.01,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It was much more simple.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:02.25,0:39:03.33,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如今在我的世界里  
Dialogue: 2,0:39:02.25,0:39:03.33,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Nowadays in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:39:03.65,0:39:08.25,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你只需按住Shift键点击物品  就能瞬间完成转移  
Dialogue: 2,0:39:03.65,0:39:08.25,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you can just simply shift-click any item you want and it will instantly move over to the chest.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:08.39,0:39:10.31,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个功能简直是我的心头好  
Dialogue: 2,0:39:08.39,0:39:10.31,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,And I love this feature so much.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:10.35,0:39:12.15,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,真庆幸开发者把它加入了游戏  
Dialogue: 2,0:39:10.35,0:39:12.15,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad they added it into the game.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:12.27,0:39:14.53,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在早年的我的世界版本中  
Dialogue: 2,0:39:12.27,0:39:14.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:39:14.91,0:39:19.37,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,沙漠神殿是用羊毛块搭建的  而不是现在陶瓦
Dialogue: 2,0:39:14.91,0:39:19.37,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the desert temple used to be made out of wool instead of terracotta.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:19.63,0:39:20.79,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你还记得这些细节
Dialogue: 2,0:39:19.63,0:39:20.79,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,And if you remember this,
Dialogue: 1,0:39:20.87,0:39:22.85,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是我的世界的元老级玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:39:20.87,0:39:22.85,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:23.13,0:39:30.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我对此记忆犹新是因为  以前总会拆走沙漠神殿的羊毛 第一晚就有床睡觉
Dialogue: 2,0:39:23.13,0:39:27.11,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The reason why I remember it so well is that I always took the wool
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.11,0:39:30.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,from the desert temple so I could make a bed on my first night.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:30.57,0:39:35.75,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你在beta 1.8版本刚加入创造模式时就玩过
Dialogue: 2,0:39:30.57,0:39:35.75,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you played Minecraft Creative Mode when it was first added in version beta 1.8,
Dialogue: 1,0:39:35.85,0:39:42.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你可能还记得当时有个著名漏洞  用剑能隔着老远攻击怪物
Dialogue: 2,0:39:35.85,0:39:38.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you might be aware of a bug that existed at the time
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.84,0:39:42.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,where you could hit mobs with your sword from a very long distance.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:42.69,0:39:46.11,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你看 我隔着这么远就能干掉所有怪物
Dialogue: 2,0:39:42.69,0:39:46.11,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, look, I'm killing all of these mobs from so far away.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:46.17,0:39:47.25,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这怎么可能做到？
Dialogue: 2,0:39:46.17,0:39:47.25,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,How is this even possible?
Dialogue: 1,0:39:47.57,0:39:49.95,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但如果你还记得这个奇葩小漏洞
Dialogue: 2,0:39:47.57,0:39:49.95,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But yeah, if you remember this weird little bug,
Dialogue: 1,0:39:50.05,0:39:51.77,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你就是我的世界的老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:39:50.05,0:39:51.77,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:52.03,0:39:55.97,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你玩过1.7到1.8版本的我的世界
Dialogue: 2,0:39:52.03,0:39:55.97,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you played Minecraft in versions 1.7 and 1.8,
Dialogue: 1,0:39:56.05,0:40:01.31,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你可能还记得  藏在选项菜单里的  超级秘密设置按钮
Dialogue: 2,0:39:56.05,0:40:01.31,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you might remember the super secret settings button that could be found in the options menu.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:01.47,0:40:03.27,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,现在这个超级秘密设置
Dialogue: 2,0:40:01.47,0:40:03.27,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now the super secret settings,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:03.47,0:40:07.19,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,点击后  会在各种着色器特效之间切换
Dialogue: 2,0:40:03.47,0:40:07.19,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,when clicked, would switch between a bunch of different shader effects,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:07.31,0:40:09.79,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我觉得这些特效看起来简直酷毙了
Dialogue: 2,0:40:07.31,0:40:09.79,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which looked very, very cool in my opinion.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:09.91,0:40:13.11,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说实话 这个功能被移除时  我真的特别难过
Dialogue: 2,0:40:09.91,0:40:13.11,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,And I was very sad when they removed this feature to be honest.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:13.35,0:40:18.53,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你在我的世界加入转角楼梯  和倒置楼梯前就玩过这游戏
Dialogue: 2,0:40:13.35,0:40:18.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you played Minecraft before the addition of corner stairs and upside down stairs,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:18.65,0:40:20.65,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你就是我的世界的老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:40:18.65,0:40:20.65,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:20.95,0:40:26.53,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,要知道 当年在我的世界里造木屋时  楼梯只能朝一个方向摆放
Dialogue: 2,0:40:20.95,0:40:23.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You know, you'd be building your wooden house in Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.88,0:40:26.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and you could only place stairs in one type of way,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:26.67,0:40:29.45,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,让你的建筑在当时看起来简单得多  
Dialogue: 2,0:40:26.67,0:40:29.45,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,making your builds look a lot more simple back in the day,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:29.61,0:40:31.55,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我相信很多人都记得这个  
Dialogue: 2,0:40:29.61,0:40:31.55,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and I'm sure a lot of you remember this.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:31.71,0:40:35.41,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但在1.2和1.3版本更新后  
Dialogue: 2,0:40:31.71,0:40:35.41,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But then, in version release 1.2 and 1.3,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:35.55,0:40:39.45,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,现在你可以倒置放置楼梯  还能让它们在转角处连接  
Dialogue: 2,0:40:35.55,0:40:39.45,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you could now place stairs upside down and connect them on corners,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:39.63,0:40:42.77,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,为你的我的世界建筑  增添了更多细节  
Dialogue: 2,0:40:39.63,0:40:42.77,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,adding a lot more detail to your Minecraft builds.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:42.93,0:40:45.69,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你记得这个Mojang标志  
Dialogue: 2,0:40:42.93,0:40:45.69,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you remember this Mojang logo,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:45.69,0:40:50.63,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,或是这个Mojang标志  又或是这个Mojang标志  
Dialogue: 2,0:40:45.69,0:40:50.63,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,or this Mojang logo, or this Mojang logo,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:50.81,0:40:54.01,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那么恭喜你  因为你是个我的世界老玩家  
Dialogue: 2,0:40:50.81,0:40:54.01,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then congratulations because you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:54.27,0:40:58.53,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,接下来这条要致敬  我们这些玩我的世界远古beta的老玩家  
Dialogue: 2,0:40:54.27,0:40:58.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This next one goes out to my old school Minecraft alpha players,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:58.67,0:41:02.71,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那就是仙人掌曾经  更符合现实设定的年代
Dialogue: 2,0:40:58.67,0:41:02.71,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and that is back to a time when cacti was slightly more realistic,
Dialogue: 1,0:41:03.01,0:41:05.57,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为当你试图破坏仙人掌时
Dialogue: 2,0:41:03.01,0:41:05.57,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,as when you went to break the cacti,
Dialogue: 1,0:41:05.69,0:41:08.53,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你实际上会受到半颗心的伤害 
Dialogue: 2,0:41:05.69,0:41:08.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you would actually take half a heart of damage,
Dialogue: 1,0:41:08.65,0:41:11.59,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,正如你所见 说实话这设定还挺酷的 
Dialogue: 2,0:41:08.65,0:41:11.59,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,as you can see, which was kind of cool to be honest.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:11.67,0:41:15.95,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我是说 当你徒手捶打仙人掌时  会受伤这件事其实很合理
Dialogue: 2,0:41:11.67,0:41:15.95,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, it makes sense when you go to punch some cacti that it's going to hurt you.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:16.03,0:41:22.87,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得以前在我的世界里  合成蛋糕会连桶一起消耗掉的年代吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:41:16.03,0:41:19.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember back to a time when you would craft
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.22,0:41:22.87,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a cake in Minecraft and it would take your buckets as well?
Dialogue: 1,0:41:22.95,0:41:24.29,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我是说 这算什么鬼设定？
Dialogue: 2,0:41:22.95,0:41:24.29,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, what's this rubbish?
Dialogue: 1,0:41:24.45,0:41:26.03,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我合成蛋糕时  它居然把桶也吞了
Dialogue: 2,0:41:24.45,0:41:26.03,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I go to create a cake and it just,
Dialogue: 1,0:41:26.07,0:41:27.49,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它连我的桶也一并收走了
Dialogue: 2,0:41:26.07,0:41:27.49,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it takes my buckets as well.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:27.57,0:41:28.25,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这算怎么回事？
Dialogue: 2,0:41:27.57,0:41:28.25,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,What's up with that?
Dialogue: 1,0:41:28.31,0:41:29.75,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我明明应该拿回这些桶的
Dialogue: 2,0:41:28.31,0:41:29.75,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to get them back.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:29.87,0:41:37.03,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得以前我的世界里  合成锁链盔甲有个隐藏配方吗？  
Dialogue: 2,0:41:29.87,0:41:33.03,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember back to a time when there was a secret
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.03,0:41:37.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,crafting recipe to craft chain armor in Minecraft?
Dialogue: 1,0:41:37.31,0:41:38.27,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我可是记忆犹新  
Dialogue: 2,0:41:37.31,0:41:38.27,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Because I do.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:38.39,0:41:41.05,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在1.8版本更新之前  
Dialogue: 2,0:41:38.39,0:41:41.05,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So prior to the Minecraft 1.8 update,
Dialogue: 1,0:41:41.25,0:41:47.71,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玩家可以通过指令生成火方块  用这些火来合成锁链盔甲  
Dialogue: 2,0:41:41.25,0:41:44.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the player could spawn in fire by using commands
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.44,0:41:47.71,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and they could use that fire to craft chain armor,
Dialogue: 1,0:41:47.95,0:41:48.73,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,就像这样  
Dialogue: 2,0:41:47.95,0:41:48.73,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,as you can see.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:48.87,0:41:51.61,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当年发现这个彩蛋时我可惊呆了  
Dialogue: 2,0:41:48.87,0:41:51.61,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I remember being amazed when I discovered this,
Dialogue: 1,0:41:51.71,0:41:57.53,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过1.8版本移除了火方块的生成功能  锁链盔甲配方也就失效了  
Dialogue: 2,0:41:51.71,0:41:54.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but yeah, they removed the ability to spawn in fire blocks
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.62,0:41:57.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in 1.8 so you can no longer craft chain armor,
Dialogue: 1,0:41:57.75,0:42:00.27,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但这在当年真是个超酷的小细节  
Dialogue: 2,0:41:57.75,0:42:00.27,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but yeah, it was such a cool little thing back in the day.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:00.39,0:42:04.41,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,接下来这个改动绝对让人血压升高  你们肯定都记得  
Dialogue: 2,0:42:00.39,0:42:04.41,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm sure a lot of you are going to remember this one because it was so frustrating.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:04.69,0:42:10.91,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,还记得以前在水下窒息时  游戏会强行把你往水底拽的设定吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:42:04.69,0:42:07.87,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember when you started drowning underwater
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.87,0:42:10.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that it would actually pull you down as you were drowning?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:11.09,0:42:15.27,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你根本游不上去  基本就是必死无疑
Dialogue: 2,0:42:11.09,0:42:15.27,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So it'd be so hard to swim back up and it would just pretty much kill you.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:15.35,0:42:16.67,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,简直要命
Dialogue: 2,0:42:15.35,0:42:16.67,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It was so, oh my god,
Dialogue: 1,0:42:16.69,0:42:17.49,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,太烦人了 
Dialogue: 2,0:42:16.69,0:42:17.49,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it was so annoying.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:17.59,0:42:21.03,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,光是回想起来  我就已经开始血压飙升了
Dialogue: 2,0:42:17.59,0:42:21.03,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I literally, I'm getting bad memories of this just thinking about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:21.05,0:42:22.61,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我当年因为这个死了无数次
Dialogue: 2,0:42:21.05,0:42:22.61,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I died so many times.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:22.75,0:42:27.81,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你早年和朋友玩过我的世界多人联机
Dialogue: 2,0:42:22.75,0:42:27.81,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you played Minecraft multiplayer in the earlier days of Minecraft with your friends,
Dialogue: 1,0:42:27.91,0:42:38.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你可能还记得  当年遇到地牢时  刷怪笼里总会刷出猪  而不是原本该有的怪物
Dialogue: 2,0:42:27.91,0:42:31.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you might remember when you encountered a dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.26,0:42:35.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that the spawner would always have a pig inside of it instead of 
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.48,0:42:38.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the corresponding mob it was supposed to spawn.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:38.09,0:42:40.57,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,比如你找到一个僵尸刷怪笼
Dialogue: 2,0:42:38.09,0:42:40.57,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So say for example you found a zombie spawner,
Dialogue: 1,0:42:40.67,0:42:42.61,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,结果里面刷出来的却是猪
Dialogue: 2,0:42:40.67,0:42:42.61,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it would just have a pig inside of it instead,
Dialogue: 1,0:42:42.85,0:42:44.21,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这实在太诡异了
Dialogue: 2,0:42:42.85,0:42:44.21,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which was very strange.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:44.61,0:42:48.35,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我想我们都同意  当年能用剑格挡的时候
Dialogue: 2,0:42:44.61,0:42:48.35,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I think we can all agree that when you could block with your sword,
Dialogue: 1,0:42:48.61,0:42:54.77,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,蹲下并用剑对着其他玩家格挡  就是一种和平的表示  说明你不想攻击
Dialogue: 2,0:42:48.61,0:42:51.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that crouching and blocking with a sword to another player
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.56,0:42:54.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,was just a sign of peace and that you didn't want to attack
Dialogue: 1,0:42:54.77,0:42:55.67,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,或者类似的行为
Dialogue: 2,0:42:54.77,0:42:55.67,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,or anything like that.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:55.75,0:42:58.31,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这就是友善的象征  我真的很怀念
Dialogue: 2,0:42:55.75,0:42:58.31,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It was just a sign of being nice and I really,
Dialogue: 1,0:42:58.55,0:42:59.89,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在服务器上这么做的日子
Dialogue: 2,0:42:58.55,0:42:59.89,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,really miss doing this on servers,
Dialogue: 1,0:43:00.37,0:43:03.93,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,接下来这个让我充满怀旧之情  如果你还记得的话
Dialogue: 2,0:43:00.37,0:43:03.93,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This next one is so nostalgic to me and if you remember it,
Dialogue: 1,0:43:04.03,0:43:08.37,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是我的世界老玩家了  那就是经典的水流声
Dialogue: 2,0:43:04.03,0:43:08.37,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran and that is the old water sound.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:08.51,0:43:13.31,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,就是那种  当你在水里扑腾  或者跳进水里时  发出的经典音效
Dialogue: 2,0:43:08.51,0:43:11.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The old sound when you would splash around in the water
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.26,0:43:13.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,or land in the water or anything like that.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:13.41,0:43:14.31,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,听听看
Dialogue: 2,0:43:13.41,0:43:14.31,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Take a listen.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:25.45,0:43:32.99,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你知道现在在我的世界里  要输入/gamemode creative  才能切换到创造模式  或者输入/weather rain
Dialogue: 2,0:43:25.45,0:43:29.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You know how in Minecraft today you have to type the command game
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.28,0:43:32.99,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,mode creative to go into creative mode or weather rain
Dialogue: 1,0:43:32.99,0:43:34.15,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,来让天下雨？
Dialogue: 2,0:43:32.99,0:43:34.15,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,to make it rain?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:34.27,0:43:41.71,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,要知道 最初你只需输入/gamemode 1  就能进入创造模式  还有这个奇怪的指令/toggledownfall
Dialogue: 2,0:43:34.27,0:43:37.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Well, originally you only had to type game mode one
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.36,0:43:41.71,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,to go into creative and this weird command known as toggle downfall
Dialogue: 1,0:43:41.71,0:43:42.79,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,来让天下雨 
Dialogue: 2,0:43:41.71,0:43:42.79,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,to make it rain.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:42.93,0:43:46.31,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那些绝对是骨灰级的指令了  如果你还记得这些 
Dialogue: 2,0:43:42.93,0:43:46.31,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Those were definitely very old school commands and if you remember them,
Dialogue: 1,0:43:46.45,0:43:48.33,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是我的世界元老级玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:43:46.45,0:43:48.33,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:48.59,0:43:55.65,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我的世界在光照系统上的进步可谓巨大  如今我们有了这些  美轮美奂的灯笼
Dialogue: 2,0:43:48.59,0:43:52.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Minecraft has definitely come a long way in terms of lighting
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.56,0:43:55.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,as we have these really beautiful looking lanterns now and
Dialogue: 1,0:43:55.66,0:43:56.91,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我超爱这些灯笼
Dialogue: 2,0:43:55.66,0:43:56.91,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I love them a lot.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:57.07,0:44:04.01,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,话说回来  你们还记得以前村民用的  那些看起来特别简陋的灯吗
Dialogue: 2,0:43:57.07,0:44:00.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,With that said, do you guys remember back to a time
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.06,0:44:04.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,when villagers had these really budget looking lamps that were made
Dialogue: 1,0:44:04.01,0:44:06.63,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,用栅栏 羊毛和火把  拼凑出来的寒酸灯具？
Dialogue: 2,0:44:04.01,0:44:06.63,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,out of fences, wool and torches?
Dialogue: 1,0:44:06.81,0:44:07.75,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为我还记得 
Dialogue: 2,0:44:06.81,0:44:07.75,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Because I do.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:08.05,0:44:10.89,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我是说 确实能看出  他们想做个灯的样子
Dialogue: 2,0:44:08.05,0:44:10.89,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, yeah, I could see what they were going for to make a lamp.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:11.05,0:44:12.73,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我是说 那时候灯笼还没问世
Dialogue: 2,0:44:11.05,0:44:12.73,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, lanterns didn't exist back then,
Dialogue: 1,0:44:12.85,0:44:15.63,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但说实话那些灯确实不太美观
Dialogue: 2,0:44:12.85,0:44:15.63,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but they didn't look very good to be honest.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:15.79,0:44:17.19,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,该肯定的地方我绝不吝啬赞美 
Dialogue: 2,0:44:15.79,0:44:17.19,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I will give credit where it is due.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:17.33,0:44:19.59,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过在当时   那已经是最接近灯具的存在了 
Dialogue: 2,0:44:17.33,0:44:19.59,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, that was the closest you were going to get to a lamp,
Dialogue: 1,0:44:19.67,0:44:20.05,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,老实说 
Dialogue: 2,0:44:19.67,0:44:20.05,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,to be honest.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:20.13,0:44:21.23,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,好了 我们继续往下说
Dialogue: 2,0:44:20.13,0:44:21.23,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Anyways, moving on.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:21.37,0:44:24.11,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我可能是少数还记得这个特性的人之一
Dialogue: 2,0:44:21.37,0:44:24.11,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I might be one of the only ones who remembers this feature,
Dialogue: 1,0:44:24.23,0:44:29.35,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但你们还记得吗  沙漠群系里曾经遍布着这些小水洼？
Dialogue: 2,0:44:24.23,0:44:29.35,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but do you guys remember when desert biomes would have these little lakes inside of them?
Dialogue: 1,0:44:29.43,0:44:30.41,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我可记得清清楚楚 
Dialogue: 2,0:44:29.43,0:44:30.41,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Because I do.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:30.57,0:44:31.77,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,虽然不太符合常理  
Dialogue: 2,0:44:30.57,0:44:31.77,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It didn't really make sense,
Dialogue: 1,0:44:31.87,0:44:35.01,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但我总能在沙漠里发现成片的小水潭 
Dialogue: 2,0:44:31.87,0:44:35.01,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but I'd always find a bunch of little lakes inside the desert biome.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:35.11,0:44:38.51,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如今的我的世界沙漠几乎不见水源  
Dialogue: 2,0:44:35.11,0:44:38.51,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft today, a desert biome has virtually no water,
Dialogue: 1,0:44:38.69,0:44:41.49,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但在那时 这种小水塘随处可见 
Dialogue: 2,0:44:38.69,0:44:41.49,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but back then you'd find loads of these little lakes.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:41.67,0:44:49.11,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得骷髅曾经那惨不忍睹的箭术吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:44:41.67,0:44:44.37,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Oh my God, do you guys remember back to a time
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.37,0:44:49.11,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,when skeletons had absolutely terrible aim with their bow and arrow?
Dialogue: 1,0:44:49.27,0:44:50.19,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我可是记忆犹新 
Dialogue: 2,0:44:49.27,0:44:50.19,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Because I do.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:50.39,0:44:52.27,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说真的 你们看看  
Dialogue: 2,0:44:50.39,0:44:52.27,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, seriously, look at this.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:52.29,0:44:56.23,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这骷髅90%的箭都射得离我十万八千里
Dialogue: 2,0:44:52.29,0:44:56.23,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,About 90% of this skeleton's arrows aren't going anywhere near me.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:56.35,0:44:59.01,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,他的准头嘛...实在不怎么样
Dialogue: 2,0:44:56.35,0:44:59.01,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,His aim is, uh, it's not so great.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:59.13,0:45:02.39,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,现在的骷髅射手简直离谱到极点
Dialogue: 2,0:44:59.13,0:45:02.39,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, skeletons in Minecraft today are absolutely ridiculous.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:02.61,0:45:03.83,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们简直自带自瞄外挂
Dialogue: 2,0:45:02.61,0:45:03.83,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,They pretty much have aimbot,
Dialogue: 1,0:45:03.91,0:45:04.85,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说实话 但 呃 
Dialogue: 2,0:45:03.91,0:45:04.85,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,to be honest, but, uh,
Dialogue: 1,0:45:05.19,0:45:07.23,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,alpha和beta时期的骷髅们
Dialogue: 2,0:45:05.19,0:45:07.23,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,skeletons back in the alpha and beta days,
Dialogue: 1,0:45:07.39,0:45:08.61,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们的箭术可差远了
Dialogue: 2,0:45:07.39,0:45:08.61,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they weren't very good.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:08.69,0:45:16.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我是那种在我的世界里  特别喜欢驯养一群狼的玩家  给每只狼都戴上不同的命名牌 不同颜色的项圈
Dialogue: 2,0:45:08.69,0:45:12.59,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm one of those people in Minecraft who love to tame a bunch of wolves
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.59,0:45:16.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and give them different name tags and different collar colors.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:16.27,0:45:18.99,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过 在我的世界早期版本里
Dialogue: 2,0:45:16.27,0:45:18.99,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:45:19.31,0:45:22.53,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那时候既不能给项圈染色  也没法用命名牌
Dialogue: 2,0:45:19.31,0:45:22.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you couldn't have different collar colors or name tags,
Dialogue: 1,0:45:22.57,0:45:26.93,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这意味着你驯养的所有狼  都只能戴着千篇一律的红色项圈
Dialogue: 2,0:45:22.57,0:45:26.93,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which meant you would have a bunch of tamed wolves that would all have a red collar.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:27.09,0:45:29.03,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我相信在座很多人都记得这场景
Dialogue: 2,0:45:27.09,0:45:29.03,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure a lot of you remember this.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:29.21,0:45:35.55,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你们还记得  射箭时的旧音效  以及箭矢落地时的声响
Dialogue: 2,0:45:29.21,0:45:35.55,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you guys remember the old sounds for when you shot a bow and when an arrow landed somewhere,
Dialogue: 1,0:45:35.71,0:45:37.67,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是我的世界元老级玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:45:35.71,0:45:37.67,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:37.85,0:45:38.59,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,听听看
Dialogue: 2,0:45:37.85,0:45:38.59,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Take a listen.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:44.72,0:45:46.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界的早期版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:45:44.72,0:45:46.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:45:47.28,0:45:51.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玩家们即使血条全满  也能继续吃东西
Dialogue: 2,0:45:47.28,0:45:51.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,players were able to eat food even if their health bar was full.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:51.50,0:45:53.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这可是个捉弄朋友的绝妙法子 
Dialogue: 2,0:45:51.50,0:45:53.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This was a funny way to troll your friends,
Dialogue: 1,0:45:53.48,0:45:59.25,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为他们可能急需食物充饥  而你却能在对方面前大快朵颐  顺便炫耀自己满血状态
Dialogue: 2,0:45:53.48,0:45:56.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,as they could be in need of food and you could just eat it right
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.48,0:45:59.25,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in front of them while flexing that your health was full.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:59.26,0:46:00.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我当年可真是个混球
Dialogue: 2,0:45:59.26,0:46:00.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I was the worst man.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:00.74,0:46:01.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,好了 我们继续往下看
Dialogue: 2,0:46:00.74,0:46:01.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Anyways, moving on.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:01.70,0:46:04.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果玩家生成床之类的物品
Dialogue: 2,0:46:01.70,0:46:04.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If players spawned in items such as beds,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:04.18,0:46:05.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,门和甘蔗这类物品
Dialogue: 2,0:46:04.18,0:46:05.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,doors, and sugar cane,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:05.38,0:46:07.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们在物品栏里的模样会变得非常诡异
Dialogue: 2,0:46:05.38,0:46:07.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they would look really weird in the inventory.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:08.20,0:46:10.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不是吧 这玩意儿也能叫门？
Dialogue: 2,0:46:08.20,0:46:10.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, come on, is this supposed to be a door?
Dialogue: 1,0:46:10.62,0:46:11.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这到底是个啥玩意儿？
Dialogue: 2,0:46:10.62,0:46:11.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,What even is this man?
Dialogue: 1,0:46:12.16,0:46:13.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但更离谱的还在后头
Dialogue: 2,0:46:12.16,0:46:13.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But it gets even worse,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:13.62,0:46:16.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为在当年  如果你放置这些生成的门
Dialogue: 2,0:46:13.62,0:46:16.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,as back in the day, if you placed these spawned-in doors,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:16.44,0:46:18.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它只会放置半扇门
Dialogue: 2,0:46:16.44,0:46:18.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it would only place half the door.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:18.42,0:46:19.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,啊？认真的吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:46:18.42,0:46:19.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Like, what?
Dialogue: 1,0:46:19.56,0:46:20.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,床也是同样的状况
Dialogue: 2,0:46:19.56,0:46:20.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Same with the bed.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:20.76,0:46:22.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你放置生成出来的床
Dialogue: 2,0:46:20.76,0:46:22.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you placed the spawned-in variant,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:22.62,0:46:24.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它只会放置半边
Dialogue: 2,0:46:22.62,0:46:24.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it would only place half of it,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:24.16,0:46:25.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,完全就是个摆设
Dialogue: 2,0:46:24.16,0:46:25.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,making it just useless.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:25.72,0:46:27.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,谁会在这种床上睡觉啊？
Dialogue: 2,0:46:25.72,0:46:27.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, who's gonna sleep on a bed that looks like this?
Dialogue: 1,0:46:28.06,0:46:29.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我都不知道该说啥了
Dialogue: 2,0:46:28.06,0:46:29.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I don't even know what else to say man,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:29.72,0:46:30.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但如果你还记得这些
Dialogue: 2,0:46:29.72,0:46:30.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but if you remember these,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:30.72,0:46:32.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是骨灰级老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:46:30.72,0:46:32.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you're definitely a veteran player.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:33.24,0:46:35.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我的世界里的日落美得令人窒息
Dialogue: 2,0:46:33.24,0:46:35.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Sunsets in Minecraft are just beautiful.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:36.20,0:46:37.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你看那天际线多美啊
Dialogue: 2,0:46:36.20,0:46:37.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, just look at that sky.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:38.12,0:46:41.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过如果你玩过Alpha版本
Dialogue: 2,0:46:38.12,0:46:41.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, if you played Minecraft in the alpha days,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:41.10,0:46:46.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,应该记得那时候日出日落时天空不会变色
Dialogue: 2,0:46:41.10,0:46:46.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you might remember when the sky didn't change color when the sun would rise and set.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:46.76,0:46:48.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,现在看简直诡异到爆
Dialogue: 2,0:46:46.76,0:46:48.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It looks so weird man,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:48.10,0:46:49.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这画面在我脑海里挥之不去
Dialogue: 2,0:46:48.10,0:46:49.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I just can't unsee it.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:49.66,0:46:51.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,老版的钻石材质
Dialogue: 2,0:46:49.66,0:46:51.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The old texture for diamonds.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:52.24,0:46:55.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,其实钻石纹理改版也没多久
Dialogue: 2,0:46:52.24,0:46:55.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now, the diamond texture wasn't even changed that long ago,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:55.20,0:46:56.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但每次看到旧版钻石
Dialogue: 2,0:46:55.20,0:46:56.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but when I look at the old diamonds,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:56.90,0:46:58.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,回忆就止不住涌上来
Dialogue: 2,0:46:56.90,0:46:58.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I get so nostalgic man.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:58.82,0:47:03.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,想起Beta时期第一次挖到钻石的狂喜
Dialogue: 2,0:46:58.82,0:47:03.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, I think back to when I first found diamonds in the beta days and how happy I was.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:03.92,0:47:08.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以说啊 最初的钻石纹理才是我心中永恒的经典
Dialogue: 2,0:47:03.92,0:47:08.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, the original diamond texture will always be the diamonds I know and love.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:08.40,0:47:11.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界携带版的早期岁月里
Dialogue: 2,0:47:08.40,0:47:11.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft Pocket Edition,
Dialogue: 1,0:47:11.54,0:47:15.22,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,游戏里曾有个叫下界反应核的方块
Dialogue: 2,0:47:11.54,0:47:15.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a block known as the Nether Reactor Core was in the game.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:15.44,0:47:23.57,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,下界反应堆是玩家搭建的装置  激活后会生成一座  完全由下界合金（更正：地狱砖）构成的巨型塔楼
Dialogue: 2,0:47:15.44,0:47:18.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So the Nether Reactor was a player-built structure
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.16,0:47:23.57,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that when activated would spawn a giant tower that was entirely made of netherite.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:23.60,0:47:24.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在这座建筑内部
Dialogue: 2,0:47:23.60,0:47:24.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Inside said structure,
Dialogue: 1,0:47:25.12,0:47:28.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你能找到诸如荧石粉等  与下界相关的方块
Dialogue: 2,0:47:25.12,0:47:28.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you would find nether-related blocks such as glowstone dust,
Dialogue: 1,0:47:28.52,0:47:29.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,下界石英等  与下界相关的物品
Dialogue: 2,0:47:28.52,0:47:29.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,nether quartz and more.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:29.98,0:47:35.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,僵尸猪人也会生成  并自动对玩家产生敌意
Dialogue: 2,0:47:29.98,0:47:35.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Zombie pigmen would also spawn and automatically become hostile towards the player.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:35.44,0:47:43.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,由于当时无法实装真正的地狱维度  下界反应核本质上  充当了替代品
Dialogue: 2,0:47:35.44,0:47:39.47,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The Nether Reactor essentially acted as a substitute for the real
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.47,0:47:43.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Nether Dimension due to it not being able to be added into Pocket Edition.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:43.68,0:47:46.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但如果你还记得下界反应核的话 
Dialogue: 2,0:47:43.68,0:47:46.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But yeah, if you remember the Nether Reactor Core,
Dialogue: 1,0:47:46.24,0:47:48.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你就是我的世界的老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:47:46.24,0:47:48.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:48.60,0:47:52.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,接下来是我的世界Beta 1.8版本的发布
Dialogue: 2,0:47:48.60,0:47:52.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Next up, we have the release of Minecraft Beta 1.8.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:52.86,0:47:57.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,各位我的世界老玩家  肯定对这个更新记忆犹新  因为它的改动堪称史诗级
Dialogue: 2,0:47:52.86,0:47:57.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now, I know a lot of you Minecraft veterans will remember this update because it was massive.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:58.10,0:48:00.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,Beta 1.8版本新增了疾跑功能
Dialogue: 2,0:47:58.10,0:48:00.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Beta 1.8 added sprinting,
Dialogue: 1,0:48:00.24,0:48:01.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,饥饿值系统  更多食物种类
Dialogue: 2,0:48:00.24,0:48:01.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the hunger bar, more food,
Dialogue: 1,0:48:02.12,0:48:03.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,新的地形生成系统
Dialogue: 2,0:48:02.12,0:48:03.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,new world generation,
Dialogue: 1,0:48:03.52,0:48:05.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,村民  废弃矿井
Dialogue: 2,0:48:03.52,0:48:05.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,villagers, mineshafts,
Dialogue: 1,0:48:05.12,0:48:07.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,要塞  以及海量内容
Dialogue: 2,0:48:05.12,0:48:07.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,strongholds and so much more.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:07.54,0:48:12.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,Beta 1.8堪称彻底改变我的世界游戏生态的里程碑式更新
Dialogue: 2,0:48:07.54,0:48:12.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Beta 1.8 was just that one Minecraft update that completely changed Minecraft forever,
Dialogue: 1,0:48:13.16,0:48:15.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得切石机吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:48:13.16,0:48:15.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember the stonecutter?
Dialogue: 1,0:48:15.72,0:48:17.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不 不是那个切石机
Dialogue: 2,0:48:15.72,0:48:17.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,No, not that stonecutter,
Dialogue: 1,0:48:17.12,0:48:19.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我说的是  手机版最初那个切石机
Dialogue: 2,0:48:17.12,0:48:19.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about the OG one from Pocket Edition.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:19.96,0:48:26.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这款切石机曾是制作石质方块的必备工具  毕竟在当时的手机版里
Dialogue: 2,0:48:19.96,0:48:23.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This stonecutter was essential if you wanted to craft
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.26,0:48:26.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,stone-related blocks as in Pocket Edition at the time,
Dialogue: 1,0:48:26.52,0:48:29.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你无法在工作台上  直接合成石质方块
Dialogue: 2,0:48:26.52,0:48:29.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you were not able to craft stone blocks in a crafting table.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:29.86,0:48:32.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但如果你还记得这个版本的切石机
Dialogue: 2,0:48:29.86,0:48:32.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But yeah, if you remember this version of the stonecutter,
Dialogue: 1,0:48:32.60,0:48:34.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对称得上是  骨灰级老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:48:32.60,0:48:34.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you're definitely a veteran player.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:34.88,0:48:40.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你曾是那些在1.6版本  快照阶段就玩到我的世界的玩家
Dialogue: 2,0:48:34.88,0:48:37.79,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you were one of those players who got to play Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.79,0:48:40.39,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in the snapshot phase for the 1.6 update,
Dialogue: 1,0:48:40.56,0:48:44.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你可能还记得  马铠曾经是有合成配方的
Dialogue: 2,0:48:40.56,0:48:44.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you might remember when horse armor had a crafting recipe.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:44.74,0:48:49.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 比如钻石马铠  可以用六颗钻石和一块羊毛来合成
Dialogue: 2,0:48:44.74,0:48:49.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, diamond horse armor for example could be crafted with six diamonds and one wool.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:50.18,0:48:52.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过随着1.6版本正式发布后
Dialogue: 2,0:48:50.18,0:48:52.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But yeah, when 1.6 was fully released,
Dialogue: 1,0:48:52.56,0:48:54.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,马铠的合成配方就被移除了
Dialogue: 2,0:48:52.56,0:48:54.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the horse armor crafting recipes were removed.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:55.04,0:48:57.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但老兄 如果你还记得这些合成配方
Dialogue: 2,0:48:55.04,0:48:57.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But man, if you remember these crafting recipes,
Dialogue: 1,0:48:57.50,0:48:59.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你可真是个  怀旧派的老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:48:57.50,0:48:59.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you're just an old school player,
Dialogue: 1,0:48:59.18,0:49:00.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,无话可说
Dialogue: 2,0:48:59.18,0:49:00.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,there's nothing more to say.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:00.82,0:49:01.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玫瑰 
Dialogue: 2,0:49:00.82,0:49:01.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The rose.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:01.64,0:49:02.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我怀念玫瑰 
Dialogue: 2,0:49:01.64,0:49:02.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I miss the rose.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:02.76,0:49:06.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我在频道里提到玫瑰太多次  现在这都快成梗了
Dialogue: 2,0:49:02.76,0:49:04.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I have mentioned the rose so many times
Dialogue: 1,0:49:07.08,0:49:08.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我实在太想念它了
Dialogue: 2,0:49:07.08,0:49:08.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I just miss it so much,
Dialogue: 1,0:49:08.98,0:49:10.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我喜欢虞美人 别误会
Dialogue: 2,0:49:08.98,0:49:10.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I like the poppy, don't get me wrong,
Dialogue: 1,0:49:10.72,0:49:14.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但为什么玫瑰和虞美人  就不能共存呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:49:10.72,0:49:14.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but why can't the rose and poppy just coexist with each other?
Dialogue: 1,0:49:14.40,0:49:16.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,安息吧玫瑰 我们永远怀念你
Dialogue: 2,0:49:14.40,0:49:16.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Rest in peace rose, you will be missed.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:16.10,0:49:20.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说到玫瑰 如果你玩过  我的世界的携带版 
Dialogue: 2,0:49:16.10,0:49:20.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Speaking of roses, if you played the Pocket Edition version of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:49:20.42,0:49:23.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你一定记得那朵蓝玫瑰
Dialogue: 2,0:49:20.42,0:49:23.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you will definitely remember the blue rose.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:23.48,0:49:27.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这朵蓝玫瑰原本应该是普通的红玫瑰
Dialogue: 2,0:49:23.48,0:49:27.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now this blue rose was supposed to be a regular red rose,
Dialogue: 1,0:49:27.16,0:49:29.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但由于当时的硬件问题
Dialogue: 2,0:49:27.16,0:49:29.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but due to hardware problems at the time,
Dialogue: 1,0:49:29.16,0:49:31.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玫瑰不知为何被迫变成了蓝色
Dialogue: 2,0:49:29.16,0:49:31.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the rose had to be blue for some reason.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:31.68,0:49:33.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,是啊 我也搞不懂为啥
Dialogue: 2,0:49:31.68,0:49:33.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't really get it either,
Dialogue: 1,0:49:33.28,0:49:34.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但如果你还记得这朵蓝色小花
Dialogue: 2,0:49:33.28,0:49:34.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but if you remember this blue flower,
Dialogue: 1,0:49:35.08,0:49:37.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是个老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:49:35.08,0:49:37.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you're definitely a veteran player.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:37.64,0:49:45.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我的世界携带版老玩家可能还记得  另一个经典是可以通过睡觉来恢复生命值
Dialogue: 2,0:49:37.64,0:49:40.87,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Another feature in Minecraft Pocket Edition that veterans
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.87,0:49:45.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,might remember was the ability to restore your health by sleeping.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:45.40,0:49:48.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 在携带版的Alpha测试阶段
Dialogue: 2,0:49:45.40,0:49:48.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, in the alpha versions of Pocket Edition,
Dialogue: 1,0:49:48.52,0:49:52.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玩家躺在床上睡觉就能恢复生命值
Dialogue: 2,0:49:48.52,0:49:52.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,players could regenerate their health by sleeping in a bed,
Dialogue: 1,0:49:52.40,0:49:54.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个设定在我看来可是相当独特的
Dialogue: 2,0:49:52.40,0:49:54.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which was quite a unique feature if you ask me.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:54.96,0:49:56.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过嘛 如果你还记得这个 
Dialogue: 2,0:49:54.96,0:49:56.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But yeah, if you remember this,
Dialogue: 1,0:49:56.42,0:49:57.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那可得告诉我一声
Dialogue: 2,0:49:56.42,0:49:57.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then let me know.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:57.56,0:49:59.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你在2011年玩过Minecraft
Dialogue: 2,0:49:57.56,0:49:59.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you played Minecraft in 2011,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:00.04,0:50:02.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你一定记得天境模组
Dialogue: 2,0:50:00.04,0:50:02.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you will definitely remember the Aether mod.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:02.88,0:50:06.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,天境模组本质上新增了一个名为“天境”的维度
Dialogue: 2,0:50:02.88,0:50:06.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now the Aether mod essentially added a new dimension called the Aether,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:07.06,0:50:10.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个维度被描述为与下界相对应的对立位面
Dialogue: 2,0:50:07.06,0:50:10.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which was described as being the opposite counterpart to the Nether.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:10.92,0:50:15.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,进入这个维度的唯一方式  就是搭建标志性的萤石传送门
Dialogue: 2,0:50:10.92,0:50:15.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The only way to get to the dimension was by creating this iconic glowstone portal,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:15.96,0:50:18.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,相信在座各位对这个传送门都不陌生
Dialogue: 2,0:50:15.96,0:50:18.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which I'm sure a lot of you are familiar with.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:18.66,0:50:25.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个萤石传送门实在太经典了  以至于无数玩家都尝试在原版游戏中激活它
Dialogue: 2,0:50:18.66,0:50:22.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This glowstone portal became so popular that many players
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.76,0:50:25.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,tried to activate the portal in vanilla Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:25.42,0:50:27.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,结果发现根本激活不了 让人大失所望
Dialogue: 2,0:50:25.42,0:50:27.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,only to be saddened that it didn't work.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:28.08,0:50:29.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,好吧 大伙儿老实说
Dialogue: 2,0:50:28.08,0:50:29.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Okay guys, be honest,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:29.20,0:50:32.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你是不是也试过在原版游戏里搭萤石传送门？
Dialogue: 2,0:50:29.20,0:50:32.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,were you one of those players that tried to make a glowstone portal in vanilla?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:32.68,0:50:33.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,哎呀 咱们都是自己人  
Dialogue: 2,0:50:32.68,0:50:33.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're all friends here,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:33.74,0:50:34.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,实话实说嘛  
Dialogue: 2,0:50:33.74,0:50:34.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,we can be honest with each other,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:34.70,0:50:35.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我保证不笑话你  
Dialogue: 2,0:50:34.70,0:50:35.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I won't judge you.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:35.56,0:50:36.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,好吧 可能会稍微笑话一下  
Dialogue: 2,0:50:35.56,0:50:36.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe I'll judge you a little bit,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:36.92,0:50:37.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但你知道的  
Dialogue: 2,0:50:36.92,0:50:37.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but you know.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:37.98,0:50:39.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,言归正传  
Dialogue: 2,0:50:37.98,0:50:39.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Anyways, moving on.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:39.24,0:50:41.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说到原版我的世界宣传片  
Dialogue: 2,0:50:39.24,0:50:41.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The original Minecraft trailer.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:41.66,0:50:43.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,2011年12月6日发布的  
Dialogue: 2,0:50:41.66,0:50:43.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Released on December 6th,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:43.16,0:50:49.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,原版宣传片现在播放量超过1.5亿  
Dialogue: 2,0:50:43.16,0:50:49.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,2011, the original trailer for Minecraft now has over 150 million views and man,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:49.34,0:50:50.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,每次重温这个宣传片时
Dialogue: 2,0:50:49.34,0:50:50.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,every time I go back and watch it,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:51.00,0:50:52.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,真是让人怀念到不行
Dialogue: 2,0:50:51.00,0:50:52.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I get so much nostalgia.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:53.00,0:50:55.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当箱子最初在开发版本中加入时
Dialogue: 2,0:50:53.00,0:50:55.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,When the chest was first added in in-dev,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:55.54,0:50:56.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当时你根本没法合成它
Dialogue: 2,0:50:55.54,0:50:56.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you couldn't craft it.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:57.08,0:51:02.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你唯一能找到的箱子  就是创建世界时  出生点建筑里自带的那些
Dialogue: 2,0:50:57.08,0:51:00.07,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The only chests you'd find were the ones in the structure
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.07,0:51:02.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'd spawn in when you created the world.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:02.68,0:51:08.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,此外 这些箱子里会装着  当时我的世界已加入的所有方块和物品
Dialogue: 2,0:51:02.68,0:51:05.49,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Additionally, these chests would contain every block 
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.49,0:51:08.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and item that was added into Minecraft at the time.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:08.84,0:51:10.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界的早期岁月里
Dialogue: 2,0:51:08.84,0:51:10.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:51:11.12,0:51:12.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Alpha和Beta版本时期
Dialogue: 2,0:51:11.12,0:51:12.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in the alpha and beta days,
Dialogue: 1,0:51:12.96,0:51:15.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玩家们可以把火把插在箱子上
Dialogue: 2,0:51:12.96,0:51:15.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,players were able to place torches on chests.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:16.14,0:51:20.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,具体操作方法是  把火把放在紧邻箱子的玻璃方块上
Dialogue: 2,0:51:16.14,0:51:20.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This was done by placing a torch on a glass block that's next to a chest.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:20.86,0:51:28.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你也可以通过在泥土和箱子之间的空气方块上放置火把 将火把放在箱子顶部
Dialogue: 2,0:51:20.86,0:51:24.77,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You could also place a torch on top of the chest by putting the torch
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.77,0:51:28.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,on an air block that is between the dirt and the chest itself.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:28.72,0:51:31.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界Alpha和Beta早期阶段
Dialogue: 2,0:51:28.72,0:51:31.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,During Minecraft alpha and the early stages of beta,
Dialogue: 1,0:51:32.22,0:51:36.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玩家可以制作出这种样子的三连箱
Dialogue: 2,0:51:32.22,0:51:36.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,players were able to create a triple chest that looked like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:36.38,0:51:38.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,要制作这种三连箱
Dialogue: 2,0:51:36.38,0:51:38.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,To create said triple chest,
Dialogue: 1,0:51:38.26,0:51:43.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玩家需要先做出一个双箱  然后在雪层上连接第三个箱子
Dialogue: 2,0:51:38.26,0:51:43.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the player had to make a double chest and then connect the third chest on a snow layer,
Dialogue: 1,0:51:43.22,0:51:46.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这样就能做出这个造型怪异的三连箱
Dialogue: 2,0:51:43.22,0:51:46.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which would then make this weird looking triple chest.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:46.20,0:51:49.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,值得注意的是 这个三连箱完全可用
Dialogue: 2,0:51:46.20,0:51:49.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It's worth noting that the triple chest was fully functional,
Dialogue: 1,0:51:49.74,0:51:55.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,拥有81个物品槽位  而双箱只有54个物品槽位
Dialogue: 2,0:51:49.74,0:51:55.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,containing 81 item slots while the double chest contained only 54 item slots.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:55.40,0:51:57.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,虽然箱子界面看起来一团糟
Dialogue: 2,0:51:55.40,0:51:57.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Sure, the chest UI was all messed up looking,
Dialogue: 1,0:51:58.06,0:52:00.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但毕竟 这可是个三连箱啊
Dialogue: 2,0:51:58.06,0:52:00.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but you know, it was still a triple chest.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:00.18,0:52:02.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Minecraft的早期岁月里
Dialogue: 2,0:52:00.18,0:52:02.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:52:02.10,0:52:09.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当时放置单个箱子时  箱子总是默认朝西方向  而不会朝向玩家放置时的朝向
Dialogue: 2,0:52:02.10,0:52:04.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the single chest when placed would always 
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.98,0:52:09.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,face in the west direction rather than facing the direction of the player.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:09.70,0:52:16.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当时玩家唯一能解决这个问题的方法  就是制作一个双箱  或者把单箱贴着某个方块放置
Dialogue: 2,0:52:09.70,0:52:12.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The only way players could fix this back in the day
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.34,0:52:16.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,was by creating a double chest or placing the single chest against a wall.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:17.06,0:52:20.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我们这些我的世界老玩家当年可真是够呛
Dialogue: 2,0:52:17.06,0:52:20.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, us Minecraft boomers had it rough back in the day,
Dialogue: 1,0:52:20.84,0:52:22.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当你破坏我的世界中的箱子时
Dialogue: 2,0:52:20.84,0:52:22.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,When you break a chest in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:52:22.98,0:52:26.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它会出现那个我们熟悉又喜爱的碎裂动画
Dialogue: 2,0:52:22.98,0:52:26.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it has this familiar cracking animation that we know and love.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:26.98,0:52:28.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,然而在Beta 1.8版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:52:26.98,0:52:28.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, in beta 1.8,
Dialogue: 1,0:52:29.10,0:52:33.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Beta 1.8版本更新后  箱子被破坏时不再显示碎裂动画
Dialogue: 2,0:52:29.10,0:52:33.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a change was made to where chests would no longer show the breaking animation.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:33.48,0:52:43.29,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个动画效果的缺失  从那时起一直持续到1.7版本  直到1.8版本才被重新加入游戏
Dialogue: 2,0:52:33.48,0:52:36.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now, this removal of the animation remained in the game
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.78,0:52:43.29,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,all the way up to version 1.7 until it was finally re-added again in version 1.8.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:43.32,0:52:45.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,他们最初为何决定移除这个动画 
Dialogue: 2,0:52:43.32,0:52:45.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Why they decided to remove this in the first place,
Dialogue: 1,0:52:45.56,0:52:46.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我永远也想不明白
Dialogue: 2,0:52:45.56,0:52:46.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'll never know.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:46.34,0:52:48.22,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Minecraft的早期版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:52:46.34,0:52:48.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:52:48.52,0:52:51.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,从开发版本一直到Beta 1.7期间
Dialogue: 2,0:52:48.52,0:52:51.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,from version in dev all the way up to beta 1.7,
Dialogue: 1,0:52:51.96,0:52:54.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,箱子曾经是一个完整方块
Dialogue: 2,0:52:51.96,0:52:54.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the chest used to be a full block,
Dialogue: 1,0:52:54.10,0:52:57.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这使得它们能完美融入你的建筑之中
Dialogue: 2,0:52:54.10,0:52:57.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which made them blend in rather nicely in your base.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:57.34,0:52:59.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,然而在Beta 1.8版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:52:57.34,0:52:59.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, in beta 1.8,
Dialogue: 1,0:52:59.38,0:53:05.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,箱子迎来了重大改动  最先的变化是  它的外观尺寸明显缩小了
Dialogue: 2,0:52:59.38,0:53:02.59,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,some major changes were made to the chest with the first change
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.59,0:53:05.17,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,being that the chest was made to look a lot smaller.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:05.50,0:53:10.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,Beta 1.8版本中的箱子  还新增了那个熟悉的开合动画
Dialogue: 2,0:53:05.50,0:53:10.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Chests in beta 1.8 also received its familiar open and closing animation,
Dialogue: 1,0:53:10.32,0:53:12.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但当时还没有专属的音效
Dialogue: 2,0:53:10.32,0:53:12.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but it didn't have its own unique sounds yet.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:13.04,0:53:18.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这意味着当时的箱子  在开关时会使用旧版门的音效
Dialogue: 2,0:53:13.04,0:53:18.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This meant the chest at the time used to use the old door sound when you opened and closed it.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:18.62,0:53:19.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,听听看
Dialogue: 2,0:53:18.62,0:53:19.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Take a listen.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:27.31,0:53:30.11,MC-CN,,0,0,0,, 这些老音效太让人怀念了
Dialogue: 2,0:53:27.31,0:53:30.11,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, these old sounds are so nostalgic,
Dialogue: 1,0:53:30.65,0:53:31.57,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我都要哭出来了
Dialogue: 2,0:53:30.65,0:53:31.57,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I could cry.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:31.57,0:53:38.21,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,Beta 1.8版本中箱子还有个奇怪之处  就是玩家手持箱子的姿势非常诡异
Dialogue: 2,0:53:31.57,0:53:35.15,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Another weird thing about chests in beta 1.8
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.15,0:53:38.21,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,is that the player held the chest in a very strange way.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:38.45,0:53:43.09,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,可以看到 手持箱子时  它的展示角度与其他方块截然不同
Dialogue: 2,0:53:38.45,0:53:43.09,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,As you can see, the chest when held was shown at a different angle to other blocks,
Dialogue: 1,0:53:43.19,0:53:44.53,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这看起来相当怪异
Dialogue: 2,0:53:43.19,0:53:44.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which looked really weird.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:44.85,0:53:46.51,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,此外 在第三人称视角下 
Dialogue: 2,0:53:44.85,0:53:46.51,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Additionally, in third person,
Dialogue: 1,0:53:46.71,0:53:49.29,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,手持箱子时甚至没有正确的持握动作
Dialogue: 2,0:53:46.71,0:53:49.29,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the chest when held wasn't even being held properly.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:49.45,0:53:50.97,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你看看这姿势
Dialogue: 2,0:53:49.45,0:53:50.97,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, just look at this.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:51.15,0:53:54.09,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不仅如此 当箱子被扔到地上时
Dialogue: 2,0:53:51.15,0:53:54.09,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,On top of this, when the chest was thrown on the floor,
Dialogue: 1,0:53:54.21,0:53:56.67,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,箱子落地的旋转方式也极其诡异
Dialogue: 2,0:53:54.21,0:53:56.67,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it rotated in a really odd way.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:56.79,0:54:03.55,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这是因为箱子是绕着一个角旋转  而不像其他方块那样以中心为轴转动
Dialogue: 2,0:53:56.79,0:54:00.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This was because it rotated around one of
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.16,0:54:03.55,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,its corners instead of rotating in the centre like other blocks.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:03.73,0:54:05.95,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,2011年愚人节当天
Dialogue: 2,0:54:03.73,0:54:05.95,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,On April Fool's Day in 2011,
Dialogue: 1,0:54:06.27,0:54:12.29,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,Mojang在Beta 1.4版本中加入了一种独特的箱子  被称为“上锁的箱子”
Dialogue: 2,0:54:06.27,0:54:12.29,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Mojang added a unique chest in version beta 1.4 that was known as the locked chest.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:12.59,0:54:19.19,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这种箱子会在每个新生成的区块中  随机位置自然生成  
Dialogue: 2,0:54:12.59,0:54:16.31,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This chest would naturally generate in a random location
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.31,0:54:19.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,within each new chunk of your world and the chest couldn't be
Dialogue: 1,0:54:19.19,0:54:22.07,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,任何方式都无法破坏它  除了用爆炸
Dialogue: 2,0:54:19.19,0:54:22.07,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,broken by anything apart from explosions.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:22.53,0:54:24.63,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你试图打开这个上锁的箱子
Dialogue: 2,0:54:22.53,0:54:24.63,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you tried to open the locked chest,
Dialogue: 1,0:54:24.79,0:54:32.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,屏幕上会显示提示信息  告诉你需要史蒂夫公司补给箱钥匙才能开启  并声称可以在我的世界商店购买
Dialogue: 2,0:54:24.79,0:54:27.21,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a message would appear stating that you needed a
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.21,0:54:32.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,SteveCoSupplyCrate key to open it and that you could purchase one at the Minecraft store.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:32.63,0:54:38.85,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,点击“前往商店”按钮会将玩家跳转到我的世界 官网的愚人节恶搞页面
Dialogue: 2,0:54:32.63,0:54:35.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Clicking the go to store button would bring the player
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.60,0:54:38.85,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,to an April Fool's shop page on the Minecraft website,
Dialogue: 1,0:54:39.01,0:54:42.79,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,页面允许你将所有这些恶搞商品加入购物车
Dialogue: 2,0:54:39.01,0:54:42.79,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which then allowed you to add all these fake items to a cart.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:42.99,0:54:45.85,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说实话 爬行者鞍具听起来还挺酷的
Dialogue: 2,0:54:42.99,0:54:45.85,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna lie, a creeper saddle sounds kinda cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:45.97,0:54:53.93,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以这个Beta 1.4版本中自然生成的上锁箱子  最终演变成了大型愚人节恶作剧 深受玩家喜爱  
Dialogue: 2,0:54:45.97,0:54:49.91,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, this naturally generated locked chest in beta 1.4
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.91,0:54:53.93,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,developed into this huge April Fool's prank and players loved it.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:54.29,0:54:57.75,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Alpha和Beta版本时期  当箱子还是完整方块形态时
Dialogue: 2,0:54:54.29,0:54:57.75,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,When chests were a full block in the alpha and beta days,
Dialogue: 1,0:54:57.87,0:55:01.85,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,大箱子的纹理中间  有一条贯穿的竖线
Dialogue: 2,0:54:57.87,0:55:01.85,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the large chest had a line going down the middle of its texture.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:02.11,0:55:07.85,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在如今的我的世界中  这条中线已经消失不见  
Dialogue: 2,0:55:02.11,0:55:07.85,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft today, this line is nowhere to be seen and I'm glad because it looked a bit weird.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:07.97,0:55:09.73,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界的早期版本中 
Dialogue: 2,0:55:07.97,0:55:09.73,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:55:10.07,0:55:12.29,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,从Alpha版本到Beta 1.4版本期间
Dialogue: 2,0:55:10.07,0:55:12.29,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,from alpha to beta 1.4,
Dialogue: 1,0:55:12.45,0:55:16.63,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玩家无法通过Shift键快速将物品放入箱子
Dialogue: 2,0:55:12.45,0:55:16.63,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,players were not able to shift click their items into the chest.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:16.91,0:55:19.45,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这痛苦我可太熟悉了
Dialogue: 2,0:55:16.91,0:55:19.45,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Oh, a pain I remember all too well.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:19.45,0:55:25.07,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 我们这些老玩家当年  只能像苦力一样手动拖拽物品进箱子
Dialogue: 2,0:55:19.45,0:55:22.13,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, us veterans had to painfully
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.13,0:55:25.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,drag our items into the chest like a bunch of peasants.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:25.21,0:55:26.55,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那时候真是太逊了
Dialogue: 2,0:55:25.21,0:55:26.55,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It was so lame man.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:26.69,0:55:28.23,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但在Beta 1.5版本更新后
Dialogue: 2,0:55:26.69,0:55:28.23,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But then in beta 1.5,
Dialogue: 1,0:55:28.37,0:55:29.61,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,终于加入了Shift键快速放入功能
Dialogue: 2,0:55:28.37,0:55:29.61,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,shift clicking was added.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:29.83,0:55:30.61,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过嘛   只能算半成品功能
Dialogue: 2,0:55:29.83,0:55:30.61,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Well, sort of.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:30.67,0:55:32.29,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个功能是经过多年逐步完善的
Dialogue: 2,0:55:30.67,0:55:32.29,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The feature kinda developed over the years.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:32.41,0:55:38.87,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我之前提到的Beta 1.4版本中的上锁箱子很有趣  因为当你放置它时
Dialogue: 2,0:55:32.41,0:55:38.87,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The locked chest I mentioned earlier in beta 1.4 was very interesting because when it was placed,
Dialogue: 1,0:55:39.01,0:55:41.17,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它会发出15级的亮度
Dialogue: 2,0:55:39.01,0:55:41.17,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it emitted a light level of 15,
Dialogue: 1,0:55:41.55,0:55:43.77,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,其亮度比火把还要高出一级
Dialogue: 2,0:55:41.55,0:55:43.77,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which was one level lighter than a torch.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:44.15,0:55:50.79,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这些箱子之所以会发光  很可能是为了愚人节活动时  让玩家在夜晚更容易发现它们
Dialogue: 2,0:55:44.15,0:55:47.19,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,These chests likely emitted light so they could easily
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.19,0:55:50.79,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,be spotted by players at night time for the April Fools event.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:51.09,0:55:53.57,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过看着箱子发光  还是感觉怪怪的
Dialogue: 2,0:55:51.09,0:55:53.57,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It still looks weird seeing a chest emit light though,
Dialogue: 1,0:55:53.63,0:55:54.33,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我没法撒谎
Dialogue: 2,0:55:53.63,0:55:54.33,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I can't lie.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:54.43,0:55:57.01,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你在Alpha阶段玩过我的世界
Dialogue: 2,0:55:54.43,0:55:57.01,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you played Minecraft during the alpha phase,
Dialogue: 1,0:55:57.07,0:56:03.03,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你在Alpha阶段玩过我的世界  肯定记得那个永远无法点击的“教程世界”按钮
Dialogue: 2,0:55:57.07,0:56:00.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you'll definitely remember the play tutorial world button
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.40,0:56:03.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that you could never even select and play.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:03.35,0:56:08.31,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 不知为何教程按钮总是灰的  这给它增添了不少神秘感
Dialogue: 2,0:56:03.35,0:56:05.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, for some reason the tutorial button
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.92,0:56:08.31,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,was always greyed out which made it quite mysterious,
Dialogue: 1,0:56:08.49,0:56:11.25,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但这也让我特别烦躁  因为我超想看看教程世界长什么样
Dialogue: 2,0:56:08.49,0:56:11.25,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but I also found it really annoying because I wanted to see what it looked like.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:11.45,0:56:15.65,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,拜托 主机版玩家明明就有那么多教程地图
Dialogue: 2,0:56:11.45,0:56:15.65,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, come on man, Minecraft console players had many tutorial worlds.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:16.11,0:56:20.71,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这就不得不提主机版的教程世界了
Dialogue: 2,0:56:16.11,0:56:20.71,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This leads me to talking about the tutorial worlds on the Minecraft console edition.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:21.13,0:56:23.85,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你是主机版的老玩家
Dialogue: 2,0:56:21.13,0:56:23.85,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So if you were a veteran player for the console edition,
Dialogue: 1,0:56:24.03,0:56:28.69,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,肯定记得第一个教程世界  来自Title Update 1版本
Dialogue: 2,0:56:24.03,0:56:28.69,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'll definitely remember the very first tutorial world from title update 1.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:29.13,0:56:31.67,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个世界包含教学区域
Dialogue: 2,0:56:29.13,0:56:31.67,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This world included a tutorial section,
Dialogue: 1,0:56:31.95,0:56:36.19,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,两座村庄 一座灯塔  还有那个臭名昭著的带图书馆的城堡
Dialogue: 2,0:56:31.95,0:56:36.19,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,two villages, a lighthouse structure and the infamous castle with a library.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:36.61,0:56:41.15,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,更别提从高空俯瞰时  那个标志性的巨大Minecraft标志
Dialogue: 2,0:56:36.61,0:56:41.15,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,And let's not forget that huge iconic Minecraft logo seen from above.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:41.25,0:56:42.91,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,简直美炸了
Dialogue: 2,0:56:41.25,0:56:42.91,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It's just beautiful man.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:43.31,0:56:48.07,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,老玩家们还会记得  Title Update 3版本的教程世界
Dialogue: 2,0:56:43.31,0:56:48.07,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The next tutorial world veterans will remember is the world from title update 3.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:48.55,0:56:55.13,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个教程世界与TU1版本非常相似  只不过新增了一些隐藏彩蛋
Dialogue: 2,0:56:48.55,0:56:51.93,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now this tutorial world is very similar to the TU1 
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.93,0:56:55.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,tutorial world except it included additional secrets.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:55.69,0:57:00.99,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这些彩蛋包括世界标志上的拉杆  能激活一个下界传送门
Dialogue: 2,0:56:55.69,0:57:00.99,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,These secrets include a lever on the Minecraft world logo that would reveal a nether portal,
Dialogue: 1,0:57:01.29,0:57:09.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,城堡旁还有一条水下萤石隧道  通向藏着钻石工具和盔甲的宝箱
Dialogue: 2,0:57:01.29,0:57:05.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,as well as having an underwater glowstone tunnel by the castle that
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.48,0:57:09.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,would lead to a chest containing diamond tools and armour.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:09.15,0:57:14.05,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,接下来  老玩家们一定记得Title Update 5的教程世界
Dialogue: 2,0:57:09.15,0:57:14.05,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Next up, veteran players are sure to remember the tutorial world for title update 5.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:14.53,0:57:21.01,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,TU5版本新增了冲刺和进食教程  因为这两个功能  正是在这个版本中加入游戏的
Dialogue: 2,0:57:14.53,0:57:18.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now the TU5 world added a tutorial for sprinting and
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.66,0:57:21.01,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,eating since they were both added in this version of Minecraft.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:21.51,0:57:23.01,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你还将看到三座村庄
Dialogue: 2,0:57:21.51,0:57:23.01,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You'd also get three villages,
Dialogue: 1,0:57:23.27,0:57:25.47,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,一座山巅要塞  最棒的是
Dialogue: 2,0:57:23.27,0:57:25.47,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a mountain fortress and best of all,
Dialogue: 1,0:57:25.57,0:57:26.99,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,唱片寻宝任务
Dialogue: 2,0:57:25.57,0:57:26.99,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the music disc quest.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:27.27,0:57:34.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个任务让玩家能在世界中  搜寻12个不同的宝箱  每个宝箱里都藏着一张独特的音乐唱片
Dialogue: 2,0:57:27.27,0:57:30.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This quest pretty much allowed players to search the world
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.06,0:57:34.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,for 12 different chests that would each contain a different music disc.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:34.11,0:57:37.97,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但这些就是主机版  曾经存在过的部分教程世界
Dialogue: 2,0:57:34.11,0:57:37.97,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But yeah, those are some of the tutorial worlds that were on console edition,
Dialogue: 1,0:57:38.17,0:57:39.99,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但如果你想了解其他教程世界的详情
Dialogue: 2,0:57:38.17,0:57:39.99,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but if you want a video on the rest of them,
Dialogue: 1,0:57:40.21,0:57:41.37,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,请在评论区告诉我
Dialogue: 2,0:57:40.21,0:57:41.37,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then let me know in the comments.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:41.83,0:57:44.09,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你玩过我的世界beta
Dialogue: 2,0:57:41.83,0:57:44.09,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you played Minecraft in the beta days,
Dialogue: 1,0:57:44.15,0:57:50.71,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你可能还记得  动物在水中游动时  光照效果会莫名其妙出bug的情形
Dialogue: 2,0:57:44.15,0:57:47.07,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you might remember when the lighting on animals
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.07,0:57:50.71,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,would just sort of bug out when they were swimming around in water.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:51.17,0:57:54.97,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,比如这些猪在水中上下浮动时
Dialogue: 2,0:57:51.17,0:57:54.97,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,For example, these pigs are bobbing up and down in the water,
Dialogue: 1,0:57:55.13,0:57:58.13,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但它们身上的纹理  却不断变成更暗的色调
Dialogue: 2,0:57:55.13,0:57:58.13,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but their texture keeps changing to a darker shade,
Dialogue: 1,0:57:58.23,0:58:00.11,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看起来相当有趣
Dialogue: 2,0:57:58.23,0:58:00.11,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which looked very interesting.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:00.65,0:58:02.87,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,曾经的雨声效果
Dialogue: 2,0:58:00.65,0:58:02.87,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The old sounds for rain.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:03.13,0:58:04.49,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你是个老玩家
Dialogue: 2,0:58:03.13,0:58:04.49,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you're a veteran player,
Dialogue: 1,0:58:04.61,0:58:10.19,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你一定记得旧版雨声  简直震耳欲聋
Dialogue: 2,0:58:04.61,0:58:10.19,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you're sure to remember the old sounds for rain as it was just ear piercingly loud,
Dialogue: 1,0:58:10.79,0:58:12.91,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,听听看 做好心理准备
Dialogue: 2,0:58:10.79,0:58:12.91,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Take a listen and prepare your ears.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:16.86,0:58:22.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,接下来 我要展示几个老玩家绝对会记得的我的世界种子
Dialogue: 2,0:58:16.86,0:58:19.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Next up, I'm going to be showing some Minecraft seeds
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.42,0:58:22.11,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that veteran players will most definitely remember.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:22.44,0:58:29.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我们清单上的第一个种子  是个臭名昭著的种子  仅在Minecraft 1.7和1.8版本中有效
Dialogue: 2,0:58:22.44,0:58:25.21,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The first seed we have on our list is an infamous seed
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.21,0:58:29.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that only worked in Minecraft versions 1.7 and 1.8.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:29.30,0:58:32.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,现在要说的这个种子  就是著名的4号种子
Dialogue: 2,0:58:29.30,0:58:32.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now the seed I'm talking about is seed number four.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:32.56,0:58:35.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以当你用4号种子创建世界时
Dialogue: 2,0:58:32.56,0:58:35.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So upon creating the world with seed number four,
Dialogue: 1,0:58:35.34,0:58:39.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你会出生在一个布满树木的小岛上
Dialogue: 2,0:58:35.34,0:58:39.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'll be greeted by a small island containing lots of trees,
Dialogue: 1,0:58:39.24,0:58:41.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,几头绵羊  和一个孤零零的洞穴入口
Dialogue: 2,0:58:39.24,0:58:41.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,some sheep, and a single cave entrance.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:41.94,0:58:43.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当你进入这个洞穴入口  
Dialogue: 2,0:58:41.94,0:58:43.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now if you enter the cave entrance,
Dialogue: 1,0:58:43.84,0:58:49.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,立刻就会看到要塞结构  末地传送门就在附近  
Dialogue: 2,0:58:43.84,0:58:49.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'll instantly be greeted by a stronghold structure that also has the end portal nearby.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:49.70,0:58:55.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这意味着你获得了一个超酷的生存岛种子  岛上只有一座要塞  
Dialogue: 2,0:58:49.70,0:58:55.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This pretty much meant you had a really cool survival island seed containing only a stronghold,
Dialogue: 1,0:58:55.48,0:58:58.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这在当年给玩家带来了独特的挑战  
Dialogue: 2,0:58:55.48,0:58:58.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,giving the player a very unique challenge back in the day.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:58.64,0:59:00.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,总之 如果你记得4号种子  
Dialogue: 2,0:58:58.64,0:59:00.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Anyways, if you remember seed number four,
Dialogue: 1,0:59:00.74,0:59:02.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是个老玩家  
Dialogue: 2,0:59:00.74,0:59:02.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you're definitely a veteran player.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:03.16,0:59:10.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,下一个老玩家可能记得的种子  能让你在出生点就获得15颗钻石  
Dialogue: 2,0:59:03.16,0:59:05.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The next seed veteran players might remember
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.90,0:59:10.19,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,was a seed that allowed you to have 15 diamonds at your spawn point.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:10.50,0:59:16.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个种子就是一串数字  仅在1.2到1.5版本有效  
Dialogue: 2,0:59:10.50,0:59:16.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So the seed is just a bunch of numbers and it only works from version 1.2 to 1.5.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:16.66,0:59:17.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,创建世界后  
Dialogue: 2,0:59:16.66,0:59:17.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Upon creating the world,
Dialogue: 1,0:59:17.96,0:59:21.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你会出生在丛林生物群系  旁边紧挨着沙漠群系
Dialogue: 2,0:59:17.96,0:59:21.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'll be greeted by a jungle biome with a desert biome right next to it.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:22.14,0:59:27.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,从出生点出发走大约一百格  很快就能发现沙漠神殿和沙漠村庄
Dialogue: 2,0:59:22.14,0:59:24.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Travel about a hundred blocks from spawn and you'll
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.64,0:59:27.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,quickly come across a desert temple and a desert village.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:28.44,0:59:31.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,沙漠神殿的宝箱里慷慨地藏着六颗钻石
Dialogue: 2,0:59:28.44,0:59:31.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The desert temple chest contained a generous six diamonds,
Dialogue: 1,0:59:31.54,0:59:33.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但更棒的是
Dialogue: 2,0:59:31.54,0:59:33.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but it got even better than that.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:33.66,0:59:36.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 如果玩家检查村庄铁匠铺的箱子
Dialogue: 2,0:59:33.66,0:59:36.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, if the player checked the blacksmith chest in the village,
Dialogue: 1,0:59:36.98,0:59:38.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你还能再找到九颗钻石
Dialogue: 2,0:59:36.98,0:59:38.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'd find nine more diamonds,
Dialogue: 1,0:59:38.90,0:59:40.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,总计能拿到15颗钻石
Dialogue: 2,0:59:38.90,0:59:40.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,giving you a grand total of 15.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:41.24,0:59:46.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当年这个钻石种子在玩家中非常流行  你大概能明白为什么
Dialogue: 2,0:59:41.24,0:59:44.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now this diamond seed was very popular among players
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.56,0:59:46.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,back in the day and you could probably see why.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:47.12,0:59:49.22,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界的早期版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:59:47.12,0:59:49.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:59:49.52,0:59:52.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在1.2到1.6版本之间
Dialogue: 2,0:59:49.52,0:59:52.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,between versions 1.2 and 1.6,
Dialogue: 1,0:59:52.48,0:59:53.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,最独特的种子之一
Dialogue: 2,0:59:52.48,0:59:53.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,one of the most unique,
Dialogue: 1,0:59:53.82,0:59:57.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,社区发现了一个前所未见的种子  
Dialogue: 2,0:59:53.82,0:59:57.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,never seen before seeds was discovered by the community.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:57.36,1:00:01.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我说的这个种子名为“Dossier”
Dialogue: 2,0:59:57.36,1:00:01.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now the seed I'm of course talking about is a seed known as Dossier.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:01.94,1:00:03.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,使用这个种子生成世界时  
Dialogue: 2,1:00:01.94,1:00:03.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So upon spawning in with the seed,
Dialogue: 1,1:00:03.96,1:00:07.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你会出生在平原生物群系 旁边就有个村庄  
Dialogue: 2,1:00:03.96,1:00:07.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'll be greeted by a plains biome containing a village.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:08.20,1:00:10.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但就在村庄旁边  
Dialogue: 2,1:00:08.20,1:00:10.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, next to said village,
Dialogue: 1,1:00:10.24,1:00:13.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,水中矗立着一座石砖建筑  
Dialogue: 2,1:00:10.24,1:00:13.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,there is a stone brick structure that lies within the water.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:13.98,1:00:19.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这其实是末地传送门房间的入口  通常要塞里才会有这种结构  
Dialogue: 2,1:00:13.98,1:00:16.67,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now this structure was actually the entrance
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.66,1:00:19.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,to the end portal room that's found within strongholds.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:20.14,1:00:23.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 这里没有完整的要塞可供探索  
Dialogue: 2,1:00:20.14,1:00:23.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, there's no stronghold structure to explore,
Dialogue: 1,1:00:23.28,1:00:27.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,只有一个孤零零的末地传送门房间  被海水包围着  
Dialogue: 2,1:00:23.28,1:00:27.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,just a singular end portal room surrounded by the ocean.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:27.30,1:00:28.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你还记得这个种子
Dialogue: 2,1:00:27.30,1:00:28.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now if you remember this seed,
Dialogue: 1,1:00:29.02,1:00:33.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你真是幸运 体验到了前所未有的奇观  
Dialogue: 2,1:00:29.02,1:00:33.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you were very lucky to experience something that had never really been seen before.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:34.22,1:00:34.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,峡谷  
Dialogue: 2,1:00:34.22,1:00:34.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Ravines.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:34.96,1:00:35.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我们都遇到过  
Dialogue: 2,1:00:34.96,1:00:35.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,We've all found one.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:36.12,1:00:37.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,通常里面有些铁矿  
Dialogue: 2,1:00:36.12,1:00:37.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Usually they'll contain some iron,
Dialogue: 1,1:00:38.18,1:00:40.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,煤矿 或者从天而降的苦力怕  
Dialogue: 2,1:00:38.18,1:00:40.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,some coal, or a creeper falling on top of you.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:41.12,1:00:43.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但在早期版本中  
Dialogue: 2,1:00:41.12,1:00:43.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,1:00:44.34,1:00:51.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,1.2到1.6版本有个种子  峡谷会给玩家送上大礼包  
Dialogue: 2,1:00:44.34,1:00:51.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a seed existed during versions 1.2 to 1.6 where a ravine would hand everything to the player.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:51.38,1:00:58.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没开玩笑 用屏幕上这个种子创建世界  出生点就会遇到这个传奇峡谷  
Dialogue: 2,1:00:51.38,1:00:54.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm not joking, creating a world with the seed on screen
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.76,1:00:58.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,would bless the player with this infamous ravine at spawn.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:58.46,1:01:04.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它之所以出名  是因为同时生成了要塞和废弃矿井  
Dialogue: 2,1:00:58.46,1:01:04.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now this ravine was famous due to being generated with both a stronghold and a mineshaft.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:04.70,1:01:06.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看看这场景
Dialogue: 2,1:01:04.70,1:01:06.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean just look at this man,
Dialogue: 1,1:01:06.68,1:01:10.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,要塞悬在峡谷顶部  而矿井深藏谷底
Dialogue: 2,1:01:06.68,1:01:10.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the stronghold's located near the top while the mineshaft is near the bottom.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:10.86,1:01:15.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,更惊人的是  这条峡谷深得离谱  裸露在外的钻石多达15颗
Dialogue: 2,1:01:10.86,1:01:15.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,On top of that, the ravine was deep enough to contain up to 15 exposed diamonds,
Dialogue: 1,1:01:16.12,1:01:17.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但我敢肯定实际远不止这些
Dialogue: 2,1:01:16.12,1:01:17.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but I'm pretty sure there was more than that.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:18.12,1:01:21.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但没错 如果你当年用过这个种子
Dialogue: 2,1:01:18.12,1:01:21.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But yeah, if you recognize using this Minecraft seed back in the day,
Dialogue: 1,1:01:22.06,1:01:24.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那一定要在评论区告诉我
Dialogue: 2,1:01:22.06,1:01:24.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then be sure to let me know in the comments.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:24.28,1:01:32.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,接下来要介绍的这个种子  同样是beta时期的传奇种子  它叫做“worstseedever”
Dialogue: 2,1:01:24.28,1:01:28.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The next seed we have on our list is another infamous seed
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.16,1:01:32.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,from the beta days of Minecraft that was called the worst seed ever.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:32.60,1:01:35.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,尽管被称为史上最烂种子
Dialogue: 2,1:01:32.60,1:01:35.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now despite being called the worst seed ever,
Dialogue: 1,1:01:35.26,1:01:38.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个种子当年却因过于优秀  而风靡一时
Dialogue: 2,1:01:35.26,1:01:38.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it was very popular back in the day for how good it was.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:38.12,1:01:38.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,谁能想到呢
Dialogue: 2,1:01:38.12,1:01:38.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Who would have thought?
Dialogue: 1,1:01:38.90,1:01:40.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以当你在这个世界出生时
Dialogue: 2,1:01:38.90,1:01:40.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So upon spawning into the world,
Dialogue: 1,1:01:40.64,1:01:44.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,映入眼帘的  就是裸露在外的僵尸刷怪笼地牢
Dialogue: 2,1:01:40.64,1:01:44.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you're greeted by an exposed dungeon with a zombie spawner,
Dialogue: 1,1:01:44.32,1:01:47.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这在我的世界beta中  可是极其罕见的
Dialogue: 2,1:01:44.32,1:01:47.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which were very hard to come by in Minecraft beta.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:47.42,1:01:49.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,仔细看这个地牢
Dialogue: 2,1:01:47.42,1:01:49.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you look closer at the dungeon itself,
Dialogue: 1,1:01:49.70,1:01:53.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你会发现地牢内部有个缺口  直通地下洞穴系统
Dialogue: 2,1:01:49.70,1:01:53.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'll notice there's a hole within it that leads into a cave system.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:53.52,1:01:59.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,沿着洞穴一路向下探索  你会发现错综复杂的洞穴网络  还有储量惊人的钻石矿脉
Dialogue: 2,1:01:53.52,1:01:56.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Keep following the cave all the way down and you'll
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.10,1:01:59.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,find multiple cave systems and a generous amount of diamonds.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:00.30,1:02:03.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,要知道 这些宝藏  全都在出生点正下方
Dialogue: 2,1:02:00.30,1:02:03.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Keep in mind this was all found below your spawn point,
Dialogue: 1,1:02:03.30,1:02:06.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以啊 这绝对称不上  什么史上最烂种子
Dialogue: 2,1:02:03.30,1:02:06.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,so yeah, it was definitely not the worst seed ever.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:06.76,1:02:10.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你是个资深我的世界玩家  又痴迷于探索自然生成建筑
Dialogue: 2,1:02:06.76,1:02:10.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you're a Minecraft veteran and a lover of generated structures,
Dialogue: 1,1:02:10.64,1:02:15.22,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你一定还记得  1.6版本时期  那个风靡一时的传奇种子
Dialogue: 2,1:02:10.64,1:02:15.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you might remember a seed that was most popular during the 1.6 update.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:15.54,1:02:18.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个种子最神奇之处在于  同时生成了两座裸露的要塞
Dialogue: 2,1:02:15.54,1:02:18.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So the seed contained two exposed strongholds,
Dialogue: 1,1:02:18.46,1:02:22.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,一座沙漠神殿  外加一个村庄  全都集中在出生点附近
Dialogue: 2,1:02:18.46,1:02:22.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a desert pyramid, and a village all within your spawn point,
Dialogue: 1,1:02:22.24,1:02:23.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这配置简直完美
Dialogue: 2,1:02:22.24,1:02:23.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which was very lovely.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:23.62,1:02:26.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,就战利品而言 这个种子其实也相当不错
Dialogue: 2,1:02:23.62,1:02:26.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,As loot goes, it's not that bad either.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:26.22,1:02:27.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,地牢里藏着马铠
Dialogue: 2,1:02:26.22,1:02:27.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The dungeon contained horse armor,
Dialogue: 1,1:02:28.14,1:02:29.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,命名牌  还有唱片
Dialogue: 2,1:02:28.14,1:02:29.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,name tags, and music discs,
Dialogue: 1,1:02:30.02,1:02:32.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而沙漠神殿里  则藏着钻石和绿宝石
Dialogue: 2,1:02:30.02,1:02:32.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,whereas the pyramid had diamonds and emeralds.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:32.62,1:02:35.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 如果你们中有人认出了这个标志性种子
Dialogue: 2,1:02:32.62,1:02:35.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, if any of you recognize this iconic seed,
Dialogue: 1,1:02:35.50,1:02:36.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,请在评论区告诉我
Dialogue: 2,1:02:35.50,1:02:36.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then let me know in the comments.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:37.40,1:02:38.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,种子404
Dialogue: 2,1:02:37.40,1:02:38.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Seed 404.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:38.86,1:02:41.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,要么你记忆犹新  要么你闻所未闻
Dialogue: 2,1:02:38.86,1:02:41.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You either remember it or have never heard of it.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:41.40,1:02:50.91,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,种子404是Beta时期的一个我的世界种子  因社区制作的一项名为404挑战的玩法而爆红
Dialogue: 2,1:02:41.40,1:02:44.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So Seed 404 was a Minecraft seed in the beta days
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.74,1:02:47.47,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that became extremely popular due to the community
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.47,1:02:50.91,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,creating a challenge known as the 404 challenge.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:50.98,1:02:56.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这项挑战的目标是在首个游戏日内  尽可能多地收集资源
Dialogue: 2,1:02:50.98,1:02:54.35,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The aim of the challenge was to spend your first Minecraft day
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.35,1:02:56.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,collating as many resources as you can.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:57.00,1:02:59.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,然而 当夜幕开始降临
Dialogue: 2,1:02:57.00,1:02:59.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, as soon as night time began to fall,
Dialogue: 1,1:02:59.52,1:03:03.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你必须前往出生点附近  那片显眼的砂砾区域
Dialogue: 2,1:02:59.52,1:03:03.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you had to walk over to this big patch of gravel that's found within the spawn point.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:04.24,1:03:12.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,然后你要挖开砂砾  看着其余部分塌陷  露出下方深不见底的黑暗之中
Dialogue: 2,1:03:04.24,1:03:07.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Then you had to break the gravel and watch
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.06,1:03:12.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the rest of it fall as it reveals a deep cave system that plunges into darkness.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:12.96,1:03:16.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,换句话说  这片砂砾之下  隐藏着令人毛骨悚然的洞穴
Dialogue: 2,1:03:12.96,1:03:16.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In other words, the gravel revealed a very scary cave.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:16.36,1:03:23.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玩家必须进入这个残酷的洞穴系统  在黑暗中尽可能长久地生存下去
Dialogue: 2,1:03:16.36,1:03:20.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The player then had to enter the unforgiving cave system
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.00,1:03:23.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and try to survive down there for as long as possible.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:23.70,1:03:25.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,更严苛的是  禁止使用火把照明  
Dialogue: 2,1:03:23.70,1:03:25.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You weren't allowed to use torches either,
Dialogue: 1,1:03:25.92,1:03:28.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这使得洞穴探索  变得举步维艰  
Dialogue: 2,1:03:25.92,1:03:28.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,making it very difficult to see within the caves.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:29.12,1:03:32.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 若你还记得  Beta时期的404挑战  
Dialogue: 2,1:03:29.12,1:03:32.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, if you remember the 404 challenge from the beta days,
Dialogue: 1,1:03:32.94,1:03:35.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是  不折不扣的元老级玩家
Dialogue: 2,1:03:32.94,1:03:35.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you're definitely an old school player.
